msgid "Map"
msgstr "Zemljevid"

msgid "For shops"
msgstr "Za trgovine"

msgid "Where to pay in bitcoin"
msgstr "Kje plačati z bitcoinom"

msgid "Your shops"
msgstr "Vaše trgovine"

msgid "Open register"
msgstr "Odprite blagajno"

msgid "No shops yet."
msgstr "Trgovin še ni."

msgid "Add a shop"
msgstr "Dodajte trgovino"

msgid "Save"
msgstr "Shranite"

msgid "Never enter your seed phrase or a private key here."
msgstr "Sem nikoli ne vpisujte obnovitvenih besed (seed) ali zasebnega ključa."

msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "Prekličite"

msgid "New payment"
msgstr "Novo plačilo"

msgid "Payment received"
msgstr "Plačilo prejeto"

msgid "Payment expired"
msgstr "Plačilo poteklo"

msgid "name"
msgstr "ime trgovine"

msgid "description"
msgstr "opis"

msgid "address"
msgstr "naslov"

msgid "Lightning address"
msgstr "Lightning naslov"

msgid ""
"This is a private key: never share it. Use the public key of your wallet."
msgstr ""
"To je zasebni ključ: nikoli ga ne dajte nikomur. Tukaj potrebujemo javni "
"ključ."

msgid ""
"This looks like a seed phrase: never share it. Use the public key of your "
"wallet."
msgstr ""
"To so videti skrivne besede denarnice (seed): nikoli jih ne dajte nikomur. "
"Tukaj potrebujemo javni ključ."

msgid "city"
msgstr "kraj"

msgid "discount for bitcoin payments (%)"
msgstr "popust za plačilo z bitcoinom (%)"

msgid "Skip to content"
msgstr "Na vsebino"

msgid "Menu"
msgstr "Meni"

msgid "Explore"
msgstr "Raziščite"

msgid "This page is not here"
msgstr "Te strani ni"

msgid "The address may have changed."
msgstr "Naslov se je morda spremenil."

msgid "Back to the home page"
msgstr "Nazaj na domačo stran"

msgid "places on the map."
msgstr "krajev na zemljevidu."

msgid "Search"
msgstr "Iskanje"

msgid "Only with a discount"
msgstr "Samo s popustom"

msgid "Near me"
msgstr "V bližini"

msgid "No shops match your search."
msgstr "Nobena trgovina ne ustreza iskanju."

msgid "if you pay in bitcoin"
msgstr "če plačate z bitcoinom"

msgid "Website"
msgstr "Spletno mesto"

msgid "Get directions"
msgstr "Navodila za pot"

msgid "Bitcoin accepted here"
msgstr "Tukaj sprejemamo bitcoin"

msgid "Print"
msgstr "Natisnite"

msgid "Printable sign"
msgstr "Tabla za tiskanje"

msgid "Clear"
msgstr "Izbrišite"

msgid "Waiting for payment"
msgstr "Čakanje na plačilo"

msgid "Print receipt"
msgstr "Natisnite potrdilo"

msgid "Nostr public key (hex)"
msgstr "javni ključ Nostr (hex)"

msgid "Nostr name"
msgstr "ime na Nostru"

msgid "Telegram chat for notifications"
msgstr "klepet v Telegramu za obvestila o plačilih"

msgid "recovery email"
msgstr "e-pošta za obnovitev dostopa"

msgid "Send link"
msgstr "Pošljite povezavo"

msgid "Sign in with email"
msgstr "Prijava z e-pošto"

msgid ""
"We sent a confirmation link to {email}: the address changes when you click "
"it."
msgstr ""
"Na {email} smo poslali povezavo za potrditev: naslov se spremeni, ko jo "
"odprete."

msgid "This Lightning address cannot be reached from the internet."
msgstr "Ta Lightning naslov ni dosegljiv z interneta."

msgid "Public: it appears on the shop page."
msgstr "Javno: prikaže se na strani trgovine."

msgid "Only if you use Nostr: your public key in hex format, not the npub."
msgstr "Samo če uporabljate Nostr: vaš javni ključ v obliki hex, ne npub."

msgid "The name for your Nostr address on this site."
msgstr "Ime za vaš naslov Nostr na tem spletnem mestu."

msgid ""
"We send a link to confirm it. It is used to get back into your account, and "
"to tell you if your register stops taking Lightning payments."
msgstr ""
"Poslali vam bomo povezavo za potrditev. Z njo se lahko znova prijavite v "
"svoj profil, nanjo pa vas tudi obvestimo, če blagajna ne sprejema več plačil "
"prek Lightninga."

msgid "Your email"
msgstr "Vaš e-poštni naslov"

msgid "64 hexadecimal characters."
msgstr "64 šestnajstiških znakov."

msgid "A chat number or a @name."
msgstr "Številka klepeta ali @ime."

msgid "latitude"
msgstr "zemljepisna širina"

msgid "longitude"
msgstr "zemljepisna dolžina"

msgid "website"
msgstr "spletno mesto"

msgid "Payment cancelled"
msgstr "Plačilo preklicano"

msgid ""
"Cancel this sale? If the customer has already paid, you will have to refund "
"them."
msgstr ""
"Prekličete to prodajo? Če je stranka že plačala, ji boste morali denar "
"vrniti."

msgid "One last step"
msgstr "Še zadnji korak"

msgid "Continue"
msgstr "Nadaljujte"

msgid "This link has expired or was already used: ask for a new one."
msgstr ""
"Ta povezava je potekla ali je bila že uporabljena: spodaj zahtevajte novo."

msgid "This email is already used by another account."
msgstr "Ta e-poštni naslov že uporablja drug profil."

msgid ""
"This account signs in from the administration, with its password: not by "
"email."
msgstr ""
"Ta profil se prijavlja prek administracije, s svojim geslom: ne z e-pošto."

msgid ""
"Suspended: not on the map or in the lists. Register and payments keep "
"working."
msgstr ""
"Začasno ustavljeno: ni na zemljevidu ne na seznamih. Blagajna in plačila "
"delujejo naprej."

msgid "Suspended: not on the map or in the lists."
msgstr "Začasno ustavljeno: ni na zemljevidu ne na seznamih."

msgid "Not on the map or in the lists."
msgstr "Ni na zemljevidu ne na seznamih."

msgid "Not on the map: the position is missing."
msgstr "Ni na zemljevidu: manjka lokacija."

msgid "Add it"
msgstr "Dodajte jo"

msgid "No register: payments for this shop are not set up on this site."
msgstr ""
"Ni blagajne: plačila te trgovine na tem spletnem mestu niso nastavljena."

msgid "Edit"
msgstr "Uredite"

msgid "Delete this shop?"
msgstr "Izbrišete to trgovino?"

msgid ""
"The register, the shop page and the sales list stop working. The printed "
"sign leads nowhere. Money already received stays in your wallet."
msgstr ""
"Blagajna, stran trgovine in seznam prodaj prenehajo delovati. Natisnjena "
"tabla ne vodi nikamor več. Denar, ki ste ga že prejeli, ostane v vaši "
"denarnici."

msgid "Delete"
msgstr "Izbrišite"

msgid "Keep it"
msgstr "Obdržite"

msgid "Page expired"
msgstr "Stran je potekla"

msgid "Go back, reload the page and try again."
msgstr "Pojdite nazaj, znova naložite stran in poskusite še enkrat."

msgid "How you want to get paid"
msgstr "Kako želite sprejemati plačila"

msgid "Not sure? Read the guide."
msgstr "Ne veste, kaj vpisati? Preberite navodila."

msgid "Advanced options"
msgstr "Napredne možnosti"

msgid "Where the money goes"
msgstr "Kam gre denar"

msgid "Delete this shop"
msgstr "Izbrišite to trgovino"

msgid "Only Lightning"
msgstr "Samo Lightning"

msgid "All stops"
msgstr "Vse"

msgid "Centre"
msgstr "Središče"

msgid "shown"
msgstr "prikazanih"

msgctxt "one place"
msgid "shown"
msgstr "prikazan"

msgid "Type the cents too: 1, 5, 0 makes 1.50."
msgstr "Vpišite tudi cente: 1, 5, 0 je 1,50."

msgid "Type the amount first."
msgstr "Najprej vpišite znesek."

msgid "Code for the customer to scan"
msgstr "Koda, ki jo stranka skenira"

msgid "The code does not scan? Show it as text"
msgstr "Koda se ne prebere? Prikažite jo kot besedilo"

msgid "Something needs fixing: look at the messages in red."
msgstr "Nekaj je treba popraviti: poglejte sporočila v rdeči barvi."

msgid "Your shop"
msgstr "Vaša trgovina"

msgid "Where to find you"
msgstr "Kje vas najdejo"

msgid "I cannot read your position: touch the place on the map."
msgstr "Vaše lokacije ne morem prebrati: tapnite mesto na zemljevidu."

msgid "Looking for your position..."
msgstr "Iščem vašo lokacijo ..."

msgid "I am in the shop: use my position"
msgstr "Sem v trgovini: uporabite mojo lokacijo"

msgid "Position chosen. Touch the map to move it."
msgstr "Lokacija izbrana. Tapnite zemljevid, da jo premaknete."

msgid "Type the coordinates"
msgstr "Vpišite koordinate"

msgid ""
"Is your shop already on the map? Do not add it again: write to <a "
"href=\"mailto:%(email)s\">%(email)s</a>."
msgstr ""
"Je vaša trgovina že na zemljevidu? Ne dodajajte je znova: pišite na <a "
"href=\"mailto:%(email)s\">%(email)s</a>."

msgid ""
"Is your shop already on the map? To update its details, write to <a "
"href=\"mailto:%(email)s\">%(email)s</a>."
msgstr ""
"Je vaša trgovina že na zemljevidu? Za posodobitev podatkov pišite na <a "
"href=\"mailto:%(email)s\">%(email)s</a>."

msgid ""
"Is this your shop? To update these details, write to <a href=\"mailto:%"
"(email)s\">%(email)s</a>."
msgstr ""
"Je to vaša trgovina? Za posodobitev teh podatkov pišite na <a href=\"mailto:%"
"(email)s\">%(email)s</a>."

msgid "Creating your shop..."
msgstr "Ustvarjam trgovino ..."

msgid "Create the shop"
msgstr "Ustvarite trgovino"

msgid "Saving..."
msgstr "Shranjujem ..."

msgid "Leave it at 0 if you do not offer one."
msgstr "Pustite 0, če ga ne ponujate."

msgid "This is not a Lightning address: it should look like name@provider.com."
msgstr "To ni Lightning naslov: biti mora v obliki ime@ponudnik.si."

msgid "Email to get back in"
msgstr "E-pošta za ponovno prijavo"

msgid "Your shop is ready."
msgstr "Vaša trgovina je pripravljena."

msgid "Code that opens the register"
msgstr "Koda, ki odpre blagajno"

msgid "Copy the link"
msgstr "Kopirajte povezavo"

msgid "Link copied"
msgstr "Povezava kopirana"

msgid "On the shop phone, add the register to the home screen from the phone's menu (⋮ on Android, Share on iPhone): it opens with one tap, like an app, with nothing to install."
msgstr "Na telefonu trgovine dodajte blagajno na začetni zaslon prek menija telefona (⋮ na Androidu, Deli na iPhonu): odpre se z enim dotikom, kot aplikacija, brez nameščanja."

msgid "Your account"
msgstr "Vaš profil"

msgid "Saved."
msgstr "Shranjeno."

msgid "Shop deleted."
msgstr "Trgovina izbrisana."

msgid "Your link to sign in"
msgstr "Vaša povezava za prijavo"

msgid "Open this link to sign in. It lasts 15 minutes and works once."
msgstr "Odprite to povezavo za prijavo. Velja 15 minut in deluje samo enkrat."

msgid "Confirm your email"
msgstr "Potrdite svoj e-poštni naslov"

msgid ""
"Open this link in the browser where you are signed in to the account that "
"asked for it, to confirm this email for that account. It lasts 15 minutes."
msgstr ""
"To povezavo odprite v brskalniku, v katerem ste prijavljeni s profilom, ki "
"jo je zahteval, da potrdite ta e-poštni naslov za ta profil. Velja 15 minut."

msgid ""
"Open this link in the browser where you are signed in to the account that "
"asked for it: only that account can confirm the email. If you did not ask "
"for it, ignore it: nothing changes."
msgstr ""
"To povezavo odprite v brskalniku, v katerem ste prijavljeni s profilom, ki "
"jo je zahteval: samo ta profil lahko potrdi e-poštni naslov. Če je niste "
"zahtevali vi, jo prezrite: nič se ne spremeni."

msgid "If you did not ask for it, ignore this email."
msgstr "Če tega niste zahtevali vi, prezrite to sporočilo."

msgid ""
"Email sent to %(email)s. Open your mail and tap the link: it lasts 15 "
"minutes. Not there? Look in the spam folder."
msgstr ""
"Sporočilo poslano na %(email)s. Odprite pošto in tapnite povezavo: velja 15 "
"minut. Ga ne najdete? Poglejte med neželeno pošto."

msgid "Nothing arrived? Ask again"
msgstr "Ni prišlo? Zahtevajte znova"

msgid "We send you a link: open it and you are in. No password."
msgstr "Pošljemo vam povezavo: odprete jo in ste prijavljeni. Brez gesla."

msgid "Press the button to finish."
msgstr "Za konec pritisnite gumb."

msgid "Code that opens the shop page"
msgstr "Koda, ki odpre stran trgovine"

msgid "Scan it to see the shop page. To pay, ask for the code at the till."
msgstr ""
"Skenirajte jo, da vidite stran trgovine. Za plačilo prosite za kodo pri "
"blagajni."

msgid "Accepts Lightning payments"
msgstr "Sprejema plačila Lightning"

msgid "Enter the shops area"
msgstr "Vstopite v območje za trgovine"

msgid "Or with your wallet"
msgstr "Ali z denarnico"

msgid "Code to sign in with the wallet"
msgstr "Koda za prijavo z denarnico"

msgid "Name, town or what they sell"
msgstr "Ime, kraj ali kaj prodajajo"

msgid "The list of shops did not load: reload the page."
msgstr "Seznam trgovin se ni naložil: znova naložite stran."

msgid "I cannot read your position: move the map by hand."
msgstr "Vaše lokacije ne morem prebrati: zemljevid premaknite s prstom."

msgid "The nearest shops are now first in the list."
msgstr "Zdaj so na seznamu najprej najbližje trgovine."

msgid "No password: we send you a link by email."
msgstr "Brez gesla: povezavo vam pošljemo po e-pošti."

msgid ""
"If your Lightning wallet supports login, scan the code or tap it: this page "
"opens by itself."
msgstr ""
"Če ima vaša Lightning denarnica funkcijo prijave, skenirajte kodo ali jo "
"tapnite: ta stran se odpre sama."

msgid "Or touch the place on the map."
msgstr "Ali tapnite mesto na zemljevidu."

msgid "More details: discount, description, contacts"
msgstr "Več podatkov: popust, opis, stiki"

msgid ""
"Try it: open the register and pay yourself a small amount from another "
"phone. Then print the sign."
msgstr ""
"Preizkusite: odprite blagajno in si z drugim telefonom plačajte majhen "
"znesek. Nato natisnite tablo."

msgid "The email could not be sent: try again in a few minutes."
msgstr "E-pošte ni bilo mogoče poslati: poskusite znova čez nekaj minut."

msgid ""
"It looks like an email: name@provider. You find it in your wallet, usually "
"under Receive. Phoenix addresses, the ones with the ₿ sign, do not work here."
msgstr ""
"Videti je kot e-poštni naslov: ime@ponudnik. Najdete ga v svoji denarnici, "
"običajno pod »Prejmi«. Naslovi Phoenix, tisti z znakom ₿, tukaj ne delujejo."

msgid ""
"This Lightning address does not answer: check it and try again. Phoenix "
"addresses, the ones with the ₿ sign, cannot be used here."
msgstr ""
"Ta Lightning naslov se ne odziva: preverite ga in poskusite znova. Naslovov "
"Phoenix, tistih z znakom ₿, tukaj ni mogoče uporabiti."

msgid ""
"This address can receive, but it does not tell the register when a payment "
"arrives. Use a wallet with a different Lightning address, or write to "
"{email}."
msgstr ""
"Ta naslov lahko prejema, vendar blagajni ne sporoči, kdaj plačilo prispe. "
"Uporabite denarnico z drugim Lightning naslovom ali pišite na {email}."

msgid ""
"This address uses BOLT12, like the ones from Phoenix, and this register "
"cannot read it. Use a wallet with a different Lightning address, or write to "
"{email}."
msgstr ""
"Ta naslov uporablja BOLT12, tako kot naslovi Phoenix, in ta blagajna ga ne "
"zna prebrati. Uporabite denarnico z drugim Lightning naslovom ali pišite na "
"{email}."

msgid "Show all the places"
msgstr "Prikažite vse kraje"

msgid "Back to note %d in the text"
msgstr "Nazaj na opombo %d v besedilu"

msgid "This name is already taken."
msgstr "To ime je že zasedeno."

msgid "Too many shops in a short time: wait a few minutes."
msgstr "Preveč trgovin v kratkem času: počakajte nekaj minut."

msgid "Once you are in, you go straight back to where you were."
msgstr "Ko se prijavite, se takoj vrnete tja, kjer ste bili."

msgid ""
"What you already told us is written in: check it and change anything you "
"like."
msgstr ""
"Kar ste nam že povedali, je vpisano tukaj: preverite in spremenite, kar "
"želite."

msgid "status"
msgstr "stanje"

msgid "place"
msgstr "kraj"

msgid "Email"
msgstr "E-pošta"

msgid "Historic · closes on %(date)s"
msgstr "Zgodovinsko · se zapre %(date)s"

msgid "Historic · closed on %(date)s"
msgstr "Zgodovinsko · zaprto %(date)s"

msgid "j F Y"
msgstr "j. F Y"

msgid "On the map with its own pin, not among the places to pay."
msgstr "Na zemljevidu s svojo oznako, ne med kraji za plačilo."

