msgstr "Knjižnica JavaScript za interaktivne zemljevide"

#, python-format
msgid "%(discount)s%% discount"
msgstr "%(discount)s %% popusta"

#, python-format
msgid "%(number)s places: zoom in"
msgstr "%(number)s krajev: povečajte"

msgid "Skip the map: go to the list"
msgstr "Preskočite zemljevid: na seznam"

msgid "Getting the exchange rate..."
msgstr "Pridobivam menjalni tečaj ..."

msgid "Asking your Lightning wallet for the invoice..."
msgstr "Vašo Lightning denarnico prosim za zahtevek za plačilo ..."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Exchange rate: {rate} ({sources})."
msgstr "Menjalni tečaj: {rate} ({sources})."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The two sources do not agree: {first} and {second}. Which rate do you want "
"to use?"
msgstr ""
"Viri se ne ujemajo: {first} in {second}. Kateri tečaj želite uporabiti?"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Only one source answers: {first}. Use this rate?"
msgstr "Odgovarja samo en vir: {first}. Uporabite ta tečaj?"

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"No source answers. The last good rate is {first}, from {age} ago. Use it?"
msgstr ""
"Noben vir ne odgovarja. Zadnji dobri tečaj je {first}, star {age}. Ga "
"uporabite?"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Use {rate}"
msgstr "Uporabite {rate}"

msgid "Your Lightning wallet does not accept this amount: too high or too low."
msgstr ""
"Vaša Lightning denarnica ne sprejme tega zneska: previsok ali prenizek."

msgid "Your Lightning wallet sent a wrong invoice: do not use it."
msgstr ""
"Vaša Lightning denarnica je poslala napačen zahtevek za plačilo: ne "
"uporabite ga."

msgid ""
"Cannot check the payment with your Lightning wallet right now: still trying."
msgstr ""
"Plačila trenutno ne morem preveriti z vašo Lightning denarnico: poskušam "
"naprej."

msgid "I see the payment in my wallet"
msgstr "Plačilo vidim v svoji denarnici"

msgid "Marked as paid by you"
msgstr "Kot plačano ste označili vi"

msgid "Waiting"
msgstr "V čakanju"

msgid "Not checked: look in your wallet"
msgstr "Ni preverjeno: poglejte v svojo denarnico"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "{count} min"
msgstr "{count} min"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "{count} h"
msgstr "{count} h"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Paid into {address}"
msgstr "Prejeto na {address}"

#, python-format
msgid "You are signing in as %(email)s."
msgstr "Prijavljate se kot %(email)s."

#, python-format
msgid "This email will get you back into your account: %(email)s."
msgstr ""
"S tem e-poštnim naslovom se boste znova prijavili v svoj profil: %(email)s."

msgid "Too many new accounts from here: try again later."
msgstr "Od tod preveč novih profilov: poskusite pozneje."

msgid "How to pay here"
msgstr "Kako plačate tukaj"

msgid "Ask to pay in bitcoin, with Lightning."
msgstr "Recite, da želite plačati z bitcoinom, prek Lightninga."

msgid ""
"Ask to pay in bitcoin. Here it is on-chain: your wallet has to send on-"
"chain, not with Lightning."
msgstr ""
"Recite, da želite plačati z bitcoinom. Tukaj se plača on-chain: vaša "
"denarnica mora poslati on-chain, ne prek Lightninga."

msgid "Ask to pay in bitcoin."
msgstr "Recite, da želite plačati z bitcoinom."

msgid ""
"Ask to pay in bitcoin: Lightning or on-chain, whichever your wallet uses."
msgstr ""
"Recite, da želite plačati z bitcoinom: prek Lightninga ali on-chain, kakor "
"zna vaša denarnica."

msgid "The till shows a QR code with the amount."
msgstr "Blagajna pokaže QR kodo z zneskom."

msgid "Scan it with your wallet, check the amount and confirm."
msgstr "Skenirajte jo z denarnico, preverite znesek in potrdite."

msgid ""
"Scan it with your wallet and confirm. With Lightning it takes a few seconds."
msgstr ""
"Skenirajte jo z denarnico in potrdite. Z Lightningom je to nekaj sekund."

msgid "Show at the till"
msgstr "Pokažite pri blagajni"

msgid "In our story"
msgstr "V naši zgodbi"

msgid "Nearby"
msgstr "V bližini"

#, python-format
msgid "%(distance)s, %(minutes)s min on foot"
msgstr "%(distance)s, %(minutes)s min peš"

msgid "I would like to pay in bitcoin."
msgstr "Želim plačati z bitcoinom."

msgid "I would like to pay in bitcoin, with Lightning."
msgstr "Želim plačati z bitcoinom, prek Lightninga."

#, python-format
msgid "With the %(discount)s%% discount for paying in bitcoin, thank you."
msgstr "S %(discount)s %% popusta za plačilo z bitcoinom, hvala."

msgid "Card for the till"
msgstr "Kartica za blagajno"

msgid "The first day: {done} of {total} done"
msgstr "Prvi dan: opravljeno {done} od {total}"

msgid "The first day: all done"
msgstr "Prvi dan: vse pripravljeno"

msgid "Done"
msgstr "Opravljeno"

msgid "To do"
msgstr "Za opraviti"

msgid "Not up to you"
msgstr "Ni odvisno od vas"

msgid "A sale has been paid: the register works."
msgstr "Prodaja je bila plačana: blagajna deluje."

msgid "Try the register"
msgstr "Preizkusite blagajno"

msgid "On the map"
msgstr "Na zemljevidu"

msgid "The sign and the card for the till"
msgstr "Tabla in kartica za blagajno"

msgid "Whoever works with you has the register"
msgstr "Vaši zaposleni imajo blagajno"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"Open the register and pay yourself a small amount from another phone, as a "
"customer would. When it says “%(paid)s”, the register works."
msgstr ""
"Odprite blagajno in si z drugega telefona plačajte majhen znesek, kot bi to "
"storila stranka. Ko piše »%(paid)s«, blagajna deluje."

msgid "Customers find the shop on the map."
msgstr "Stranke najdejo trgovino na zemljevidu."

msgid ""
"The position is missing: add it, and customers find the shop on the map."
msgstr ""
"Manjka lokacija: dodajte jo in stranke bodo trgovino našle na zemljevidu."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"The community has taken the shop off the map for now. To know why, write to "
"<a href=\"mailto:%(email)s\">%(email)s</a>."
msgstr ""
"Skupnost je trgovino za zdaj umaknila z zemljevida. Če želite izvedeti "
"zakaj, pišite na <a href=\"mailto:%(email)s\">%(email)s</a>."

msgid "The shop stays off the map and the lists, as agreed with the community."
msgstr ""
"Trgovina ostane zunaj zemljevida in seznamov, kot je dogovorjeno s "
"skupnostjo."

msgid "Printed. You can print them again whenever you like."
msgstr "Natisnjeno. Kadar koli ju lahko natisnete znova."

msgid ""
"Print the sign for the door or the counter, and the card for whoever stands "
"at the till."
msgstr ""
"Natisnite tablo za vrata ali pult in kartico za tistega, ki je pri blagajni."

msgid "Done. When someone new starts, give them the register and the card."
msgstr "Opravljeno. Ko pride kdo nov, mu dajte blagajno in kartico."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"Whoever works with you opens the register on their phone: use “%(handover)s” "
"here below. Nobody works with you? Mark it done anyway."
msgstr ""
"Vaši zaposleni odprejo blagajno na svojem telefonu: uporabite »%(handover)s« "
"spodaj. Nimate zaposlenih? Vseeno označite kot opravljeno."

msgid "Untick"
msgstr "Odstranite kljukico"

msgid "Mark as done"
msgstr "Označite kot opravljeno"

msgid "At the till"
msgstr "Pri blagajni"

msgid ""
"Print it on an A4 sheet and keep it at the till, next to the shop phone. "
"Whoever stands there finds everything on it, even without knowing anything "
"about bitcoin."
msgstr ""
"Natisnite jo na list A4 in jo imejte pri blagajni, ob telefonu trgovine. "
"Kdor je za pultom, na njej najde vse, tudi če o bitcoinu ne ve ničesar."

msgid "Language of the card:"
msgstr "Jezik kartice:"

msgid "Card without the register code"
msgstr "Kartica brez kode blagajne"

msgid "Add the register code, for whoever works with you"
msgstr "Dodajte kodo blagajne za svoje zaposlene"

msgid ""
"With the code on it, keep the card on your side of the counter: whoever "
"scans it opens the register."
msgstr ""
"S kodo naj bo kartica na vaši strani pulta: kdor jo skenira, odpre blagajno."

msgid "Bitcoin at the till"
msgstr "Bitcoin pri blagajni"

msgid ""
"The customer pays with an app on their phone, called a wallet. You only need "
"the register: the page that opens on the shop phone."
msgstr ""
"Stranka plača z aplikacijo na svojem telefonu, z denarnico. Vi potrebujete "
"samo blagajno: stran, ki se odpre na telefonu trgovine."

msgid "Taking a payment"
msgstr "Kako sprejmete plačilo"

msgid "Open the register on the shop phone."
msgstr "Odprite blagajno na telefonu trgovine."

#, python-format
msgid "Press OK. The register shows a code and “%(waiting)s”."
msgstr "Pritisnite OK. Blagajna pokaže kodo in »%(waiting)s«."

msgid ""
"Turn the phone towards the customer: they scan the code with their wallet "
"and confirm."
msgstr ""
"Obrnite telefon proti stranki: kodo skenira s svojo denarnico in potrdi."

#, python-format
msgid "If it does not scan, press “%(as_text)s”: the customer can copy it."
msgstr "Če se ne prebere, pritisnite »%(as_text)s«: stranka jo lahko kopira."

msgid "How you know it has arrived"
msgstr "Kako veste, da je prispelo"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"The register says “%(paid)s”, with a tick. Only then hand over the goods, "
"and press “%(again)s” for the next customer."
msgstr ""
"Blagajna pokaže »%(paid)s« s kljukico. Šele takrat izročite blago in "
"pritisnite »%(again)s« za naslednjo stranko."

msgid ""
"Look at the register, not at the customer's phone: only the register knows "
"that the money has arrived."
msgstr ""
"Glejte blagajno, ne telefona stranke: samo blagajna ve, da je denar prispel."

msgid "With Lightning it takes a few seconds."
msgstr "Z Lightningom je to nekaj sekund."

msgid "If the network is down"
msgstr "Če ni omrežja"

msgid "Check that the shop phone has Wi-Fi or mobile data."
msgstr "Preverite, ali ima telefon trgovine Wi-Fi ali mobilne podatke."

msgid "At the end of the day"
msgstr "Ob koncu dneva"

#, python-format
msgid "Tell the owner about every sale that did not end with “%(paid)s”."
msgstr "Lastniku sporočite vsako prodajo, ki se ni končala z »%(paid)s«."

msgid "Who to ask"
msgstr "Koga vprašati"

msgid "Owner:"
msgstr "Lastnik:"

msgid "Phone:"
msgstr "Telefon:"

#, python-format
msgid "About the register and the site: %(email)s"
msgstr "Za blagajno in spletno mesto: %(email)s"

#, python-format
msgid "The guide for shops: %(guide)s"
msgstr "Navodila za trgovine: %(guide)s"

msgid "The register on your phone"
msgstr "Blagajna na vašem telefonu"

msgid ""
"Scan the code and add the page to the home screen. No sign-in needed: with "
"it one can only take payments, which go to the shop."
msgstr ""
"Skenirajte kodo in dodajte stran na domači zaslon. Prijava ni potrebna: z "
"blagajno je mogoče samo sprejemati plačila, denar pa gre trgovini."

msgid "Too many changes in a short time: wait a few minutes."
msgstr "Preveč sprememb v kratkem času: počakajte nekaj minut."

msgid "Page view"
msgstr "Pogled strani"

msgid "Private view"
msgstr "Zasebni pogled"

msgid "Public view"
msgstr "Javni pogled"

#, python-format
msgid "site mode: %(mode)s"
msgstr "način spletnega mesta: %(mode)s"

msgid "Hide the private part"
msgstr "Skrijte zasebni del"

msgid "Show the private part"
msgstr "Prikažite zasebni del"

msgid "Got it"
msgstr "Videno"

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"It works: the register will know when a payment arrives. Provider: "
"{provider}."
msgstr "Deluje: blagajna bo vedela, kdaj prispe plačilo. Ponudnik: {provider}."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "I cannot find {provider}: check what you wrote after the @."
msgstr ""
"Ponudnika {provider} ne najdem: preverite, kaj ste napisali za znakom @."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Did you mean {address}?"
msgstr "Ste mislili {address}?"

msgid ""
"This is a request for one payment, not your Lightning address: in your "
"wallet, look for the address that looks like an email, name@provider."
msgstr ""
"To je zahtevek za eno samo plačilo, ne vaš Lightning naslov: v denarnici "
"poiščite naslov, ki je videti kot e-poštni naslov, ime@ponudnik."

msgid ""
"Too many checks in a short time. You can go on: the address is checked again "
"when you create the shop."
msgstr ""
"Preveč preizkusov v kratkem času. Lahko nadaljujete: naslov se znova "
"preizkusi, ko ustvarite trgovino."

msgid "Trying the address..."
msgstr "Preizkušam naslov ..."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Written as {address}."
msgstr "Zapisano kot {address}."

msgid ""
"The check is taking too long. You can go on: the address is checked again "
"when you create the shop."
msgstr ""
"Preizkus traja predolgo. Lahko nadaljujete: naslov se znova preizkusi, ko "
"ustvarite trgovino."

msgid ""
"I could not check the address now. You can go on: it is checked again when "
"you create the shop."
msgstr ""
"Naslova zdaj ne morem preizkusiti. Lahko nadaljujete: znova se preizkusi, ko "
"ustvarite trgovino."

msgid "Where do I find it?"
msgstr "Kje ga najdem?"

msgid ""
"Open your wallet and look under Receive: the Lightning address looks like an "
"email, name@provider. Some wallets show it in the settings or in your "
"profile."
msgstr ""
"Odprite denarnico in poglejte pod »Prejmi«: Lightning naslov je videti kot e-"
"poštni naslov, ime@ponudnik. Nekatere denarnice ga pokažejo v nastavitvah "
"ali v profilu."

msgid ""
"Not the long code that starts with lnbc: that one is good for a single "
"payment."
msgstr "Ne dolge kode, ki se začne z lnbc: ta velja za eno samo plačilo."

msgid ""
"The wallet must tell the register when a payment arrives, and not all of "
"them do. Paste the address here: we try it before creating the shop, and "
"tell you if it does not work."
msgstr ""
"Denarnica mora blagajni znati sporočiti, kdaj prispe plačilo, in tega ne "
"znajo vse. Prilepite naslov sem: preizkusimo ga, preden ustvarimo trgovino, "
"in vam povemo, če ne deluje."

msgid "The wallets that work with the register"
msgstr "Denarnice, ki delujejo z blagajno"

msgid "today at {time}"
msgstr "danes ob {time}"

msgid "yesterday at {time}"
msgstr "včeraj ob {time}"

msgid "on {date} at {time}"
msgstr "{date} ob {time}"

msgid ""
"Customers can pay and the money reaches your wallet, but the register keeps "
"waiting and does not say it is paid. Until this is fixed, check in your "
"wallet that each payment arrived before the customer leaves."
msgstr ""
"Stranke lahko plačajo in denar prispe v vašo denarnico, vendar blagajna "
"ostane v čakanju in ne pokaže, da je plačano. Dokler se to ne uredi, v "
"denarnici preverite, ali je vsako plačilo prispelo, preden stranka odide."

msgid ""
"The register cannot take Lightning payments: customers cannot pay you in "
"bitcoin until it works again."
msgstr ""
"Blagajna ne more sprejemati plačil prek Lightninga: stranke vam ne morejo "
"plačati z bitcoinom, dokler spet ne deluje."

msgid "{shop}: Lightning payments work again"
msgstr "{shop}: plačila Lightning spet delujejo"

msgid ""
"Good news: the Lightning address of {shop}, {address}, works again. "
"Customers can pay you with Lightning, and the register sees their payments."
msgstr ""
"Dobra novica: Lightning naslov trgovine {shop}, {address}, spet deluje. "
"Stranke vam lahko plačajo prek Lightninga in blagajna vidi njihova plačila."

msgid "There is nothing to do."
msgstr "Ničesar vam ni treba storiti."

msgid "{shop}: the register does not see Lightning payments arrive"
msgstr "{shop}: blagajna ne vidi prihajajočih plačil Lightning"

msgid ""
"The Lightning address of {shop}, {address}, still receives payments, but "
"{since} it stopped telling the register when one arrives."
msgstr ""
"Lightning naslov trgovine {shop}, {address}, še vedno prejema plačila, "
"vendar je {since} prenehal blagajni sporočati, kdaj kakšno prispe."

msgid ""
"1. Open your wallet and check that your Lightning address is still exactly "
"{address}."
msgstr ""
"1. Odprite denarnico in preverite, ali je vaš Lightning naslov še vedno "
"natanko {address}."

msgid "{shop}: the register cannot take Lightning payments"
msgstr "{shop}: blagajna ne more sprejemati plačil prek Lightninga"

msgid ""
"The Lightning address of {shop}, {address}, stopped answering {since}. We "
"tried it twice, some time apart."
msgstr ""
"Lightning naslov trgovine {shop}, {address}, se je {since} prenehal "
"odzivati. Preizkusili smo ga dvakrat, v časovnem razmiku."

msgid ""
"1. Open your wallet and find your Lightning address, usually under Receive."
msgstr ""
"1. Odprite denarnico in poiščite svoj Lightning naslov, običajno pod "
"»Prejmi«."

msgid "2. Check that it is still exactly {address}."
msgstr "2. Preverite, ali je še vedno natanko {address}."

msgid "What happened"
msgstr "Kaj se je zgodilo"

msgid "What your customers see"
msgstr "Kaj vidijo vaše stranke"

msgid "What to do now"
msgstr "Kaj storiti zdaj"

msgid "We keep checking it, and we write to you when it works again."
msgstr "Še naprej ga preverjamo in vam pišemo, ko spet deluje."

msgid "Your panel: {link}"
msgstr "Vaša nadzorna plošča: {link}"

msgid "Lightning addresses of the shops:"
msgstr "Lightning naslovi trgovin:"

msgid "{shop}: works again"
msgstr "{shop}: spet deluje"

msgid "{shop}: stopped confirming payments {since}"
msgstr "{shop}: je {since} prenehal potrjevati plačila"

msgid "{shop}: stopped answering {since}"
msgstr "{shop}: se je {since} prenehal odzivati"

msgid "…and {count} more"
msgstr "… in še {count}"

msgid "Shops with a problem: {link}"
msgstr "Trgovine s težavo: {link}"

msgid "Works"
msgstr "Deluje"

msgid "Does not answer"
msgstr "Se ne odziva"

msgid "Does not confirm payments"
msgstr "Ne potrjuje plačil"

msgid "Lightning address status"
msgstr "Stanje Lightning naslova"

msgid "Lightning status since"
msgstr "Stanje Lightning od"

msgid "Lightning address last checked"
msgstr "Lightning naslov nazadnje preverjen"

msgid "Lightning address last worked"
msgstr "Lightning naslov nazadnje deloval"

msgid "Not working"
msgstr "Ne deluje"

msgid "You already tried a few times: wait ten minutes and try again."
msgstr "Poskusili ste že nekajkrat: počakajte deset minut in poskusite znova."

msgid ""
"You saved many times in a short while: wait a few minutes and try again."
msgstr ""
"V kratkem času ste shranili velikokrat: počakajte nekaj minut in poskusite "
"znova."

msgid "Too many checks right now: try again in a minute."
msgstr "Trenutno preveč preverjanj: poskusite znova čez minuto."

msgid "Checked again just now: it works."
msgstr "Pravkar znova preverjeno: deluje."

msgid "Checked again just now: it still does not work."
msgstr "Pravkar znova preverjeno: še vedno ne deluje."

#, python-format
msgid "Lightning address checked %(when)s: it works."
msgstr "Lightning naslov preverjen %(when)s: deluje."

msgid "Lightning: the register does not see payments arrive"
msgstr "Lightning: blagajna ne vidi prihajajočih plačil"

msgid "Lightning: your address does not answer"
msgstr "Lightning: vaš naslov se ne odziva"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"Your Lightning address still receives payments, but %(since)s it stopped "
"telling the register when one arrives."
msgstr ""
"Vaš Lightning naslov še vedno prejema plačila, vendar je %(since)s prenehal "
"blagajni sporočati, kdaj kakšno prispe."

#, python-format
msgid "Your Lightning address stopped answering %(since)s."
msgstr "Vaš Lightning naslov se je %(since)s prenehal odzivati."

msgid "Checking… it can take half a minute"
msgstr "Preverjam … lahko traja pol minute"

msgid "Try again now"
msgstr "Poskusite znova zdaj"

#, python-format
msgid "Last check: %(when)s."
msgstr "Zadnje preverjanje: %(when)s."

msgid "Not checked yet"
msgstr "Še ni preverjeno"

msgid ""
"We tried the Lightning address of {shop}, {address}, twice, some time apart: "
"it receives payments, but it does not tell the register when one arrives."
msgstr ""
"Lightning naslov trgovine {shop}, {address}, smo preizkusili dvakrat, v "
"časovnem razmiku: prejema plačila, vendar blagajni ne sporoči, kdaj kakšno "
"prispe."

msgid ""
"We tried the Lightning address of {shop}, {address}, twice, some time apart, "
"and it did not answer."
msgstr ""
"Lightning naslov trgovine {shop}, {address}, smo preizkusili dvakrat, v "
"časovnem razmiku, in se ni odzval."

msgid ""
"{failed} of {probed} addresses failed at the same time: probably the network "
"of this server or a big provider, not the shops. Nothing was counted and no "
"merchant was told; the next run tries again."
msgstr ""
"{failed} od {probed} naslovov je odpovedalo hkrati: verjetno omrežje tega "
"strežnika ali velik ponudnik, ne trgovine. Nič ni bilo šteto in noben "
"trgovec ni bil obveščen; naslednji krog poskusi znova."

msgid "{shop}: does not confirm payments"
msgstr "{shop}: ne potrjuje plačil"

msgid "{shop}: does not answer"
msgstr "{shop}: se ne odziva"

msgid ""
"Your Lightning address receives payments, but it does not tell the register "
"when one arrives: we tried it twice, some time apart."
msgstr ""
"Vaš Lightning naslov prejema plačila, vendar blagajni ne sporoči, kdaj "
"kakšno prispe: preizkusili smo ga dvakrat, v časovnem razmiku."

msgid ""
"Your Lightning address does not answer: we tried it twice, some time apart."
msgstr ""
"Vaš Lightning naslov se ne odziva: preizkusili smo ga dvakrat, v časovnem "
"razmiku."

msgid ""
"Your wallet's provider is slow or busy right now: try again in a few minutes."
msgstr ""
"Ponudnik vaše denarnice je trenutno počasen ali zaseden: poskusite znova čez "
"nekaj minut."

msgid "Your shop changed while it was being checked: look at it again."
msgstr "Vaša trgovina se je spremenila med preverjanjem: poglejte jo znova."

msgid "a first paid sale"
msgstr "prva plačana prodaja"

msgid "the position on the map"
msgstr "lokacija na zemljevidu"

msgid "the sign printed"
msgstr "natisnjena tabla"

msgid "the register shown to the staff"
msgstr "blagajna, pokazana zaposlenim"

msgid "The community has taken your shop off the map and the lists for now. The register still works."
msgstr "Skupnost je vašo trgovino za zdaj umaknila z zemljevida in seznamov. Blagajna še vedno deluje."

msgid ""
"Your shop is not shown on the map or in the lists, as you chose. The "
"register works the same."
msgstr ""
"Vaša trgovina ni prikazana na zemljevidu ne na seznamih, kot ste izbrali. "
"Blagajna vseeno deluje."

msgid ""
"Nobody has claimed this shop yet: it is on the map, but it has no register "
"on this site."
msgstr ""
"Te trgovine še nihče ni prevzel: je na zemljevidu, vendar na tem spletnem "
"mestu nima blagajne."

msgid ""
"This shop belongs to a staff account, which signs in only from the "
"administration and does not open the pages of a shop: the shop needs an "
"ordinary account."
msgstr ""
"Ta trgovina pripada profilu ekipe, ki se prijavlja samo prek administracije "
"in ne odpira strani trgovine: trgovina potrebuje navaden profil."

msgid ""
"You can sign in with a link sent to your email, even without the wallet."
msgstr ""
"Prijavite se lahko s povezavo, poslano na vaš e-poštni naslov, tudi brez "
"denarnice."

msgid ""
"There is no email to get back in: if you lose or change the wallet you sign "
"in with, you cannot open your shop any more. Add an email in your profile."
msgstr ""
"Ni e-poštnega naslova za ponovno prijavo: če izgubite ali zamenjate "
"denarnico, s katero se prijavljate, svoje trgovine ne morete več odpreti. V "
"profilu dodajte e-poštni naslov."

msgid ""
"Your Lightning wallet takes too long to answer: the customer would wait too "
"long. Try again in a few minutes; if it stays so, check the wallet app."
msgstr ""
"Vaša Lightning denarnica se odziva predolgo: stranka bi čakala predolgo. "
"Poskusite znova čez nekaj minut; če ostane tako, preverite aplikacijo "
"denarnice."

msgid "The first day is complete."
msgstr "Prvi dan je zaključen."

msgid "Some checks did not finish in time: run it again in a minute."
msgstr ""
"Nekatera preverjanja se niso končala pravočasno: zaženite ga znova čez "
"minuto."

msgid ""
"Your shop has no position, so it is not on the map. Add it in your shop page."
msgstr ""
"Vaša trgovina nima lokacije, zato je ni na zemljevidu. Dodajte jo na strani "
"svoje trgovine."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "The first day: {done} of {total} done. Still to do: {steps}."
msgstr "Prvi dan: opravljeno {done} od {total}. Še za opraviti: {steps}."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Your shop is marked as historic ({note}): it stays on the map but does not "
"count among the places to pay. The register and the sign still work."
msgstr ""
"Vaša trgovina je označena kot zgodovinska ({note}): ostane na zemljevidu, "
"vendar ne šteje med kraje za plačilo. Blagajna in tabla še delujeta."

msgid "Your shop is on the map."
msgstr "Vaša trgovina je na zemljevidu."

msgid ""
"Your Lightning wallet is not answering: the register cannot show the "
"Lightning payment code. Open the wallet app and check that it works."
msgstr ""
"Vaša Lightning denarnica se ne odziva: blagajna ne more prikazati kode za "
"plačilo Lightning. Odprite aplikacijo denarnice in preverite, ali deluje."

msgid ""
"Your Lightning address answers and tells the register when a payment arrives."
msgstr ""
"Vaš Lightning naslov se odziva in blagajni sporoči, kdaj prispe plačilo."

msgid ""
"One check could not be done: run it again; if it repeats, tell whoever runs "
"the server."
msgstr ""
"Enega preverjanja ni bilo mogoče opraviti: zaženite ga znova; če se ponovi, "
"obvestite upravljavca strežnika."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "No shop found for “{text}”."
msgstr "Za »{text}« ni najdene nobene trgovine."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "{count} shops found: run it again with the id of the right one."
msgstr "Najdenih trgovin: {count}. Zaženite znova z id-jem prave."

msgid "certified since the month of"
msgstr "certificirana od meseca"

msgid "Lightning, active in the last week"
msgstr "Lightning, dejaven v zadnjem tednu"

msgid "Lightning, active in the last month"
msgstr "Lightning, dejaven v zadnjem mesecu"

msgid "Lightning, active in the last year"
msgstr "Lightning, dejaven v zadnjem letu"

msgid "Lightning, not active in the last year"
msgstr "Lightning, ni bil dejaven v zadnjem letu"

msgid "Certified shop"
msgstr "Certificirana trgovina"

msgid "certified shop"
msgstr "certificirana trgovina"

msgid "Certified"
msgstr "Certificirana"

msgid "Not yet"
msgstr "Še ne"

msgid "certificate revoked"
msgstr "certifikat preklican"

msgid "Revoke the certificate"
msgstr "Prekličite certifikat"

msgid "Allow the certificate again"
msgstr "Znova dovolite certifikat"

msgid "Certificate revoked for %(count)d shops."
msgstr "Certifikat preklican, število trgovin: %(count)d."

# The merchant's path (templates/shops/journey.html)
msgid "Your card on the map, now"
msgstr "Vaš vpis na zemljevidu, zdaj"

msgid "Not on the map for now: the community has taken the shop off it."
msgstr "Za zdaj ni na zemljevidu: skupnost je trgovino umaknila."

msgid "Not on the map: the shop stays off it, as agreed with the community."
msgstr ""
"Ni na zemljevidu: trgovina ostane zunaj, kot je dogovorjeno s skupnostjo."

msgid "Not on the map yet: the position is missing."
msgstr "Še ni na zemljevidu: manjka lokacija."

msgid "Lightning address that works"
msgstr "Lightning naslov, ki deluje"

msgid "The first day"
msgstr "Prvi dan"

msgid "The badge of a certified shop"
msgstr "Znak certificirane trgovine"

msgid "Next step"
msgstr "Naslednji korak"

msgid "Optional"
msgstr "Neobvezno"

msgid "Checked soon"
msgstr "Kmalu preverjeno"

msgid "Your Lightning address works: checked %(when)s."
msgstr "Vaš Lightning naslov deluje: preverjeno %(when)s."

msgid ""
"Your Lightning address is not working: the message above says what to do."
msgstr "Vaš Lightning naslov ne deluje: sporočilo zgoraj pove, kaj storiti."

msgid ""
"The site tries your Lightning address within a few hours, the way the "
"register uses it. Nothing to do."
msgstr ""
"Spletno mesto v nekaj urah preizkusi vaš Lightning naslov, tako kot ga "
"uporablja blagajna. Ničesar vam ni treba storiti."

msgid "The shop is off the map for now: its Lightning address is not checked."
msgstr ""
"Trgovina za zdaj ni na zemljevidu: njenega Lightning naslova ne preverjamo."

msgid ""
"The register works, the sign is up and whoever works with you has the "
"register."
msgstr "Blagajna deluje, tabla je izobešena in vaši zaposleni imajo blagajno."

msgid ""
"Try the register, print the sign, give the register to whoever works with "
"you: the steps are here below."
msgstr ""
"Preizkusite blagajno, natisnite tablo, dajte blagajno zaposlenim: koraki so "
"spodaj."

msgid "Certified since %(month)s: the badge is on your card."
msgstr "Certificirana od %(month)s: znak je na vašem vpisu."

msgid ""
"The community has taken the badge off. To know why, write to <a "
"href=\"mailto:%(email)s\">%(email)s</a>."
msgstr ""
"Skupnost je znak odstranila. Če želite izvedeti zakaj, pišite na <a "
"href=\"mailto:%(email)s\">%(email)s</a>."

msgid "Transaction"
msgstr "Transakcija"

msgid "waiting"
msgstr "v čakanju"

msgid "Who will use it"
msgstr "Kdo jo bo uporabljal"

msgid ""
"A first name or a word you recognise, for example «Anna» or «evening shift». "
"It shows at the top of the register's screen."
msgstr ""
"Ime ali beseda, ki jo prepoznate, na primer »Ana« ali »večerna izmena«. Vidi "
"se na vrhu zaslona blagajne."

msgid "Write a name."
msgstr "Vpišite ime."

msgid "Too many registers turned on: turn off the ones nobody uses any more."
msgstr ""
"Preveč vklopljenih blagajn: izklopite tiste, ki jih nihče več ne uporablja."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"«{name}» is turned off: it takes no more payments. If the person needs a "
"register again, add a new one."
msgstr ""
"»{name}« je izklopljena: ne sprejema več plačil. Če ta oseba spet potrebuje "
"blagajno, dodajte novo."

msgid "Asking the shop's Lightning wallet for the invoice..."
msgstr "Lightning denarnico trgovine prosim za zahtevek za plačilo ..."

msgid ""
"The shop's Lightning wallet does not accept this amount: too high or too low."
msgstr ""
"Lightning denarnica trgovine ne sprejme tega zneska: previsok ali prenizek."

msgid "The shop's Lightning wallet sent a wrong invoice: do not use it."
msgstr ""
"Lightning denarnica trgovine je poslala napačen zahtevek za plačilo: ne "
"uporabite ga."

msgid "The owner sees the payment in the wallet"
msgstr "Lastnik vidi plačilo v denarnici"

msgid "Marked as paid: the owner will check it"
msgstr "Označeno kot plačano: preveril bo lastnik"

msgid "Not checked: tell the owner"
msgstr "Ni preverjeno: povejte lastniku"

#, python-format
msgid "Registers for your staff: 1 turned on"
msgid_plural "Registers for your staff: %(counter)s turned on"
msgstr[0] "Blagajne za vaše zaposlene: %(counter)s vklopljena"
msgstr[1] "Blagajne za vaše zaposlene: %(counter)s vklopljeni"
msgstr[2] "Blagajne za vaše zaposlene: %(counter)s vklopljene"
msgstr[3] "Blagajne za vaše zaposlene: %(counter)s vklopljenih"

msgid "Or share your own register"
msgstr "Ali delite svojo blagajno"

msgid ""
"Cancel this sale? If the customer has already paid, tell the owner: they "
"give the money back."
msgstr ""
"Prekličete to prodajo? Če je stranka že plačala, povejte lastniku: denar "
"vrne on."

msgid "Something is not right?"
msgstr "Je kaj narobe?"

msgid "Did the customer pay?"
msgstr "Je stranka plačala?"

msgid ""
"Only when this screen shows the green tick and «Payment received». «Sent» on "
"the customer's phone is not enough."
msgstr ""
"Šele ko ta zaslon pokaže zeleno kljukico in »Plačilo prejeto«. »Poslano« na "
"telefonu stranke ni dovolj."

msgid "I typed the wrong amount"
msgstr "Vpisan je napačen znesek"

msgid ""
"If the customer has not paid yet: press Cancel and type it again. If they "
"already paid: tell the owner the time and the amount, they give the "
"difference back."
msgstr ""
"Če stranka še ni plačala: pritisnite »Prekličite« in ga vpišite znova. Če je "
"že plačala: lastniku povejte uro in znesek, razliko vrne on."

msgid "The phone switched off, or I closed the page"
msgstr "Telefon se je ugasnil ali se je stran zaprla"

msgid ""
"Open the register again on the same phone: the sale comes back and says how "
"it ended. On another phone it does not: tell the owner the time and the "
"amount."
msgstr ""
"Znova odprite blagajno na istem telefonu: prodaja se vrne in pove, kako se "
"je končala. Na drugem telefonu ne: lastniku povejte uro in znesek."

msgid "The customer paid twice"
msgstr "Stranka je plačala dvakrat"

msgid ""
"This register only takes payments for the shop. The money goes to the owner, "
"never to this phone."
msgstr ""
"Ta blagajna je samo za sprejemanje plačil za trgovino. Denar gre lastniku, "
"nikoli na ta telefon."

msgid "Registers for your staff"
msgstr "Blagajne za vaše zaposlene"

#, python-format
msgid "The register for %(name)s"
msgstr "Blagajna za %(name)s"

msgid ""
"Open the camera of the phone that will take payments and point it at this "
"code."
msgstr ""
"Odprite kamero telefona, ki bo sprejemal plačila, in ga usmerite v to kodo."

msgid "Open the link and press «Open the register on this phone»."
msgstr "Odprite povezavo in pritisnite »Odprite blagajno na tem telefonu«."

msgid "From the phone's menu (⋮ on Android, Share on iPhone), add the register to the home screen: it opens with one tap, like an app, with nothing to install."
msgstr "Prek menija telefona (⋮ na Androidu, Deli na iPhonu) dodajte blagajno na začetni zaslon: odpre se z enim dotikom, kot aplikacija, brez nameščanja."

msgid "Code that puts the register on a phone"
msgstr "Koda, ki namesti blagajno na telefon"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"The code works once, until %(date)s. After that it opens nothing: a photo of "
"it is no use to anyone."
msgstr ""
"Koda deluje samo enkrat, do %(date)s. Potem ne odpre ničesar: fotografija "
"kode nikomur ne koristi."

msgid "Send it as a link instead"
msgstr "Raje jo pošljite kot povezavo"

msgid "Print the card"
msgstr "Natisnite kartico"

msgid "Give the card to the person, do not leave it at the till."
msgstr "Kartico dajte osebi, ne puščajte je pri blagajni."

#, python-format
msgid "This register was opened on a phone on %(date)s."
msgstr "Ta blagajna je bila odprta na telefonu %(date)s."

msgid "The code to open this register has expired."
msgstr "Koda za odpiranje te blagajne je potekla."

msgid ""
"Need it on another phone, or the person lost it? Make a new code: the phones "
"that already have the register keep it."
msgstr ""
"Jo potrebujete na drugem telefonu ali jo je oseba izgubila? Ustvarite novo "
"kodo: telefoni, ki blagajno že imajo, jo obdržijo."

msgid "Make a new code (this one stops working)"
msgstr "Ustvarite novo kodo (ta preneha delovati)"

msgid "Make a new code"
msgstr "Ustvarite novo kodo"

msgid ""
"If the phone is lost or the person leaves, turn off the register instead: a "
"new code does not take it away from the phones that have it."
msgstr ""
"Če je telefon izgubljen ali oseba odide, raje izklopite blagajno: nova koda "
"je ne odvzame telefonom, ki jo imajo."

msgid "Too many tries"
msgstr "Preveč poskusov"

msgid "Wait ten minutes and try again."
msgstr "Počakajte deset minut in poskusite znova."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"The shop's register for %(name)s. With it you take payments for the shop: "
"the money goes to the owner."
msgstr ""
"Blagajna trgovine za %(name)s. Z njo sprejemate plačila za trgovino: denar "
"gre lastniku."

msgid "Open the register on this phone"
msgstr "Odprite blagajno na tem telefonu"

msgid "The code works only once: then the register stays on this phone. Add it to the home screen from the phone's menu (⋮ on Android, Share on iPhone)."
msgstr "Koda deluje samo enkrat: nato blagajna ostane na tem telefonu. Dodajte jo na začetni zaslon prek menija telefona (⋮ na Androidu, Deli na iPhonu)."

msgid "This code opens nothing"
msgstr "Ta koda ne odpre ničesar"

msgid ""
"It was already used, it expired, or the register was turned off. Ask the "
"owner of the shop for a new code."
msgstr ""
"Bila je že uporabljena, potekla je ali pa je bila blagajna izklopljena. "
"Lastnika trgovine prosite za novo kodo."

msgid ""
"When someone stops working with you, or loses the phone, turn off their "
"register: it stops at once, the others keep working."
msgstr ""
"Ko kdo pri vas neha delati ali izgubi telefon, izklopite njegovo blagajno: "
"takoj se ustavi, druge delujejo naprej."

msgid "Turned on"
msgstr "Vklopljene"

#, python-format
msgid "Opened on a phone on %(date)s."
msgstr "Odprta na telefonu %(date)s."

msgid "Not opened on a phone yet: the code is waiting."
msgstr "Še ni odprta na nobenem telefonu: koda čaka."

msgid "Not opened on a phone yet."
msgstr "Še ni odprta na nobenem telefonu."

#, python-format
msgid "Turn off «%(name)s»"
msgstr "Izklopite »%(name)s«"

msgid "None yet."
msgstr "Še nobene."

msgid "Add a register"
msgstr "Dodajte blagajno"

msgid "Add the register"
msgstr "Dodajte blagajno"

#, python-format
msgid "1 register turned off"
msgid_plural "%(counter)s registers turned off"
msgstr[0] "%(counter)s izklopljena blagajna"
msgstr[1] "%(counter)s izklopljeni blagajni"
msgstr[2] "%(counter)s izklopljene blagajne"
msgstr[3] "%(counter)s izklopljenih blagajn"

#, python-format
msgid "%(name)s, turned off on %(date)s"
msgstr "%(name)s, izklopljena %(date)s"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"<a href=\"%(url)s\">Your own register</a> is for you: it cannot be turned "
"off, so do not give its link to anyone."
msgstr ""
"<a href=\"%(url)s\">Vaša lastna blagajna</a> je za vas: ne da se je "
"izklopiti, zato njene povezave ne dajte nikomur."

msgid "moved here on"
msgstr "sem preseljeno dne"

msgid "id on the other site"
msgstr "id na drugem spletnem mestu"

msgid "had a register on the other site"
msgstr "je imela blagajno na drugem spletnem mestu"

msgid "Its owner's email is not valid: left out."
msgstr "E-poštni naslov lastnika ni veljaven: izpuščen."

msgid "Its owner cannot be found here: assign it from the admin."
msgstr "Lastnika tukaj ni mogoče najti: dodelite ga v administraciji."

msgid "A shop with the same external id is already set up here: left as it is."
msgstr ""
"Tukaj je že nastavljena trgovina z istim zunanjim id: ostala je, kakršna je."

msgid "Another shop here has the same unique value (Nostr name or id)."
msgstr ""
"Druga trgovina tukaj ima isto edinstveno vrednost (ime na Nostru ali id)."

#, python-format
msgid "with your email %(email)s (we send you a link)"
msgstr "s svojim e-poštnim naslovom %(email)s (pošljemo vam povezavo)"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"Your shop %(name)s has moved to %(site)s. Sign in there %(how)s: your page "
"and its details are already there."
msgstr ""
"Vaša trgovina %(name)s se je preselila na %(site)s. Tam se prijavite "
"%(how)s: vaša stran in njeni podatki so že tam."

msgid ""
"To take payments again, connect your wallet from your shops' page: your "
"Lightning address, your on-chain key, or both, as before. Until then the "
"shop is not on the map."
msgstr ""
"Da boste spet sprejemali plačila, na strani svojih trgovin povežite "
"denarnico: Lightning naslov, on-chain ključ ali oboje, kot prej. Do takrat "
"trgovine ni na zemljevidu."

msgid ""
"To take payments again, connect your wallet from your shops' page, with your "
"Lightning address, as before. Until then the shop is not on the map."
msgstr ""
"Da boste spet sprejemali plačila, na strani svojih trgovin povežite "
"denarnico z Lightning naslovom, kot prej. Do takrat trgovine ni na "
"zemljevidu."

msgid ""
"Then print the new sign: the old one leads to the old site. If someone else "
"takes payments with you, send them the new register link."
msgstr ""
"Nato natisnite novo tablo: stara vodi na staro spletno mesto. Če z vami "
"sprejema plačila še kdo, mu pošljite novo povezavo do blagajne."

msgid "Nothing else to do."
msgstr "Drugega ni treba storiti."

msgid "Your shop has arrived here"
msgstr "Vaša trgovina je prispela sem"

msgid ""
"Its page and details came with it. To take payments here, connect your "
"wallet: it takes two minutes. Until then the shop is not on the map."
msgstr ""
"Njena stran in podatki so prišli z njo. Da boste tukaj sprejemali plačila, "
"povežite denarnico: traja dve minuti. Do takrat trgovine ni na zemljevidu."

msgid "Connect your wallet"
msgstr "Povežite denarnico"

msgid ""
"If someone else takes payments with you, send them the new register link."
msgstr ""
"Če z vami sprejema plačila še kdo, mu pošljite novo povezavo do blagajne."

#, python-format
msgid "Its Nostr name %(name)s cannot be used here: it arrives without one."
msgstr ""
"Njenega imena na Nostru %(name)s tukaj ni mogoče uporabiti: prispe brez "
"njega."

msgid ""
"Its owner's email already has an account here: the shop waits for a one-time "
"link."
msgstr ""
"E-poštni naslov lastnika ima tukaj že profil: trgovina čaka na enkratno "
"povezavo."

msgid ""
"Its owner signs in with a wallet only, which has another key on another "
"site: the shop waits for a one-time link."
msgstr ""
"Lastnik se prijavlja samo z denarnico, ki ima na drugem spletnem mestu drug "
"ključ: trgovina čaka na enkratno povezavo."

#, python-format
msgid "%(count)s shops here have the external id %(id)s."
msgstr "Tukaj ima zunanji id %(id)s toliko trgovin: %(count)s."

msgid "with your wallet (scan the code on the sign-in page)"
msgstr "z denarnico (skenirajte kodo na strani za prijavo)"

msgid "[the link is made with --apply]"
msgstr "[povezava nastane z --apply]"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"Your shop %(name)s has moved to %(site)s. Sign in there %(how)s, then open "
"this link to take it back: %(link)s. It works once, for whoever opens it "
"first: do not pass it on."
msgstr ""
"Vaša trgovina %(name)s se je preselila na %(site)s. Tam se prijavite "
"%(how)s, nato odprite to povezavo, da jo prevzamete: %(link)s. Deluje samo "
"enkrat, za tistega, ki jo odpre prvi: ne posredujte je nikomur."

#, python-format
msgid "%(name)s is in your account now."
msgstr "%(name)s je zdaj v vašem profilu."

msgid "Take back your shop"
msgstr "Prevzemite svojo trgovino"

msgid "Too many tries in a short time: wait an hour and open the link again."
msgstr ""
"Preveč poskusov v kratkem času: počakajte eno uro in znova odprite povezavo."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"This link does not work: it was already used, or it is not complete. Write "
"to <a href=\"mailto:%(email)s\">%(email)s</a>."
msgstr ""
"Ta povezava ne deluje: bila je že uporabljena ali pa ni popolna. Pišite na "
"<a href=\"mailto:%(email)s\">%(email)s</a>."

#, python-format
msgid "Take back %(name)s"
msgstr "Prevzemite %(name)s"

msgid ""
"Your shop has moved to this site. Confirm, and it goes into the account you "
"are signed in with now: then connect your wallet to take payments."
msgstr ""
"Vaša trgovina se je preselila na to spletno mesto. Potrdite in prešla bo v "
"profil, s katerim ste zdaj prijavljeni: nato povežite denarnico, da boste "
"sprejemali plačila."

msgid "The link works once. If this is not your shop, do not confirm."
msgstr "Povezava deluje samo enkrat. Če to ni vaša trgovina, ne potrdite."

msgid "Yes, it is my shop"
msgstr "Da, to je moja trgovina"

msgid "To do today"
msgstr "Za danes"

msgid "The whole site"
msgstr "Celotno spletno mesto"

#, python-format
msgid "%(count)d more thing to know: --all, or /admin/today/."
msgid_plural "%(count)d more things to know: --all, or /admin/today/."
msgstr[0] "Še %(count)d stvar, ki jo morate vedeti: --all ali /admin/today/."
msgstr[1] "Še %(count)d stvari, ki ju morate vedeti: --all ali /admin/today/."
msgstr[2] "Še %(count)d stvari, ki jih morate vedeti: --all ali /admin/today/."
msgstr[3] "Še %(count)d stvari, ki jih morate vedeti: --all ali /admin/today/."

msgid "The shop in the administration"
msgstr "Trgovina v administraciji"

msgid ""
"The Lightning address receives payments but does not tell the register: "
"sales stay waiting."
msgstr ""
"Lightning naslov prejema plačila, vendar tega ne sporoči blagajni: prodaje "
"ostanejo v čakanju."

msgid ""
"The Lightning address has never answered: customers cannot pay with "
"Lightning."
msgstr ""
"Lightning naslov se ni še nikoli odzval: stranke ne morejo plačati prek "
"Lightninga."

msgid ""
"The Lightning address stopped answering: customers cannot pay with Lightning."
msgstr ""
"Lightning naslov se je prenehal odzivati: stranke ne morejo plačati prek "
"Lightninga."

msgid ""
"Open your wallet and check that your Lightning address is still the one in "
"your shop page."
msgstr ""
"Odprite denarnico in preverite, ali je vaš Lightning naslov še vedno tisti, "
"ki je na strani trgovine."

msgid "The shop has no position, so it is not on the map."
msgstr "Trgovina nima lokacije, zato je ni na zemljevidu."

msgid "Moved here: the owner has not taken the shop yet."
msgstr "Preseljeno sem: lastnik trgovine še ni prevzel."

msgid ""
"Your shop has moved to this site: open the link we sent you to take it back."
msgstr ""
"Vaša trgovina se je preselila na to spletno mesto: odprite povezavo, ki smo "
"vam jo poslali, da jo prevzamete."

msgid "Moved here without an owner to tell."
msgstr "Preseljeno sem brez lastnika, ki bi ga obvestili."

msgid ""
"Moved here: the owner took the shop but has not connected a wallet, so there "
"is no register."
msgstr ""
"Preseljeno sem: lastnik je trgovino prevzel, a ni povezal denarnice, zato "
"blagajne ni."

msgid "Moved here: the owner took the shop, which has no register yet."
msgstr "Preseljeno sem: lastnik je prevzel trgovino, ki še nima blagajne."

msgid "Help the merchant connect a wallet from their panel: only they can."
msgstr ""
"Trgovcu pomagajte povezati denarnico na njegovi nadzorni plošči: to lahko "
"stori samo on."

msgid "To take payments again, open your panel and connect your wallet."
msgstr ""
"Da boste spet sprejemali plačila, odprite nadzorno ploščo in povežite "
"denarnico."

msgid ""
"The Lightning addresses have not been checked for a while: what this page "
"says about them may be old."
msgstr ""
"Lightning naslovi že nekaj časa niso bili preverjeni: kar ta stran pravi o "
"njih, je lahko zastarelo."

msgid "The Lightning addresses have never been checked."
msgstr "Lightning naslovi še nikoli niso bili preverjeni."

msgid "Check the timer that runs check_lightning."
msgstr "Preverite časovnik, ki zaganja check_lightning."

msgid "To do today: the state of every register"
msgstr "Za danes: stanje vseh blagajn"

msgid "shops to look at"
msgstr "trgovine za pregled"

msgid "Problem"
msgstr "Težava"

msgid "To look at"
msgstr "Za pregled"

msgid "To know"
msgstr "Dobro je vedeti"

msgid "Now:"
msgstr "Zdaj:"

msgid "To the merchant:"
msgstr "Trgovcu:"

msgid "Nothing to do: every register is fine, as far as the database knows."
msgstr ""
"Ničesar ni treba storiti: vse blagajne so v redu, kolikor ve baza podatkov."

msgid "What this page does not see"
msgstr "Česa ta stran ne vidi"

msgid "The same list in text, for a daily message:"
msgstr "Isti seznam kot besedilo, za dnevno obvestilo:"

#, python-format
msgid "%(count)s thing to do, the most urgent first"
msgid_plural "%(count)s things to do, the most urgent first"
msgstr[0] "%(count)s opravilo, najnujnejše najprej"
msgstr[1] "%(count)s opravili, najnujnejši najprej"
msgstr[2] "%(count)s opravila, najnujnejša najprej"
msgstr[3] "%(count)s opravil, najnujnejša najprej"

#, python-format
msgid "Last time %(when)s, %(days)s day ago."
msgid_plural "Last time %(when)s, %(days)s days ago."
msgstr[0] "Zadnjič %(when)s, pred %(days)s dnem."
msgstr[1] "Zadnjič %(when)s, pred %(days)s dnevoma."
msgstr[2] "Zadnjič %(when)s, pred %(days)s dnevi."
msgstr[3] "Zadnjič %(when)s, pred %(days)s dnevi."

#, python-format
msgid "Last time %(when)s."
msgstr "Zadnjič %(when)s."

#, python-format
msgid "Started %(when)s, %(days)s day ago."
msgid_plural "Started %(when)s, %(days)s days ago."
msgstr[0] "Začelo se je %(when)s, pred %(days)s dnem."
msgstr[1] "Začelo se je %(when)s, pred %(days)s dnevoma."
msgstr[2] "Začelo se je %(when)s, pred %(days)s dnevi."
msgstr[3] "Začelo se je %(when)s, pred %(days)s dnevi."

#, python-format
msgid "Started %(when)s."
msgstr "Začelo se je %(when)s."

msgid ""
"Send the owner again the one-time link from the list of owners the import "
"wrote. If that link is lost, the command below makes a new one for this shop "
"only, from the same file of the import, in a new list of owners: the old "
"link stops working, the other shops keep theirs."
msgstr ""
"Lastniku znova pošljite enkratno povezavo s seznama lastnikov, ki ga je "
"zapisal uvoz. Če je ta povezava izgubljena, ukaz spodaj naredi novo samo za "
"to trgovino, iz iste datoteke uvoza, v nov seznam lastnikov: stara povezava "
"preneha delovati, druge trgovine obdržijo svoje."

msgid "on any phone or computer, nothing to install"
msgstr "na katerem koli telefonu ali računalniku, brez nameščanja"

msgid "I do not have a wallet yet: save my shop, I add the wallet afterwards"
msgstr "Še nimam denarnice: shranite trgovino, denarnico dodam pozneje"

msgid "waiting for the owner's wallet"
msgstr "čaka na denarnico lastnika"

msgid "Last step: the wallet."
msgstr "Zadnji korak: denarnica."

msgid ""
"Your shop's page is ready. It goes on the map, with its register, as soon as "
"you add the wallet where the money arrives."
msgstr ""
"Stran trgovine je pripravljena. Na zemljevid pride, z blagajno vred, takoj "
"ko dodate denarnico, v katero prihaja denar."

msgid "Add the wallet"
msgstr "Dodajte denarnico"

msgid "No wallet yet: your shop is not on the map and has no register."
msgstr "Še brez denarnice: trgovine ni na zemljevidu in nima blagajne."

msgid "Last step: the wallet for %(name)s"
msgstr "Zadnji korak: denarnica za %(name)s"

msgid "Your shop is saved."
msgstr "Trgovina je shranjena."

msgid "It goes on the map, with its register, as soon as you add the wallet."
msgstr "Na zemljevid pride, z blagajno vred, takoj ko dodate denarnico."

msgid ""
"The wallet is the app on your phone where the money arrives. Getting one is "
"free and takes about ten minutes. You can stop and come back: this page is "
"in your shops."
msgstr ""
"Denarnica je aplikacija na telefonu, v katero prihaja denar. Je brezplačna "
"in nastavite jo v približno desetih minutah. Lahko se ustavite in vrnete: to "
"stran najdete med svojimi trgovinami."

msgid "Already have a wallet? Go to step 4."
msgstr "Denarnico že imate? Pojdite na 4. korak."

msgid "Choose a wallet"
msgstr "Izberite denarnico"

msgid ""
"These wallets are free and the money stays yours: nobody else can move it, "
"not even us. Any of them is fine."
msgstr ""
"Te denarnice so brezplačne in denar ostane vaš: nihče drug ga ne more "
"premakniti, niti mi. Vsaka je dobra."

msgid "Pick one from our page: they are free, and the money stays yours."
msgstr "Izberite eno z naše strani: so brezplačne in denar ostane vaš."

msgid ""
"Ask us which wallet to use: write to <a href=\"mailto:%(email)s\">%(email)s</"
"a>."
msgstr ""
"Vprašajte nas, katero denarnico uporabiti: pišite na <a href=\"mailto:%"
"(email)s\">%(email)s</a>."

msgid "Install it"
msgstr "Namestite jo"

msgid ""
"Open the app store of your phone, look for the wallet by its name and "
"install it, as you do with any app."
msgstr ""
"Odprite trgovino z aplikacijami na telefonu, poiščite denarnico po imenu in "
"jo namestite, kot vsako drugo aplikacijo."

msgid ""
"Check the name of whoever makes it: it must be the same as on the wallet's "
"page. There are fake copies."
msgstr ""
"Preverite ime izdelovalca: biti mora enako kot na strani denarnice. "
"Obstajajo lažne kopije."

msgid "Create your wallet"
msgstr "Ustvarite svojo denarnico"

msgid ""
"Never write those words here, nor in a photo, a message or an email. Nobody "
"from us will ever ask you for them."
msgstr ""
"Teh besed nikoli ne pišite sem, ne fotografirajte jih in jih ne pošiljajte v "
"sporočilu ali po e-pošti. Nihče od nas vas jih ne bo nikoli vprašal."

msgid "Copy your Lightning address"
msgstr "Kopirajte svoj Lightning naslov"

msgid ""
"In the wallet, look under Receive, or in the settings or in your profile: "
"the Lightning address looks like an email, name@provider. Copy it."
msgstr ""
"V denarnici poglejte pod »Prejmi«, v nastavitvah ali v profilu: Lightning "
"naslov je videti kot e-poštni naslov, ime@ponudnik. Kopirajte ga."

msgid "Paste it here: we try it"
msgstr "Prilepite ga sem: preizkusimo ga"

msgid ""
"The check is taking too long. You can go on: the address is checked again "
"when you make the register."
msgstr ""
"Preverjanje traja predolgo. Lahko nadaljujete: naslov se znova preveri, ko "
"ustvarite blagajno."

msgid ""
"I could not check the address now. You can go on: it is checked again when "
"you make the register."
msgstr ""
"Naslova zdaj ni bilo mogoče preveriti. Lahko nadaljujete: znova se preveri, "
"ko ustvarite blagajno."

msgid ""
"As soon as you paste it, we try the address and tell you here if it works. "
"Not all wallets tell the register when a payment arrives: if yours does not, "
"we say so, and you can pick another one from step 1."
msgstr ""
"Takoj ko ga prilepite, naslov preizkusimo in vam tukaj povemo, ali deluje. "
"Vse denarnice blagajni ne sporočijo, kdaj prispe plačilo: če vaša tega ne "
"stori, vam povemo, in v 1. koraku lahko izberete drugo."

msgid "Make the register"
msgstr "Ustvarite blagajno"

msgid ""
"When the address works, press the button: we try it once more and make your "
"register. Then try it: pay yourself a small amount from another phone."
msgstr ""
"Ko naslov deluje, pritisnite gumb: preizkusimo ga še zadnjič in ustvarimo "
"vašo blagajno. Nato jo preizkusite: z drugega telefona si plačajte majhen "
"znesek."

msgid "Make my register"
msgstr "Ustvarite mojo blagajno"

msgid "Making your register..."
msgstr "Ustvarjam vašo blagajno ..."

msgid ""
"Your shop was already saved a moment ago, without a wallet. Paste the "
"address here: we try it and make the register."
msgstr ""
"Vaša trgovina je bila pred trenutkom že shranjena, brez denarnice. Prilepite "
"naslov sem: preizkusimo ga in ustvarimo blagajno."

msgid "This shop does not take bitcoin yet: it will soon."
msgstr "Ta trgovina še ne sprejema bitcoina: kmalu ga bo."

msgid ""
"Once the wallet is connected, print the new sign from here: the old one "
"leads to the old site."
msgstr ""
"Ko je denarnica povezana, od tod natisnite novo tablo: stara vodi na staro "
"spletno mesto."

msgid ""
"Your shop changed while the wallet was being connected: reload the page and "
"look at it again."
msgstr ""
"Vaša trgovina se je spremenila med povezovanjem denarnice: znova naložite "
"stran in jo poglejte še enkrat."

msgid "PRACTICE ONLY. This is not a payment: there is nothing to pay."
msgstr "SAMO VADBA. To ni plačilo: ničesar ni treba plačati."

msgid ""
"The customer paid. Hand over the goods only when this screen shows the green "
"tick and «Payment received»: the customer's phone does not count."
msgstr ""
"Stranka je plačala. Blago izročite šele, ko ta zaslon pokaže zeleno kljukico "
"in »Plačilo prejeto«: telefon stranke ne šteje."

msgid ""
"No connection, as when the shop's Wi-Fi drops. The register says so and "
"keeps the sale: do not cancel it and do not hand over the goods. Wait for "
"the connection."
msgstr ""
"Ni povezave, kot ko v trgovini izpade Wi-Fi. Blagajna to pove in prodajo "
"obdrži: ne prekličite je in ne izročite blaga. Počakajte na povezavo."

msgid "The connection is back: the register asks at once how the sale went."
msgstr ""
"Povezava je spet tu: blagajna takoj vpraša, kako se je prodaja končala."

msgid ""
"The phone switched off and you opened the register again: the sale comes "
"back by itself and says how it ended."
msgstr ""
"Telefon se je ugasnil in ste znova odprli blagajno: prodaja se vrne sama in "
"pove, kako se je končala."

msgid "Type an amount and press OK: then the pretend customer can pay."
msgstr "Vpišite znesek in pritisnite OK: potem lahko namišljena stranka plača."

msgid "The customer has the code in front of them. Choose what they do."
msgstr "Stranka ima kodo pred seboj. Izberite, kaj naredi."

msgid "Exercise done: {name}."
msgstr "Vaja opravljena: {name}."

msgid "All the exercises are done. Now the real thing."
msgstr "Vse vaje so opravljene. Zdaj zares."

msgid "The next sale is real. The first times, ask the owner to stay close."
msgstr ""
"Naslednja prodaja je prava. Prvih nekajkrat prosite lastnika, naj bo blizu."

msgid "Back to the register"
msgstr "Nazaj na blagajno"

msgid "Open the real register"
msgstr "Odprite pravo blagajno"

msgid ""
"Now a real sale: open the register and pay yourself a small amount from "
"another phone."
msgstr ""
"Zdaj prava prodaja: odprite blagajno in si z drugega telefona plačajte "
"majhen znesek."

msgid "Go to the first day"
msgstr "Na prvi dan"

msgid ""
"To take real payments the shop needs its wallet: it takes a few minutes."
msgstr ""
"Za prava plačila trgovina potrebuje svojo denarnico: to vzame nekaj minut."

msgid "The next sale is real."
msgstr "Naslednja prodaja je prava."

msgid "Practice"
msgstr "Vadba"

msgid "No real money: nothing here is a payment."
msgstr "Brez pravega denarja: nič tukaj ni plačilo."

msgid "The pretend customer"
msgstr "Namišljena stranka"

msgid "Pays"
msgstr "Plača"

msgid "Does not pay"
msgstr "Ne plača"

msgid "The connection drops"
msgstr "Povezava se prekine"

msgid "The connection is back"
msgstr "Povezava je spet tu"

msgid "The phone switches off"
msgstr "Telefon se ugasne"

msgid ""
"Without JavaScript the practice register does not move. Read the exercises "
"here below: each one says what the register shows and what you do."
msgstr ""
"Brez JavaScripta se vadbena blagajna ne premika. Preberite vaje spodaj: "
"vsaka pove, kaj pokaže blagajna in kaj storite vi."

msgid "Exercises"
msgstr "Vaje"

msgid "Take 3.50"
msgstr "Sprejmite 3,50"

msgid "Type 3, 5, 0 and press OK. Then press «Pays»."
msgstr "Vpišite 3, 5, 0 in pritisnite OK. Nato pritisnite »Plača«."

msgid "When do you hand over the goods?"
msgstr "Kdaj izročite blago?"

msgid ""
"When the register shows the green tick and «Payment received». Not before."
msgstr "Ko blagajna pokaže zeleno kljukico in »Plačilo prejeto«. Ne prej."

msgid "The customer says they paid, but the register is waiting"
msgstr "Stranka pravi, da je plačala, blagajna pa čaka"

msgid ""
"Start a sale, press «The connection drops», then «Pays». The customer shows "
"you «Sent» on their phone."
msgstr ""
"Začnite prodajo, pritisnite »Povezava se prekine«, nato »Plača«. Stranka vam "
"na svojem telefonu pokaže »Poslano«."

msgid "What do you do?"
msgstr "Kaj storite?"

msgid ""
"Do not hand over the goods yet, and do not cancel the sale. Only the green "
"tick on this screen counts. Wait for the connection: the register keeps the "
"sale and says how it ended."
msgstr ""
"Blaga še ne izročite in prodaje ne prekličite. Šteje samo zelena kljukica na "
"tem zaslonu. Počakajte na povezavo: blagajna prodajo obdrži in pove, kako se "
"je končala."

msgid "The phone switches off during a sale"
msgstr "Telefon se med prodajo ugasne"

msgid "Start a sale, press «The phone switches off», then «Pays»."
msgstr "Začnite prodajo, pritisnite »Telefon se ugasne«, nato »Plača«."

msgid "Now the real thing"
msgstr "Zdaj zares"

msgid "Start the practice again"
msgstr "Začnite vadbo znova"

msgid "Practise without money"
msgstr "Vadite brez denarja"

msgid "Practise first, without money"
msgstr "Najprej vadite, brez denarja"

msgid "code for the customer to scan, which no wallet can pay"
msgstr "koda, ki jo stranka skenira in je ne more plačati nobena denarnica"

msgid "password"
msgstr "geslo"

msgid "A password was set or changed on your account."
msgstr "Za vaš profil je bilo nastavljeno ali spremenjeno geslo."

msgid "access to the admin"
msgstr "dostop do administracije"

msgid "Your account was given, or lost, access to the site's administration."
msgstr ""
"Vaš profil je dobil (ali izgubil) dostop do administracije spletnega mesta."

msgid "all rights in the admin"
msgstr "vse pravice v administraciji"

msgid "Your account was given, or lost, all the rights over the site."
msgstr "Vaš profil je dobil (ali izgubil) vse pravice na spletnem mestu."

msgid "switched on or off"
msgstr "vklopljen ali izklopljen"

msgid "Your account was switched on or off."
msgstr "Vaš profil je bil vklopljen ali izklopljen."

msgid "name it signs in with"
msgstr "ime za prijavo"

msgid "The name your account signs in with was replaced by another one."
msgstr "Ime, s katerim se prijavlja vaš profil, je bilo zamenjano z drugim."

msgid "groups"
msgstr "skupine"

msgid "The rights of your account were changed."
msgstr "Pravice vašega profila so bile spremenjene."

msgid "permissions"
msgstr "dovoljenja"

msgid "owner of a shop"
msgstr "lastnik trgovine"

msgid "A shop of yours was handed to another account."
msgstr "Ena od vaših trgovin je bila prenesena na drug profil."

msgid "Telegram chat of a shop"
msgstr "klepet trgovine v Telegramu"

msgid ""
"The Telegram chat that receives the notices of a shop of yours was changed."
msgstr ""
"Spremenjen je bil klepet v Telegramu, ki prejema obvestila ene od vaših "
"trgovin."

msgid "account deleted"
msgstr "profil izbrisan"

msgid "Your account was deleted."
msgstr "Vaš profil je bil izbrisan."

msgid "the admin"
msgstr "iz administracije"

msgid "the pages of the site"
msgstr "prek strani spletnega mesta"

msgid "a command or the shell"
msgstr "z ukazom ali iz lupine"

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"If you know why, you do not need to do anything. If you do not, write to "
"{email} now."
msgstr ""
"Če veste zakaj, vam ni treba storiti ničesar. Če ne veste, takoj pišite na "
"{email}."

msgid "If you know why, you do not need to do anything. If you do not, tell the community now."
msgstr "Če veste zakaj, vam ni treba storiti ničesar. Če ne veste, takoj obvestite skupnost."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Someone who runs the site changed your account on {site}:"
msgstr "Nekdo, ki upravlja spletno mesto, je spremenil vaš profil na {site}:"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Shops on your account: {shops}."
msgstr "Trgovine v vašem profilu: {shops}."

msgid "your account was changed"
msgstr "vaš profil je bil spremenjen"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "By {actor}, from {via}."
msgstr "Kdo: {actor}, {via}."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "From {via}."
msgstr "Narejeno {via}."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Account change: {shops}."
msgstr "Profil spremenjen: {shops}."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Changed: {what}."
msgstr "Spremenjeno: {what}."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "The register: {link}"
msgstr "Dnevnik: {link}"

msgid "shops"
msgstr "trgovine"

msgid "what changed"
msgstr "kaj se je spremenilo"

msgid "who"
msgstr "kdo"

msgid "when"
msgstr "kdaj"

msgid "account"
msgstr "profil"

msgid "told"
msgstr "obveščeni"

msgid "not told"
msgstr "niso obveščeni"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "The account of {shops} was changed from {via} by {actor}."
msgstr "Profil trgovine {shops} je bil spremenjen {via} (uporabnik: {actor})."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "The account of {shops} was changed from {via}."
msgstr "Profil trgovine {shops} je bil spremenjen {via}."

#, python-format
msgid "On %(when)s someone who runs the site changed your account:"
msgstr "%(when)s je nekdo, ki upravlja spletno mesto, spremenil vaš profil:"

msgid ""
"You are signed in to the site's administration. Staff accounts do not open "
"the pages of a shop, not even their own: to use a shop, sign out of the "
"administration and sign in here as the shop."
msgstr ""
"Prijavljeni ste v administracijo spletnega mesta. Profili ekipe ne odpirajo "
"strani trgovine, niti svoje: če želite uporabljati trgovino, se odjavite iz "
"administracije in se tukaj prijavite kot trgovina."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(count)s change to the account of a shop's owner in the last two weeks:"
msgid_plural ""
"%(count)s changes to the accounts of shops' owners in the last two weeks:"
msgstr[0] ""
"%(count)s sprememba profila lastnika trgovine v zadnjih dveh tednih:"
msgstr[1] ""
"%(count)s spremembi profilov lastnikov trgovin v zadnjih dveh tednih:"
msgstr[2] ""
"%(count)s spremembe profilov lastnikov trgovin v zadnjih dveh tednih:"
msgstr[3] ""
"%(count)s sprememb profilov lastnikov trgovin v zadnjih dveh tednih:"

msgid "see the register"
msgstr "poglejte dnevnik"

msgid "origin"
msgstr "izvor"

msgid "email"
msgstr "e-pošta"

msgid "Telegram chat of the shop"
msgstr "klepet trgovine v Telegramu"

msgid "chat of the community"
msgstr "klepet skupnosti"

msgid "account change"
msgstr "sprememba profila"

msgid "account changes"
msgstr "spremembe profilov"

msgid "No wallet yet, or not sure how to pay? Here is how, step by step."
msgstr ""
"Nimate denarnice ali ne veste, kako plačati? Tukaj je postopek, korak za "
"korakom."

msgid ""
"The first time takes a few minutes. After that, paying takes a few seconds."
msgstr "Prvič traja nekaj minut. Potem plačilo traja nekaj sekund."

msgid "Which one is you?"
msgstr "Kaj velja za vas?"

msgid "I don't have a wallet"
msgstr "Nimam denarnice"

msgid "We take you through it, in three short steps. It is free."
msgstr "Vodimo vas v treh kratkih korakih. Brezplačno je."

msgid "I have a wallet, but I'm not sure how to pay"
msgstr "Denarnico imam, a ne vem dobro, kako plačati"

msgid "What to scan, what to expect, and what to do if it says error."
msgstr "Kaj skenirati, kaj pričakovati in kaj storiti, če javi napako."

msgid ""
"Nothing here asks for your name, your email or your phone number, and "
"nothing is kept about you."
msgstr ""
"Tukaj vas nihče ne vpraša za ime, e-poštni naslov ali telefonsko številko in "
"o vas ne ostane nič."

msgid "More about wallets, from our community"
msgstr "Več o denarnicah, iz naše skupnosti"

msgid "Back to how to pay here"
msgstr "Nazaj na »Kako plačate tukaj«"

msgid "Paying with bitcoin at %(name)s"
msgstr "Plačilo z bitcoinom v %(name)s"

msgid "On a bill of %(bill)s, you save %(saving)s."
msgstr "Pri računu %(bill)s prihranite %(saving)s."

msgid "Install your wallet"
msgstr "Namestite svojo denarnico"

msgid "Get ready to pay"
msgstr "Pripravite se na plačilo"

msgid "No wallet yet? Three short steps."
msgstr "Še nimate denarnice? Trije kratki koraki."

msgid "The three steps"
msgstr "Trije koraki"

msgid "Choose"
msgstr "Izberite"

msgid "Install"
msgstr "Namestite"

msgid "Get ready"
msgstr "Pripravite se"

msgid "done"
msgstr "opravljeno"

msgid ""
"A wallet is an app on your phone. You keep your bitcoin in it and you pay "
"with it. It is free, and the money stays yours: nobody else can move it, not "
"even us."
msgstr ""
"Denarnica je aplikacija na telefonu. V njej hranite svoje bitcoine in z njo "
"plačujete. Je brezplačna in denar ostane vaš: nihče drug ga ne more "
"premakniti, niti mi."

msgid "Any of these is fine. Pick one."
msgstr "Vsaka od teh je dobra. Izberite eno."

msgid "Show the wallets for:"
msgstr "Prikažite denarnice za:"

msgid ""
"None of the wallets on our list is for this phone. Show all of them, or ask "
"us."
msgstr ""
"Nobena denarnica z našega seznama ni za ta telefon. Prikažite vse ali "
"vprašajte nas."

msgid "The wallets we suggest"
msgstr "Denarnice, ki jih priporočamo"

msgid "I have chosen: next"
msgstr "Izbrano: naprej"

msgid "I already have a wallet"
msgstr "Denarnico že imam"

msgid "Install your wallet and make it"
msgstr "Namestite denarnico in jo ustvarite"

msgid "Make your wallet"
msgstr "Ustvarite svojo denarnico"

msgid "Write the words on paper"
msgstr "Besede zapišite na papir"

msgid ""
"Write them in order, on paper, and keep the paper somewhere safe. With them "
"you get your money back if you lose the phone."
msgstr ""
"Zapišite jih po vrsti na papir in papir hranite na varnem. Z njimi dobite "
"denar nazaj, če izgubite telefon."

msgid ""
"Never type those words anywhere else, and never photograph them or send "
"them. Nobody will ever ask you for them: not the shop, not us, not the "
"makers of the wallet. Whoever has the words has your money."
msgstr ""
"Teh besed nikoli ne vpisujte nikamor drugam, ne fotografirajte jih in jih ne "
"pošiljajte. Nihče vas jih ne bo nikoli vprašal: ne trgovina, ne mi, ne "
"izdelovalci denarnice. Kdor ima besede, ima vaš denar."

msgid "My wallet is ready: next"
msgstr "Moja denarnica je pripravljena: naprej"

msgid "Choose another wallet"
msgstr "Izberite drugo denarnico"

msgid "Get your first sats"
msgstr "Prvi satoši"

msgid "Put some bitcoin in it"
msgstr "Vanjo dajte nekaj bitcoina"

msgid "Copy your address"
msgstr "Kopirajte svoj naslov"

msgid ""
"In the wallet, press Receive. It shows a code and an address under it. Copy "
"the address: on a test network it starts with %(start)s."
msgstr ""
"V denarnici pritisnite »Prejmi«. Pokaže kodo in pod njo naslov. Kopirajte "
"naslov: na testnem omrežju se začne z %(start)s."

msgid "Ask for a few sats"
msgstr "Prosite za nekaj satošijev"

msgid "Wait for them"
msgstr "Počakajte nanje"

msgid "When the sats show in your wallet, you are ready."
msgstr "Ko se satoši prikažejo v denarnici, lahko plačate."

msgid ""
"Your wallet is ready, and it is empty. To pay you need a little bitcoin in "
"it: the price of a coffee is enough to try."
msgstr ""
"Vaša denarnica je pripravljena in prazna. Za plačilo potrebujete v njej malo "
"bitcoina: za preizkus je dovolj cena kave."

msgid "Ask someone who has some"
msgstr "Vprašajte nekoga, ki ga ima"

msgid ""
"The simplest way: ask a friend who has bitcoin to send you a small amount. "
"In your wallet press Receive and show them the code."
msgstr ""
"Najpreprosteje: prijatelja, ki ima bitcoin, prosite, naj vam pošlje majhen "
"znesek. V denarnici pritisnite »Prejmi« in mu pokažite kodo."

msgid "Or find your own way"
msgstr "Ali poiščite svojo pot"

msgid ""
"Where to get bitcoin is up to you: we do not sell it and we do not suggest "
"any company."
msgstr ""
"Kje dobiti bitcoin, je vaša odločitev: mi ga ne prodajamo in ne priporočamo "
"nobenega podjetja."

msgid "What our community can tell you about it"
msgstr "Kaj vam o tem lahko pove naša skupnost"

msgid "Then you can pay here"
msgstr "Potem lahko plačate tukaj"

msgid "How to pay, step by step"
msgstr "Kako plačate, korak za korakom"

msgid "Back to the previous step"
msgstr "Nazaj na prejšnji korak"

msgid "Paying at %(name)s"
msgstr "Plačilo v %(name)s"

msgid "Choose <span class=\"visually-hidden\">%(name)s</span>"
msgstr "Izberite <span class=\"visually-hidden\">%(name)s</span>"

msgid "Install %(name)s and make your wallet"
msgstr "Namestite %(name)s in ustvarite svojo denarnico"

msgid "The page of %(name)s"
msgstr "Stran %(name)s"

msgid ""
"This site works on a test network, called %(network)s. Its sats are for "
"trying: they are not worth anything. Your wallet has to be set to %"
"(network)s too: look for “network” in its settings."
msgstr ""
"To spletno mesto deluje na testnem omrežju, ki se imenuje %(network)s. "
"Njegovi satoši so za preizkušanje: nič niso vredni. Tudi vaša denarnica mora "
"biti nastavljena na %(network)s: v nastavitvah poiščite »omrežje«."

msgid ""
"This site has no faucet. Write to <a href=\"mailto:%(email)s\">%(email)s</a> "
"and ask for a few test sats."
msgstr ""
"To spletno mesto nima pipe (faucet). Pišite na <a href=\"mailto:%(email)s\">%"
"(email)s</a> in prosite za nekaj testnih satošijev."

msgid "Not sure? Write to <a href=\"mailto:%(email)s\">%(email)s</a>."
msgstr "Ne veste, kako? Pišite na <a href=\"mailto:%(email)s\">%(email)s</a>."

msgid ""
"At the till of %(name)s, ask to pay in bitcoin. The till shows a code: you "
"scan it with your wallet and confirm."
msgstr ""
"Pri blagajni v %(name)s recite, da želite plačati z bitcoinom. Blagajna "
"pokaže kodo: skenirate jo z denarnico in potrdite."

msgid "Back to %(name)s"
msgstr "Nazaj na %(name)s"

msgid "What to scan, what to expect, and what to do if your wallet says error."
msgstr ""
"Kaj skenirati, kaj pričakovati in kaj storiti, če denarnica javi napako."

msgid ""
"You have a wallet. Here is what happens at the till, and what to do if "
"something looks wrong."
msgstr ""
"Denarnico imate. Tukaj je, kaj se zgodi pri blagajni in kaj storiti, če kaj "
"ni prav."

msgid "Ask to pay in bitcoin"
msgstr "Recite, da želite plačati z bitcoinom"

msgid "Here it works with Lightning. Most wallets can do it."
msgstr "Tukaj se plača prek Lightninga. Večina denarnic to zna."

msgid ""
"Here it works on-chain: your wallet has to send on-chain, not with Lightning."
msgstr ""
"Tukaj se plača on-chain: vaša denarnica mora poslati on-chain, ne prek "
"Lightninga."

msgid "Lightning or on-chain, whichever your wallet uses."
msgstr "Lightning ali on-chain, kar uporablja vaša denarnica."

msgid "Look at the code on the till"
msgstr "Poglejte kodo na blagajni"

msgid ""
"The till shows a square code with the amount. It is the shop's phone: you do "
"not need to touch it."
msgstr ""
"Blagajna pokaže kvadratno kodo z zneskom. To je telefon trgovine: ni se vam "
"ga treba dotikati."

msgid "Scan it with your wallet"
msgstr "Skenirajte jo z denarnico"

msgid ""
"Open your wallet and press Scan, Pay or Send: the name changes from one "
"wallet to another. Point the camera at the code."
msgstr ""
"Odprite denarnico in pritisnite »Skeniraj«, »Plačaj« ali »Pošlji«: ime se "
"razlikuje od denarnice do denarnice. Kamero usmerite v kodo."

msgid "Check the amount and confirm"
msgstr "Preverite znesek in potrdite"

msgid ""
"The amount must be the price you were told. Then press the button that sends "
"the payment."
msgstr ""
"Znesek mora biti cena, ki so vam jo povedali. Nato pritisnite gumb, ki "
"pošlje plačilo."

msgid "Wait for the tick"
msgstr "Počakajte na kljukico"

msgid ""
"Your wallet shows a tick, or says the payment was sent. The cashier waits "
"for the tick on the till: only the till knows that the money arrived."
msgstr ""
"Denarnica pokaže kljukico ali sporoči, da je plačilo poslano. Kdor je pri "
"blagajni, čaka na kljukico na blagajni: samo blagajna ve, da je denar "
"prispel."

msgid "What to expect"
msgstr "Kaj pričakovati"

msgid ""
"On-chain, the bitcoin network needs about ten minutes to confirm the "
"payment. The till says it is waiting: that is normal. Stay a moment, or ask "
"the cashier."
msgstr ""
"Pri on-chain plačilu omrežje Bitcoin potrebuje približno deset minut, da "
"potrdi plačilo. Blagajna pove, da čaka: to je normalno. Počakajte trenutek "
"ali vprašajte pri blagajni."

msgid "If your wallet says error"
msgstr "Če denarnica javi napako"

msgid "It does not scan"
msgstr "Ne skenira"

msgid ""
"Use the scanner inside your wallet, not the camera of the phone. Hold the "
"phone still, and make the screen of the shop's phone and yours brighter."
msgstr ""
"Uporabite bralnik v denarnici, ne kamere telefona. Telefon držite pri miru "
"in povečajte svetlost zaslona telefona trgovine in svojega."

msgid ""
"Still nothing? Ask the cashier to show the code as text. You copy the text "
"and paste it in your wallet."
msgstr ""
"Še vedno nič? Pri blagajni prosite, naj kodo prikažejo kot besedilo. "
"Besedilo kopirate in ga prilepite v denarnico."

msgid "It says there is not enough money"
msgstr "Pravi, da ni dovolj denarja"

msgid ""
"Your wallet holds less than the price. An on-chain payment also needs a "
"little more for the network's fee. Add some bitcoin to the wallet, or pay "
"the rest another way."
msgstr ""
"V denarnici je manj, kot je cena. On-chain plačilo potrebuje še nekaj več za "
"omrežnino. Dodajte bitcoin v denarnico ali preostanek plačajte drugače."

msgid ""
"Your wallet holds less than the price. Add some bitcoin to the wallet, or "
"pay the rest another way."
msgstr ""
"V denarnici je manj, kot je cena. Dodajte bitcoin v denarnico ali preostanek "
"plačajte drugače."

msgid "It says the code is not valid, or the network is wrong"
msgstr "Pravi, da koda ni veljavna ali da je omrežje napačno"

msgid ""
"A wallet set to a test network cannot pay real bitcoin, and the other way "
"round. In the settings of your wallet, switch to real bitcoin."
msgstr ""
"Denarnica, nastavljena na testno omrežje, ne more plačati s pravimi "
"bitcoini, in obratno. V nastavitvah denarnice preklopite na prave bitcoine."

msgid "It says the code has expired"
msgstr "Pravi, da je koda potekla"

msgid ""
"A code lasts only a few minutes. Ask the cashier for a new one and scan it "
"again. Nothing was charged."
msgstr ""
"Koda velja samo nekaj minut. Pri blagajni prosite za novo in jo znova "
"skenirajte. Nič ni bilo zaračunano."

msgid "It says the payment failed"
msgstr "Pravi, da plačilo ni uspelo"

msgid ""
"A Lightning payment sometimes cannot find its way. Check that your phone is "
"online, wait a minute and try again. Nothing is charged for a payment that "
"failed."
msgstr ""
"Plačilo Lightning včasih ne najde poti. Preverite, ali je telefon povezan z "
"internetom, počakajte minuto in poskusite znova. Za neuspelo plačilo se ne "
"zaračuna nič."

msgid "Still failing? Tell the cashier: they know who to call."
msgstr "Še vedno ne gre? Povejte pri blagajni: tam vedo, koga poklicati."

msgid "I paid, but the till shows nothing"
msgstr "Plačilo je poslano, blagajna pa ne pokaže ničesar"

msgid ""
"Do not pay again. Wait half a minute: the till catches up. The cashier looks "
"at the till, not at your phone."
msgstr ""
"Ne plačajte znova. Počakajte pol minute: blagajna se posodobi. Kdor je pri "
"blagajni, gleda blagajno, ne vašega telefona."

msgid ""
"If it does not change, show the cashier the confirmation in your wallet. The "
"owner of the shop can check the payment."
msgstr ""
"Če se nič ne spremeni, pri blagajni pokažite potrditev v denarnici. Lastnik "
"trgovine lahko plačilo preveri."

msgid "I paid too little, or too much"
msgstr "Plačano je premalo ali preveč"

msgid ""
"With Lightning you pay the exact amount of the code: it cannot be too little "
"or too much. If your wallet shows a little more, that is the fee of the "
"wallet."
msgstr ""
"Prek Lightninga plačate natančen znesek kode: ne more biti premalo ne "
"preveč. Če denarnica pokaže nekaj več, je to provizija denarnice."

msgid ""
"A Lightning payment is always the exact amount of the code. With an on-chain "
"payment the till shows the cashier how much arrived. Too little: the sale is "
"not paid, and the cashier asks you for the rest or cancels it. Too much: the "
"cashier checks the shop's wallet. Agree with the shop how you get back what "
"you paid over, or what you paid for a cancelled sale: the site holds no "
"money and cannot return it."
msgstr ""
"Plačilo Lightning je vedno natančen znesek kode. Pri on-chain plačilu "
"blagajna pokaže, koliko je prispelo. Premalo: prodaja ni plačana, pri "
"blagajni vas prosijo za preostanek ali jo prekličejo. Preveč: pri blagajni "
"preverijo v denarnici trgovine. S trgovino se dogovorite, kako dobite nazaj, "
"kar ste plačali preveč ali za preklicano prodajo: spletno mesto ne hrani "
"denarja in ga ne more vrniti."

msgid "I don't have a wallet yet"
msgstr "Še nimam denarnice"

msgid "How to pay at %(name)s"
msgstr "Kako plačate v %(name)s"

msgid ""
"This shop takes %(percent)s%% off when you pay in bitcoin: ask for it at the "
"till. On a bill of %(bill)s, you save %(saving)s."
msgstr ""
"Ta trgovina da %(percent)s %% popusta, če plačate z bitcoinom: zanj "
"vprašajte pri blagajni. Pri računu %(bill)s prihranite %(saving)s."

msgid ""
"This site works on a test network, called %(network)s. A wallet set to real "
"bitcoin cannot pay it. In the settings of your wallet, switch to %(network)s."
msgstr ""
"To spletno mesto deluje na testnem omrežju, ki se imenuje %(network)s. "
"Denarnica, nastavljena na prave bitcoine, tukaj ne more plačati. V "
"nastavitvah denarnice preklopite na %(network)s."

msgid "No wallet? Scan here"
msgstr "Nimate denarnice? Skenirajte tukaj"

msgid ""
"Print it on an A4 sheet and keep it at the till, where the customer can see "
"it. When someone says they have no wallet, point at it: they scan the code "
"and the phone takes them through, step by step. You do not need to explain "
"anything."
msgstr ""
"Natisnite jo na list A4 in jo imejte pri blagajni, kjer jo stranka vidi. Ko "
"kdo reče, da nima denarnice, pokažite nanjo: skenira kodo in telefon ga vodi "
"korak za korakom. Vam ni treba ničesar razlagati."

msgid "See what your customer sees"
msgstr "Poglejte, kaj vidi vaša stranka"

msgid "No wallet yet?"
msgstr "Še nimate denarnice?"

msgid ""
"Scan this code with your phone. In a few minutes you can pay here in bitcoin."
msgstr ""
"To kodo skenirajte s telefonom. V nekaj minutah lahko tukaj plačate z "
"bitcoinom."

msgid "Code that opens the guide for customers"
msgstr "Koda, ki odpre navodila za stranke"

msgid "Choose a free wallet and install it"
msgstr "Izberite brezplačno denarnico in jo namestite"

msgid "Get your first bitcoin in it"
msgstr "Vanjo dajte prve bitcoine"

msgid "Scan the code at the till and pay"
msgstr "Skenirajte kodo pri blagajni in plačajte"

msgid "Never paid with bitcoin?"
msgstr "Še nikoli niste plačali z bitcoinom?"

msgid "Card for customers without a wallet"
msgstr "Kartica za stranke brez denarnice"

msgid "All"
msgstr "Vse"

msgid "Staff register"
msgstr "Blagajna zaposlenega"

msgid "What to do, and the words for the merchant: {link}"
msgstr "Kaj storiti in besede za trgovca: {link}"

msgid "%(site)s: %(count)d thing to do about the shops' registers"
msgid_plural "%(site)s: %(count)d things to do about the shops' registers"
msgstr[0] "%(site)s: %(count)d opravilo pri blagajnah trgovin"
msgstr[1] "%(site)s: %(count)d opravili pri blagajnah trgovin"
msgstr[2] "%(site)s: %(count)d opravila pri blagajnah trgovin"
msgstr[3] "%(site)s: %(count)d opravil pri blagajnah trgovin"

msgid "Nothing new since the summary of %(date)s: a reminder, once a week."
msgstr "Nič novega od povzetka z dne %(date)s: opomnik, enkrat na teden."

msgid "New:"
msgstr "Novo:"

msgid "Still to do:"
msgstr "Še za opraviti:"

msgid "%(count)d thing solved since the last summary."
msgid_plural "%(count)d things solved since the last summary."
msgstr[0] "%(count)d stvar rešena od zadnjega povzetka."
msgstr[1] "%(count)d stvari rešeni od zadnjega povzetka."
msgstr[2] "%(count)d stvari rešene od zadnjega povzetka."
msgstr[3] "%(count)d stvari rešenih od zadnjega povzetka."

msgid "Holidays"
msgstr "Dopust"

msgid "Building works"
msgstr "Gradbena dela"

msgid "Personal reasons"
msgstr "Osebni razlogi"

msgid "Other"
msgstr "Drugo"

msgid "closed from"
msgstr "zaprto od"

msgid "reopens on"
msgstr "spet odprto"

msgid "reason"
msgstr "razlog"

msgid "The shop reopens after the day it closes."
msgstr "Trgovina se znova odpre po dnevu, ko se zapre."

msgid "Closed for holidays"
msgstr "Zaprto zaradi dopusta"

msgid "Closed for works"
msgstr "Zaprto zaradi del"

msgid "Closed for personal reasons"
msgstr "Zaprto iz osebnih razlogov"

msgid "Closed for a while"
msgstr "Zaprto za nekaj časa"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "{what} · back on {date}"
msgstr "{what} · spet odprto {date}"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "{what} · back soon"
msgstr "{what} · kmalu spet odprto"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "{what} from {date} · back on {back}"
msgstr "{what} od {date} · spet odprto {back}"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "{what} from {date}"
msgstr "{what} od {date}"

msgid "Why"
msgstr "Zakaj"

msgid "Closed from"
msgstr "Zaprto od"

msgid "I open again on"
msgstr "Spet odprem dne"

msgid "The first day the shop is open."
msgstr "Prvi dan, ko je trgovina odprta."

msgid "I will say when I open again"
msgstr "Kdaj spet odprem, sporočim pozneje"

msgid "Say the first day of the closure."
msgstr "Vpišite prvi dan zaprtja."

msgid "Choose today or a day to come."
msgstr "Izberite današnji ali kateri od prihodnjih dni."

msgid "Say when you open again, or tick that you will say."
msgstr ""
"Vpišite, kdaj spet odprete, ali označite, da boste to sporočili pozneje."

msgid "You open again after the day you close."
msgstr "Spet odprete po dnevu, ko zaprete."

msgid ""
"That is more than a year: choose an earlier day, or tick that you will say."
msgstr ""
"To je več kot leto dni: izberite zgodnejši dan ali označite, da boste to "
"sporočili pozneje."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "{shop}: welcome back"
msgstr "{shop}: dobrodošli nazaj"

msgid ""
"The register worked while you were away, so there is nothing to turn on. To "
"be sure that everything works, try a small payment of your own: open the "
"register and pay it from another phone."
msgstr ""
"Blagajna je delovala tudi, ko vas ni bilo, zato ni treba ničesar vklopiti. "
"Da boste prepričani, da vse deluje, preizkusite majhno lastno plačilo: "
"odprite blagajno in plačajte z drugega telefona."

msgid "Too many changes in a short time: try again in a while."
msgstr "Preveč sprememb v kratkem času: poskusite znova čez nekaj časa."

msgid "Saved: the shop says it is closed."
msgstr "Shranjeno: trgovina sporoča, da je zaprta."

msgid "Saved: the shop will say it is closed."
msgstr "Shranjeno: trgovina bo sporočala, da je zaprta."

msgid "The shop is open."
msgstr "Trgovina je odprta."

msgid "Welcome back! The shop says it is open again."
msgstr "Dobrodošli nazaj! Trgovina sporoča, da je spet odprta."

msgid "Cancelled: the shop is open."
msgstr "Preklicano: trgovina je odprta."

msgid ""
"Closing for holidays, for works or for any other reason? Say it here. The "
"map and your shop page tell your customers, kindly, and the shop stays on "
"the map. Nobody is worried: the icons on your card do not fade for the days "
"you are away."
msgstr ""
"Zapirate zaradi dopusta, del ali iz drugega razloga? Napišite tukaj. "
"Zemljevid in stran vaše trgovine to vljudno sporočita strankam, trgovina pa "
"ostane na zemljevidu. Nihče se ne vznemiri: ikone na vašem vpisu v dneh, ko "
"vas ni, ne zbledijo."

msgid ""
"Your register keeps working: if someone pays you while you are closed, it is "
"paid as always. Your wallet and the way you get paid do not change."
msgstr ""
"Vaša blagajna deluje naprej: če vam kdo plača, ko je zaprto, plačilo prispe "
"kot vedno. Vaša denarnica in način sprejemanja plačil se ne spremenita."

#, python-format
msgid "Closed since %(date)s."
msgstr "Zaprto od %(date)s."

msgid ""
"If you do not know yet, tick «I will say when I open again»: the shop says "
"it is closed for now, and you open it again from your panel when you are "
"back."
msgstr ""
"Če še ne veste, označite »Kdaj spet odprem, sporočim pozneje«: trgovina "
"sporoča, da je za zdaj zaprta, ko se vrnete, pa jo znova odprete na nadzorni "
"plošči."

msgid "Save the changes"
msgstr "Shranite spremembe"

msgid "I am back: open the shop today"
msgstr "Spet sem tu: trgovino odprem danes"

msgid "Cancel this closure"
msgstr "Prekličite to zaprtje"

msgid ""
"The days are those of the shop's town. Whoever looks at the map sees the "
"reason you choose and the day you open again, nothing else."
msgstr ""
"Dnevi so tisti iz kraja trgovine. Kdor gleda zemljevid, vidi razlog, ki ga "
"izberete, in dan, ko spet odprete, nič drugega."

msgid "Welcome back!"
msgstr "Dobrodošli nazaj!"

msgid ""
"The register worked while you were away: there is nothing to turn on. To be "
"sure, try a small payment of your own: open the register and pay it from "
"another phone."
msgstr ""
"Blagajna je delovala tudi, ko vas ni bilo: ničesar ni treba vklopiti. Za "
"vsak primer preizkusite majhno lastno plačilo: odprite blagajno in plačajte "
"z drugega telefona."

msgid ""
"The map and your shop page say it. The register keeps working, and no alarm "
"goes off for these days."
msgstr ""
"Zemljevid in stran vaše trgovine to sporočata. Blagajna deluje naprej in za "
"te dni se ne sproži noben alarm."

msgid "Change the dates"
msgstr "Spremenite datume"

msgid "I am back today"
msgstr "Danes spet odprto"

msgid "Closing for a while?"
msgstr "Zapirate za nekaj časa?"

msgid ""
"Holidays, works, a bad time: say it, and the map tells your customers "
"kindly. The shop stays on the map, the register keeps working, and the icons "
"on your card do not fade."
msgstr ""
"Dopust, dela, težko obdobje: napišite, in zemljevid bo to vljudno sporočil "
"strankam. Trgovina ostane na zemljevidu, blagajna deluje naprej in ikone na "
"vašem vpisu ne zbledijo."

msgid "Choose the days"
msgstr "Izberite dneve"

msgid "Closed from today, until I say so"
msgstr "Zaprto od danes, dokler ne sporočim drugače"

msgid "closed for a while: no alarms"
msgstr "zaprto za nekaj časa: brez alarmov"

msgid "Closed for a while for over three months."
msgstr "Zaprto za nekaj časa že več kot tri mesece."

msgid ""
"Is your shop coming back? If it is closed for good, tell us and we mark it "
"as history on the map."
msgstr ""
"Se bo vaša trgovina vrnila? Če je zaprta za vedno, nam povejte in jo na "
"zemljevidu označimo kot zgodovinsko."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Welcome back! Your shop {shop} is open again."
msgstr "Dobrodošli nazaj! Vaša trgovina {shop} je spet odprta."

msgid ""
"One thing to look at: your Lightning address does not work now, and "
"customers cannot pay you with it. Your panel says what to do."
msgstr ""
"Ena stvar, ki jo poglejte: vaš Lightning naslov zdaj ne deluje in stranke "
"vam z njim ne morejo plačati. Na nadzorni plošči piše, kaj storiti."

msgid ""
"When it works again, try a small payment of your own: open the register and "
"pay it from another phone."
msgstr ""
"Ko spet deluje, preizkusite majhno lastno plačilo: odprite blagajno in "
"plačajte z drugega telefona."

msgid ""
"Closed for a while, and the Lightning address does not work: nobody is told "
"until the shop opens again."
msgstr ""
"Zaprto za nekaj časa, Lightning naslov pa ne deluje: nihče ni obveščen, "
"dokler se trgovina ne odpre znova."

msgid "Sign out of the administration"
msgstr "Odjavite se iz administracije"

# shops/diagnosis.py: what the site keeps about the shop, for whoever answers
# the phone
msgid ""
"Help the merchant connect a wallet from their own panel: only they can. "
"Never type an address or a key for them. «Practise without money» works "
"meanwhile."
msgstr ""
"Trgovcu pomagajte povezati denarnico na njegovi nadzorni plošči: to lahko "
"stori samo on. Nikoli ne vpisujte naslova ali ključa namesto njega. Medtem "
"»Vadite brez denarja« deluje."

msgid ""
"Ask the merchant whether they expected it. If not, change nothing and tell "
"whoever runs the site: «Account changes» in the administration says who "
"changed what, from where, and who was told. Never ask for a password."
msgstr ""
"Trgovca vprašajte, ali je za to vedel. Če ni, ničesar ne spreminjajte in "
"obvestite upravljavca spletnega mesta: »Spremembe profilov« v administraciji "
"pove, kdo je kaj spremenil, od kod in kdo je bil obveščen. Nikoli ne "
"sprašujte za geslo."

msgid ""
"Your closure dates are saved, but your shop is marked as historic: the map "
"says nothing about them."
msgstr ""
"Datumi zaprtja so shranjeni, vendar je vaša trgovina označena kot "
"zgodovinska: zemljevid o njih ne pove ničesar."

msgid ""
"A closure only counts for a shop that still trades: a historic shop is "
"closed for good."
msgstr ""
"Zaprtje velja samo za trgovino, ki še posluje: zgodovinska trgovina je "
"zaprta za vedno."

msgid ""
"The registers for your staff cannot work: your shop has no register of its "
"own yet."
msgstr ""
"Blagajne za vaše zaposlene ne morejo delovati: vaša trgovina še nima svoje "
"blagajne."

msgid ""
"Connect the wallet first (see the lines about the register): the staff "
"registers open as soon as the shop has one."
msgstr ""
"Najprej povežite denarnico (glejte vrstice o blagajni): blagajne za "
"zaposlene se odprejo takoj, ko jo trgovina ima."

msgid ""
"Nothing is broken: the owner turned them off. A turned-off register cannot "
"be turned on again; the owner makes a new one."
msgstr ""
"Nič ni pokvarjeno: izklopil jih je lastnik. Izklopljene blagajne ni mogoče "
"znova vklopiti; lastnik ustvari novo."

msgid ""
"The owner opens «Registers for your staff», chooses the register and makes a "
"new code, then the person scans it with their phone. The code is never read "
"out on the phone."
msgstr ""
"Lastnik odpre »Blagajne za vaše zaposlene«, izbere blagajno in ustvari novo "
"kodo, nato jo oseba skenira s svojim telefonom. Kode se nikoli ne narekuje "
"po telefonu."

msgid "The community has taken the certificate away from your shop: ask them why."
msgstr "Skupnost je vaši trgovini odvzela certifikat: vprašajte, zakaj."

msgid "It was revoked in the administration and the site will not give it again until that is undone. Ask the community before saying more."
msgstr "Preklican je bil v administraciji in spletno mesto ga ne bo več podelilo, dokler se to ne razveljavi. Preden poveste kaj več, vprašajte skupnost."

msgid ""
"Customers who scan the card for people without a wallet see only the shop "
"page, because nobody can pay at this shop now."
msgstr ""
"Stranke, ki skenirajo kartico za ljudi brez denarnice, vidijo samo stran "
"trgovine, ker zdaj v tej trgovini nihče ne more plačati."

msgid ""
"It follows from the lines about the shop: the guide opens again when the "
"shop can take payments."
msgstr ""
"Izhaja iz vrstic o trgovini: navodila se znova odprejo, ko trgovina lahko "
"sprejema plačila."

msgid ""
"Before the first real sale you can try the register with a pretend customer: "
"«Practise without money» in your panel. Nothing is charged."
msgstr ""
"Pred prvo pravo prodajo lahko blagajno preizkusite z namišljeno stranko: "
"»Vadite brez denarja« na nadzorni plošči. Nič se ne zaračuna."

msgid ""
"Your shop is here, but nobody has taken it yet: tell us who you are and we "
"help you take it."
msgstr ""
"Vaša trgovina je tukaj, a je še nihče ni prevzel: povejte nam, kdo ste, in "
"pomagamo vam jo prevzeti."

msgid "Nothing to fix. To change the dates the merchant uses «Change the dates» in their panel; the community edits the closure under the shop in the administration."
msgstr "Ničesar ni treba popraviti. Za spremembo datumov trgovec uporabi »Spremenite datume« na svoji nadzorni plošči; skupnost zaprtje uredi pod trgovino v administraciji."

msgid ""
"You are marked as closed, but your shop is not on the map, so nobody reads "
"the notice. The register works the same."
msgstr ""
"Označeni ste kot zaprti, vendar vaše trgovine ni na zemljevidu, zato "
"obvestila nihče ne prebere. Blagajna vseeno deluje."

msgid ""
"Look at the shop_ lines: the notice shows only for a shop that is on the map."
msgstr ""
"Poglejte vrstice shop_: obvestilo se pokaže samo pri trgovini, ki je na "
"zemljevidu."

msgid ""
"The guide for customers without a wallet has no wallet to suggest for the "
"way you get paid."
msgstr ""
"Navodila za stranke brez denarnice nimajo nobene denarnice, ki bi jo "
"priporočila za vaš način sprejemanja plačil."

msgid ""
"The list is in the community's settings (shop_page.wallets): manage.py check "
"says what it left out."
msgstr ""
"Seznam je v nastavitvah skupnosti (shop_page.wallets): manage.py check pove, "
"kaj je izpustil."

msgid ""
"A customer without a wallet scans the card «Card for customers without a "
"wallet» (in your panel) and the phone guides them in three steps."
msgstr ""
"Stranka brez denarnice skenira »Kartica za stranke brez denarnice« (na vaši "
"nadzorni plošči) in telefon jo vodi v treh korakih."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"These registers are turned off, so they take no new payment: {names}. If the "
"person still needs one, add a new one in «Registers for your staff»."
msgstr ""
"Te blagajne so izklopljene, zato ne sprejemajo novih plačil: {names}. Če jo "
"oseba še potrebuje, dodajte novo v »Blagajne za vaše zaposlene«."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"These registers were never opened on a phone, and their code is no longer "
"valid: {names}. The code on the card works once and lasts 24 hours: make a "
"new one in «Registers for your staff»."
msgstr ""
"Te blagajne niso bile nikoli odprte na telefonu in njihova koda ne velja "
"več: {names}. Koda na kartici velja samo enkrat in 24 ur: ustvarite novo v "
"»Blagajne za vaše zaposlene«."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "These registers are working: {names}."
msgstr "Te blagajne delujejo: {names}."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Your shop is certified, since {month}."
msgstr "Vaša trgovina je certificirana od {month}."

msgid ""
"You saved your shop before having a wallet, so it has no register yet and it "
"is not on the map. Open your panel and connect your wallet: it takes a few "
"minutes."
msgstr ""
"Trgovino ste shranili, preden ste imeli denarnico, zato še nima blagajne in "
"ni na zemljevidu. Odprite nadzorno ploščo in povežite denarnico: to vzame "
"nekaj minut."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"On the map and on your shop page it says: «{note}». The register keeps "
"working, and no alarm goes off for these days."
msgstr ""
"Na zemljevidu in na strani vaše trgovine piše: »{note}«. Blagajna deluje "
"naprej in za te dni se ne sproži noben alarm."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "The map and your shop page already say: «{note}»."
msgstr "Zemljevid in stran vaše trgovine že sporočata: »{note}«."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"A closure is saved from {date}: the map starts to say it {days} days before."
msgstr ""
"Shranjeno je zaprtje od {date}: zemljevid ga začne sporočati {days} dni prej."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"These registers wait for the person to scan their code: {names}. The code "
"works once, until the time shown."
msgstr ""
"Te blagajne čakajo, da oseba skenira njihovo kodo: {names}. Koda deluje samo "
"enkrat, do prikazane ure."

msgid ""
"Nothing is broken: the person scans the code with their phone before it "
"expires. If it has expired, the owner makes a new one. The code is never "
"read out on the phone."
msgstr ""
"Nič ni pokvarjeno: oseba kodo skenira s svojim telefonom, preden poteče. Če "
"je potekla, lastnik ustvari novo. Kode se nikoli ne narekuje po telefonu."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The administration changed something that concerns this shop on {date}: "
"{what}. It was done to another account, not to the one signed in now."
msgstr ""
"Administracija je {date} spremenila nekaj, kar zadeva to trgovino: {what}. "
"Sprememba je bila narejena na drugem profilu, ne na tistem, s katerim je kdo "
"prijavljen zdaj."

msgid ""
"If the person on the phone is the one who had the shop before and got the "
"email, ask whether they know why. If not, change nothing and tell whoever "
"runs the site: «Account changes» in the administration says who did it. "
"Never ask for a password."
msgstr ""
"Če je na telefonu oseba, ki je imela trgovino prej in je prejela e-pošto, jo "
"vprašajte, ali ve zakaj. Če ne, ničesar ne spreminjajte in obvestite "
"upravljavca spletnega mesta: »Spremembe profilov« v administraciji pove, kdo "
"je to storil. Nikoli ne sprašujte za geslo."

msgid "Something wrong?"
msgstr "Je kaj narobe?"

msgid "Tell us what is happening. We show you what the site already knows about your shop and what to do now. If it is not enough, you ask the community for help with one tap."
msgstr "Povejte nam, kaj se dogaja. Pokažemo vam, kaj spletno mesto že ve o vaši trgovini in kaj storiti zdaj. Če to ni dovolj, z enim dotikom prosite skupnost za pomoč."

msgid "What is happening?"
msgstr "Kaj se dogaja?"

msgid "Your requests"
msgstr "Vaše prošnje"

msgid "The message to the community did not go out, but the request is saved."
msgstr "Sporočilo skupnosti ni bilo poslano, prošnja pa je shranjena."

msgid ""
"We never ask for the secret words of your wallet, for a key or for a "
"password. If someone asks you, it is not us."
msgstr ""
"Nikoli ne sprašujemo za skrivne besede vaše denarnice, za ključ ali za "
"geslo. Če vas kdo vpraša, to nismo mi."

msgid "You asked %(when)s. Waiting for the community."
msgstr "Vprašali ste %(when)s. Čaka se na skupnost."

msgid "You asked %(when)s. Solved %(solved)s."
msgstr "Vprašali ste %(when)s. Rešeno %(solved)s."

msgid "The community has been told."
msgstr "Skupnost je obveščena."

msgid "The request is saved and the community will see it."
msgstr "Prošnja je shranjena in skupnost jo bo videla."

msgid "What the site knows about your shop"
msgstr "Kaj spletno mesto ve o vaši trgovini"

msgid "Nothing wrong from here."
msgstr "Od tod ni videti, da bi bilo kaj narobe."

msgid "The site also asked your Lightning wallet just now."
msgstr "Spletno mesto je pravkar vprašalo tudi vašo Lightning denarnico."

msgid "This is what the site already has on file for your shop."
msgstr "To je tisto, kar ima spletno mesto o vaši trgovini že zapisano."

msgid "Fine"
msgstr "V redu"

msgid "Checked just now, with your Lightning wallet."
msgstr "Pravkar preverjeno, z vašo Lightning denarnico."

msgid ""
"This page shows only what the site already has. To ask your Lightning wallet "
"now, it takes up to 20 seconds."
msgstr ""
"Ta stran kaže samo to, kar spletno mesto že ima. Če želite zdaj vprašati "
"vašo Lightning denarnico, to traja do 20 sekund."

msgid "Look again, asking your Lightning wallet"
msgstr "Preverite znova in vprašajte Lightning denarnico"

msgid "Ask the community for help"
msgstr "Prosite skupnost za pomoč"

msgid "One tap and the community receives your request together with what you see above. We never ask for the secret words of your wallet, for a key or for a password."
msgstr "Z enim dotikom skupnost prejme vašo prošnjo skupaj s tem, kar vidite zgoraj. Nikoli ne sprašujemo za skrivne besede vaše denarnice, za ključ ali za geslo."

msgid "Please look at what is marked below."
msgstr "Poglejte, kar je označeno spodaj."

msgid "Optional. A few words are enough: what you see and since when."
msgstr "Neobvezno. Dovolj je nekaj besed: kaj vidite in od kdaj."

msgid "Ask for help"
msgstr "Prosite za pomoč"

msgid "It can take a few seconds."
msgstr "Lahko traja nekaj sekund."

msgid "You asked for help %(when)s."
msgstr "Za pomoč ste prosili %(when)s."

msgid "The request is saved and the community will see it, even if the message to them did not go out."
msgstr "Prošnja je shranjena in skupnost jo bo videla, tudi če sporočilo skupnosti ni bilo poslano."

msgid ""
"The payment does not go through, the register does not open, a lost phone…"
msgstr "Plačilo ne gre skozi, blagajna se ne odpre, izgubljen telefon …"

msgid "Solved %(when)s."
msgstr "Rešeno %(when)s."

msgid "Your request «%(symptom)s» is closed. Thank you."
msgstr "Vaša prošnja »%(symptom)s« je zaključena. Hvala."

msgid ""
"The code does not scan, the wallet refuses it, or the register shows no code."
msgstr ""
"Koda se ne prebere, denarnica jo zavrne ali blagajna ne pokaže nobene kode."

msgid ""
"Start the sale again from the register: a new code appears. An old code can "
"stop working."
msgstr ""
"Začnite prodajo znova na blagajni: prikaže se nova koda. Stara koda lahko "
"preneha delovati."

msgid ""
"Ask the customer to scan the code from inside their bitcoin wallet app, not "
"with the camera of the phone, and to check that they have enough in the "
"wallet."
msgstr ""
"Stranko prosite, naj kodo skenira v aplikaciji svoje bitcoin denarnice, ne s "
"kamero telefona, in naj preveri, ali ima v denarnici dovolj."

msgid ""
"A customer with no wallet at all: show them the card «Card for customers "
"without a wallet» (in your panel, under your shop). The phone guides them."
msgstr ""
"Stranka, ki sploh nima denarnice: pokažite ji »Kartica za stranke brez "
"denarnice« (na nadzorni plošči, pod trgovino). Telefon jo vodi."

msgid ""
"Do not keep the customer waiting: if nothing works, they can pay another "
"way. Then ask us for help below."
msgstr ""
"Stranke ne pustite čakati: če nič ne deluje, lahko plača drugače. Nato nas "
"spodaj prosite za pomoč."

msgid "The customer says they paid, but the register keeps waiting."
msgstr "Stranka pravi, da je plačala, blagajna pa še čaka."

msgid ""
"Do not ask the customer to pay again, and do not hand over the goods yet."
msgstr "Stranke ne prosite, naj plača znova, in blaga še ne izročite."

msgid ""
"Open your wallet app: did the money arrive? If it did, the payment is good "
"even if the register is still waiting. Then ask us for help below: we find "
"out why the register did not notice."
msgstr ""
"Odprite aplikacijo denarnice: je denar prispel? Če je, je plačilo veljavno, "
"tudi če blagajna še čaka. Nato nas spodaj prosite za pomoč: ugotovimo, zakaj "
"blagajna tega ni opazila."

msgid ""
"The register page does not load, asks you to sign in, or a person of your "
"staff cannot open theirs."
msgstr ""
"Stran blagajne se ne naloži, zahteva prijavo ali pa kdo od vaših zaposlenih "
"ne more odpreti svoje."

msgid "Reload the page and look at the connection of the phone: wifi or data."
msgstr ""
"Znova naložite stran in preverite povezavo telefona: Wi-Fi ali podatki."

msgid ""
"If it asks you to sign in, sign in again from your panel: with your wallet, "
"or with the link we send to your email."
msgstr ""
"Če zahteva prijavo, se znova prijavite na nadzorni plošči: z denarnico ali s "
"povezavo, ki vam jo pošljemo po e-pošti."

msgid ""
"A register of your staff: the code on its card works once and lasts 24 "
"hours. If it has expired, make a new one in «Registers for your staff»."
msgstr ""
"Blagajna vaših zaposlenih: koda na njeni kartici velja samo enkrat in 24 ur. "
"Če je potekla, ustvarite novo v »Blagajne za vaše zaposlene«."

msgid ""
"You can no longer sign in from the phone you used, or someone else may have "
"it."
msgstr ""
"S telefona, ki ste ga uporabljali, se ne morete več prijaviti, ali pa ga ima "
"morda nekdo drug."

msgid ""
"Your money is safe: it is in your wallet, not in the phone and not on this "
"site."
msgstr ""
"Vaš denar je na varnem: je v vaši denarnici, ne v telefonu in ne na tem "
"spletnem mestu."

msgid ""
"On the new phone, sign in here with your wallet, or with the link we send to "
"your email, if you gave us one."
msgstr ""
"Na novem telefonu se tukaj prijavite z denarnico ali s povezavo, ki vam jo "
"pošljemo po e-pošti, če ste nam dali e-poštni naslov."

msgid ""
"Open your register from your panel and add it to the home screen of the new "
"phone."
msgstr ""
"Odprite svojo blagajno na nadzorni plošči in jo dodajte na domači zaslon "
"novega telefona."

msgid ""
"If somebody else may use the old phone: turn off the registers of your staff "
"that were on it, in «Registers for your staff». Your own register only takes "
"payments, and they go to your wallet."
msgstr ""
"Če bi stari telefon lahko uporabljal kdo drug: v »Blagajne za vaše "
"zaposlene« izklopite blagajne zaposlenih, ki so bile na njem. Vaša lastna "
"blagajna samo sprejema plačila, ta pa gredo v vašo denarnico."

msgid ""
"If your wallet is new too, ask us for help below: only you can connect the "
"new wallet, and we show you how."
msgstr ""
"Če je nova tudi denarnica, nas spodaj prosite za pomoč: novo denarnico lahko "
"povežete samo vi, mi pa vam pokažemo, kako."

msgid "You gave back too much, or a customer paid more than the price."
msgstr "Vrnili ste preveč drobiža ali pa je stranka plačala več, kot je cena."

msgid "If you are not sure what happened, ask us for help below."
msgstr "Če niste prepričani, kaj se je zgodilo, nas spodaj prosite za pomoč."

msgid ""
"Anything else: tell us in a line, and we look at everything the site knows."
msgstr ""
"Karkoli drugega: v eni vrstici nam povejte, kaj se dogaja, in pogledamo vse, "
"kar spletno mesto ve."

msgid "Write in a line what you see and when it started."
msgstr "V eni vrstici napišite, kaj vidite in od kdaj."

msgid ""
"If a customer is waiting, let them pay another way first: we answer "
"afterwards."
msgstr "Če stranka čaka, naj najprej plača drugače: odgovorimo pozneje."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The site watches your Lightning address: it has not answered since {since} "
"(checked {checked})."
msgstr ""
"Spletno mesto spremlja vaš Lightning naslov: {since} se je prenehal odzivati "
"(preverjeno {checked})."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The site watches your Lightning address: it has never answered (checked "
"{checked})."
msgstr ""
"Spletno mesto spremlja vaš Lightning naslov: nikoli se ni odzval (preverjeno "
"{checked})."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The site watches your Lightning address: it worked when it last checked, "
"{checked}."
msgstr ""
"Spletno mesto spremlja vaš Lightning naslov: ob zadnjem preverjanju, "
"{checked}, je deloval."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "By email, to {email}"
msgstr "Po e-pošti, na {email}"

msgid "On Telegram, in the chat of your shop"
msgstr "Na Telegramu, v klepetu vaše trgovine"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "By phone, to {phone} (the one in your shop's details)"
msgstr "Po telefonu, na {phone} (številka v podatkih vaše trgovine)"

msgid "I will look at my panel: it says when it is solved"
msgstr "Spremljam svojo nadzorno ploščo: pove, ko je težava rešena"

msgid "In a line: what do you see?"
msgstr "V eni vrstici: kaj vidite?"

msgid "Please keep it to a line of up to %(limit_value)d characters."
msgstr "Naj bo to ena vrstica z največ %(limit_value)d znaki."

msgid "How do you want us to call you back?"
msgstr "Kako želite, da vas pokličemo nazaj?"

msgid ""
"This looks like a secret (a private key or the words of a wallet): never "
"write it here. We never ask for it."
msgstr ""
"To je videti kot skrivnost (zasebni ključ ali besede denarnice): nikoli je "
"ne pišite sem. Nikoli je ne zahtevamo."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "{shop} asks for help."
msgstr "{shop} prosi za pomoč."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Symptom: {symptom}"
msgstr "Simptom: {symptom}"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Call back: {channel}"
msgstr "Kontakt nazaj: {channel}"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "They wrote: «{note}»"
msgstr "Trgovec je napisal: »{note}«"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Problems: {codes}"
msgstr "Težave: {codes}"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "To look at: {codes}"
msgstr "Za pregled: {codes}"

msgid "The checks found nothing wrong."
msgstr "Preverjanja niso našla ničesar narobe."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "The request and its diagnosis: {link}"
msgstr "Prošnja in njena diagnoza: {link}"

msgid "You have looked many times in a short while: wait a few minutes. Meanwhile, you can ask the community for help."
msgstr "V kratkem času ste preverjali velikokrat: počakajte nekaj minut. Medtem lahko prosite skupnost za pomoč."

msgid "Too many requests in a short time: try again in a while."
msgstr "Preveč prošenj v kratkem času: poskusite znova čez nekaj časa."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "You have already asked {count} times today, and the community has your requests: we answer them one by one. If it is urgent, write to {email}."
msgstr "Danes ste vprašali že {count}-krat in skupnost ima vaše prošnje: odgovorimo na vse, eno za drugo. Če je nujno, pišite na {email}."

msgid "You asked a moment ago, and we have your request."
msgstr "Vprašali ste pred trenutkom in vašo prošnjo imamo."

msgid "We have your request. The community has been told, and has what the site knows about your shop in front of it."
msgstr "Imamo vašo prošnjo. Skupnost je obveščena in pred seboj ima, kar spletno mesto ve o vaši trgovini."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "We have your request and it is saved: the community sees it in its list. The message to them did not go out right now, so if it is urgent write to {email}."
msgstr "Imamo vašo prošnjo in je shranjena: skupnost jo vidi na svojem seznamu. Sporočilo skupnosti zdaj ni bilo poslano, zato če je nujno, pišite na {email}."

msgid "They asked to be called back by email."
msgstr "Želi, da se mu oglasimo po e-pošti."

msgid "They asked to be called back on Telegram."
msgstr "Želi, da se mu oglasimo na Telegramu."

msgid ""
"They asked to be called back by phone: the number in their shop's details."
msgstr "Želi, da ga pokličemo po telefonu: številka v podatkih trgovine."

msgid "They asked for no call: they wait on their panel."
msgstr "Ne želi, da se mu oglasimo: čaka na nadzorni plošči."

msgid "Asked for help: %(symptom)s."
msgstr "Prosil je za pomoč: %(symptom)s."

msgid ""
"Start from the diagnosis in the request, and run the command below to probe "
"the Lightning address again. When it is done, mark the request solved: the "
"merchant sees «Solved» in their panel."
msgstr ""
"Začnite z diagnozo v prošnji in zaženite ukaz spodaj, da znova preizkusite "
"Lightning naslov. Ko končate, označite prošnjo kot rešeno: trgovec na svoji "
"nadzorni plošči vidi »Rešeno«."

msgid "We have your request and we are looking at it now."
msgstr "Imamo vašo prošnjo in se z njo ukvarjamo zdaj."

msgid "The request and its diagnosis"
msgstr "Prošnja in njena diagnoza"

msgid "state"
msgstr "stanje"

msgid "Solved"
msgstr "Rešeno"

msgid "asked"
msgstr "vprašano"

msgid "call back"
msgstr "oglasiti se"

msgid "where to call back"
msgstr "kje se oglasiti"

msgid "Mark as solved"
msgstr "Označite kot rešeno"

msgid "%(count)d requests marked as solved."
msgstr "Prošnje, označene kot rešene: %(count)d."

msgid "Mark as waiting again"
msgstr "Znova označite kot v čakanju"

msgid "%(count)d requests marked as waiting again."
msgstr "Prošnje, znova označene kot v čakanju: %(count)d."

msgid "A customer cannot pay"
msgstr "Stranka ne more plačati"

msgid "A payment stays on «waiting»"
msgstr "Plačilo ostane »v čakanju«"

msgid "The register does not open"
msgstr "Blagajna se ne odpre"

msgid "I lost my phone or changed phone"
msgstr "Izgubljen ali zamenjan telefon"

msgid "Too much change given, or a customer paid too much"
msgstr "Vrnjenega preveč drobiža ali stranka je plačala preveč"

msgid "Something else"
msgstr "Drugo"

msgid "by email"
msgstr "po e-pošti"

msgid "on Telegram"
msgstr "na Telegramu"

msgid "by phone"
msgstr "po telefonu"

msgid "they will look at their panel"
msgstr "spremljal bo svojo nadzorno ploščo"

msgid "sent"
msgstr "poslano"

msgid "refused by Telegram"
msgstr "Telegram je zavrnil"

msgid "no Telegram bot or chat"
msgstr "ni bota ali klepeta v Telegramu"

msgid "not delivered"
msgstr "ni dostavljeno"

msgid "symptom"
msgstr "simptom"

msgid "what the merchant wrote"
msgstr "kaj je napisal trgovec"

msgid "what the site knew"
msgstr "kaj je spletno mesto vedelo"

msgid "message to the community"
msgstr "sporočilo skupnosti"

msgid "solved"
msgstr "rešeno"

msgid "solved by"
msgstr "rešil"

msgid "help request"
msgstr "prošnja za pomoč"

msgid "help requests"
msgstr "prošnje za pomoč"

msgid "What works: %(counter)s thing"
msgid_plural "What works: %(counter)s things"
msgstr[0] "Kaj deluje: %(counter)s stvar"
msgstr[1] "Kaj deluje: %(counter)s stvari"
msgstr[2] "Kaj deluje: %(counter)s stvari"
msgstr[3] "Kaj deluje: %(counter)s stvari"

msgid "The merchant wrote:"
msgstr "Trgovec je napisal:"

msgid ""
"If the register shows no code or the page does not load, look at the phone's "
"connection and reload the page."
msgstr ""
"Če blagajna ne pokaže kode ali se stran ne naloži, preverite povezavo "
"telefona in znova naložite stran."

msgid ""
"If the page does not load for anyone, the site may be resting for a few "
"minutes."
msgstr ""
"Če se stran ne naloži nikomur, spletno mesto morda za nekaj minut miruje."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The site watches your Lightning address: it answers, but it does not tell "
"the register when a payment arrives (since {since}, checked {checked})."
msgstr ""
"Spletno mesto spremlja vaš Lightning naslov: odziva se, vendar blagajni ne "
"sporoči, kdaj prispe plačilo (začelo se je {since}, preverjeno {checked})."

msgid "You asked a moment ago: we added what you wrote to your request."
msgstr ""
