msgid "%(count)d requests marked as done."
msgstr "Prošnje, označene kot opravljene: %(count)d."

msgid "Asked the community to put the shop on OpenStreetMap."
msgstr "Prosil je skupnost, naj trgovino doda na OpenStreetMap."

msgid "Asked the community to update the shop's entry on OpenStreetMap."
msgstr "Prosil je skupnost, naj posodobi vpis trgovine na OpenStreetMap."

msgid "We have your request about OpenStreetMap: a person of the community does it by hand."
msgstr "Imamo vašo prošnjo glede OpenStreetMap: nekdo iz skupnosti jo opravi ročno."

#, python-format
msgid "The last reading of OpenStreetMap failed: %(reason)s."
msgstr "Zadnje branje OpenStreetMap ni uspelo: %(reason)s."

msgid ""
"Nothing was changed. The monthly timer tries again; to try now run the "
"command below."
msgstr ""
"Nič ni bilo spremenjeno. Mesečni časovnik poskusi znova; če želite poskusiti "
"zdaj, zaženite ukaz spodaj."

msgid "The shops have not been compared with OpenStreetMap for a while."
msgstr "Trgovine že nekaj časa niso bile primerjane z OpenStreetMap."

msgid "The shops have never been compared with OpenStreetMap."
msgstr "Trgovine še nikoli niso bile primerjane z OpenStreetMap."

msgid "Check the timer that runs osm_sync."
msgstr "Preverite časovnik, ki zaganja osm_sync."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(count)d change proposed for OpenStreetMap waits for a person to send it."
msgid_plural ""
"%(count)d changes proposed for OpenStreetMap wait for a person to send them."
msgstr[0] ""
"%(count)d predlagana sprememba za OpenStreetMap čaka, da jo nekdo pošlje."
msgstr[1] ""
"%(count)d predlagani spremembi za OpenStreetMap čakata, da ju nekdo pošlje."
msgstr[2] ""
"%(count)d predlagane spremembe za OpenStreetMap čakajo, da jih nekdo pošlje."
msgstr[3] ""
"%(count)d predlaganih sprememb za OpenStreetMap čaka, da jih nekdo pošlje."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(count)d tag of our shops on OpenStreetMap is not what this site knows."
msgid_plural ""
"%(count)d tags of our shops on OpenStreetMap are not what this site knows."
msgstr[0] ""
"%(count)d oznaka naših trgovin na OpenStreetMap se ne ujema s tem, kar ve to "
"spletno mesto."
msgstr[1] ""
"%(count)d oznaki naših trgovin na OpenStreetMap se ne ujemata s tem, kar ve "
"to spletno mesto."
msgstr[2] ""
"%(count)d oznake naših trgovin na OpenStreetMap se ne ujemajo s tem, kar ve "
"to spletno mesto."
msgstr[3] ""
"%(count)d oznak naših trgovin na OpenStreetMap se ne ujema s tem, kar ve to "
"spletno mesto."

msgid ""
"Read them in the administration. To send them, run the command below with "
"the OpenStreetMap account that signs the edits: it asks before it sends "
"anything. The site never sends them by itself."
msgstr ""
"Preberite jih v administraciji. Za pošiljanje zaženite ukaz spodaj s "
"profilom OpenStreetMap, ki podpisuje spremembe: preden kar koli pošlje, "
"vpraša za potrditev. Spletno mesto jih nikoli ne pošlje samo."

msgid ""
"Read them in the administration: they are what OpenStreetMap should say of "
"each shop. A person can change them by hand on openstreetmap.org, with their "
"own account. The site sends nothing."
msgstr ""
"Preberite jih v administraciji: to je tisto, kar bi OpenStreetMap moral "
"povedati o vsaki trgovini. Nekdo jih lahko spremeni ročno na "
"openstreetmap.org, s svojim profilom. Spletno mesto ne pošlje ničesar."

msgid ""
"Add the shop in the editor with the lines of the request, or tell the "
"merchant it cannot be done. Then mark the request done in the "
"administration: the merchant sees it in the panel. The site never writes to "
"OpenStreetMap by itself."
msgstr ""
"Trgovino dodajte v urejevalniku z vrsticami iz prošnje ali trgovcu povejte, "
"da tega ni mogoče storiti. Nato prošnjo v administraciji označite kot "
"opravljeno: trgovec to vidi na nadzorni plošči. Spletno mesto nikoli samo ne "
"piše na OpenStreetMap."

msgid ""
"Run the command below: it shows what would change, asks before it sends "
"anything, and marks the request done. Or edit by hand with the lines of the "
"request, then mark it done in the administration."
msgstr ""
"Zaženite ukaz spodaj: pokaže, kaj bi se spremenilo, pred pošiljanjem vpraša "
"za potrditev in prošnjo označi kot opravljeno. Ali pa uredite ročno z "
"vrsticami iz prošnje in jo nato v administraciji označite kot opravljeno."

msgid ""
"Update the shop's entry in the editor with the lines of the request, or tell "
"the merchant it cannot be done. Then mark the request done in the "
"administration: the merchant sees it in the panel. The site never writes to "
"OpenStreetMap by itself."
msgstr ""
"Vpis trgovine posodobite v urejevalniku z vrsticami iz prošnje ali trgovcu "
"povejte, da tega ni mogoče storiti. Nato prošnjo v administraciji označite "
"kot opravljeno: trgovec to vidi na nadzorni plošči. Spletno mesto nikoli "
"samo ne piše na OpenStreetMap."

msgid "The request"
msgstr "Prošnja"

msgid "The reading and its proposals"
msgstr "Branje in njegovi predlogi"

msgid "OpenStreetMap element"
msgstr "Element OpenStreetMap"

msgid "seen on OpenStreetMap"
msgstr "videno na OpenStreetMap"

msgid "OpenStreetMap reading"
msgstr "Branje OpenStreetMap"

msgid "OpenStreetMap readings"
msgstr "Branja OpenStreetMap"

msgid "what is asked"
msgstr "kaj se prosi"

msgid "what to write"
msgstr "kaj zapisati"

msgid "done on"
msgstr "opravljeno dne"

msgid "done by"
msgstr "opravil"

msgid "answer to the merchant"
msgstr "odgovor trgovcu"

msgid "OpenStreetMap request"
msgstr "Prošnja glede OpenStreetMap"

msgid "OpenStreetMap requests"
msgstr "Prošnje glede OpenStreetMap"

msgid ""
"The shop's entry on OpenStreetMap, like node/123456 (the last number of its "
"address on openstreetmap.org). Empty: not linked."
msgstr ""
"Vpis trgovine na OpenStreetMap, na primer node/123456 (zadnja številka "
"njenega naslova na openstreetmap.org). Prazno: ni povezano."

msgid "put the shop on OpenStreetMap"
msgstr "dodamo trgovino na OpenStreetMap"

msgid "update the shop's entry on OpenStreetMap"
msgstr "posodobimo vpis trgovine na OpenStreetMap"

msgid "could not be done"
msgstr "ni bilo mogoče opraviti"

msgid "Write it like node/123456, way/123456 or relation/123456."
msgstr "Zapišite ga kot node/123456, way/123456 ali relation/123456."

msgid "Another shop is already linked to this element."
msgstr "S tem elementom je že povezana druga trgovina."

msgid "Your shop on OpenStreetMap"
msgstr "Vaša trgovina na OpenStreetMap"

msgid ""
"OpenStreetMap is a free map that anyone can improve, like a shared notebook. "
"Many apps show on it where to pay in bitcoin: if your shop is there with the "
"right information, more people find you."
msgstr ""
"OpenStreetMap je prost zemljevid, ki ga lahko izboljša vsak, kot skupni "
"zvezek. Veliko aplikacij na njem kaže, kje se plača z bitcoinom: če je vaša "
"trgovina tam s pravimi podatki, vas najde več ljudi."

msgid ""
"A place on OpenStreetMap is described by tags: lines of information like "
"name=Bar Aurora. Your shop needs a few of them to say that it takes bitcoin."
msgstr ""
"Kraj na OpenStreetMap opisujejo oznake (tagi): vrstice s podatki, kot je "
"name=Bar Aurora. Vaša trgovina jih potrebuje nekaj, da pove, da sprejema "
"bitcoin."

msgid ""
"A person does it by hand, with their own account: it can take a few days. "
"You will see here when it is done."
msgstr ""
"To nekdo opravi ročno, s svojim profilom: lahko traja nekaj dni. Tukaj boste "
"videli, kdaj je opravljeno."

msgid "Your shop's entry on OpenStreetMap was updated by the community. Thank you."
msgstr "Skupnost je posodobila vpis vaše trgovine na OpenStreetMap. Hvala."

msgid "The community could not do it."
msgstr "Skupnosti tega ni uspelo opraviti."

msgid "Your shop is on OpenStreetMap"
msgstr "Vaša trgovina je na OpenStreetMap"

msgid "See your shop on OpenStreetMap"
msgstr "Poglejte svojo trgovino na OpenStreetMap"

msgid ""
"Compared with what we know about your shop, these lines are missing or "
"different there:"
msgstr ""
"V primerjavi s tem, kar vemo o vaši trgovini, tam te vrstice manjkajo ali so "
"drugačne:"

msgid "missing"
msgstr "manjka"

msgid "take it away"
msgstr "odstranite jo"

msgid "Nothing to do."
msgstr "Ničesar ni treba storiti."

msgid "Everything we know about your shop is already there."
msgstr "Vse, kar vemo o vaši trgovini, je že tam."

msgid ""
"We have not compared it yet: it happens once a month. These are the lines it "
"should have:"
msgstr ""
"Primerjali je še nismo: to se zgodi enkrat na mesec. To so vrstice, ki bi "
"jih morala imeti:"

msgid "Your shop is not on OpenStreetMap, or we have not found it"
msgstr "Vaše trgovine ni na OpenStreetMap ali je nismo našli"

msgid ""
"To add it you need the name of the shop, its place on the map, and what kind "
"of place it is (a bar, a bakery, a clothes shop…), which you choose in the "
"editor. Then these lines about bitcoin:"
msgstr ""
"Za dodajanje potrebujete ime trgovine, njeno mesto na zemljevidu in vrsto "
"kraja (bar, pekarna, trgovina z oblačili …), ki jo izberete v urejevalniku. "
"Nato še te vrstice o bitcoinu:"

msgid ""
"Nothing to write on OpenStreetMap for this shop now: it is not on the map or "
"in the lists of this site."
msgstr ""
"Za to trgovino zdaj ni ničesar za zapisati na OpenStreetMap: ni na "
"zemljevidu ne na seznamih tega spletnega mesta."

msgid "Do it yourself, step by step"
msgstr "Naredite sami, korak za korakom"

msgid "Open the editor on your shop."
msgstr "Odprite urejevalnik na svoji trgovini."

msgid "Open the editor"
msgstr "Odprite urejevalnik"

msgid "Click on your shop on the map: its details open on the left."
msgstr ""
"Na zemljevidu kliknite svojo trgovino: na levi se odprejo njeni podatki."

msgid ""
"Press «Point» at the top and click on your shop on the map. Choose what kind "
"of place it is."
msgstr ""
"Zgoraj pritisnite »Točka« in na zemljevidu kliknite svojo trgovino. Izberite "
"vrsto kraja."

msgid ""
"Look for the tags box. In the editor it is called «Tags»: choose the text "
"view, where each tag is a line."
msgstr ""
"Poiščite polje z oznakami. V urejevalniku se imenuje »Oznake« (Tags): "
"izberite besedilni pogled, kjer je vsaka oznaka ena vrstica."

msgid ""
"Write these lines, one for each tag. If a tag is already there with another "
"value, change the value."
msgstr ""
"Zapišite te vrstice, eno za vsako oznako. Če oznaka že obstaja z drugo "
"vrednostjo, spremenite vrednost."

msgid "The lines to write"
msgstr "Vrstice za zapisati"

msgid "Copied"
msgstr "Kopirano"

msgid "Copy the lines"
msgstr "Kopirajte vrstice"

msgid ""
"Press «Save», write a few words about what you changed (for example «bitcoin "
"payments») and send it. You need a free OpenStreetMap account: the editor "
"guides you."
msgstr ""
"Pritisnite »Shrani«, napišite nekaj besed o tem, kaj ste spremenili (na "
"primer »plačila z bitcoinom«), in pošljite. Potrebujete brezplačen profil na "
"OpenStreetMap: urejevalnik vas vodi."

msgid "Or let the community do it"
msgstr "Ali pa naj to naredi skupnost"

msgid "You have asked already: the request is waiting for a person of the community."
msgstr "Vprašali ste že: prošnja čaka na nekoga iz skupnosti."

msgid "A person of the community does it by hand, with their own account. You do not need an account on OpenStreetMap."
msgstr "Nekdo iz skupnosti to opravi ročno, s svojim profilom. Vi profila na OpenStreetMap ne potrebujete."

msgid "Send the request"
msgstr "Pošljite prošnjo"

msgid ""
"OpenStreetMap is public: everything you write there can be read by "
"everybody. We never ask you for a password of yours, and we never write "
"there without a person who looks at it."
msgstr ""
"OpenStreetMap je javen: vse, kar tam napišete, lahko prebere vsak. Nikoli "
"vas ne vprašamo za vaše geslo in tam nikoli ne pišemo, ne da bi kdo to "
"pregledal."

#, python-format
