msgstr ""
"Zadnje preverjanje je tam ni našlo: morda je bila premaknjena ali izbrisana. "
"Pišite na %(email)s in pogledamo skupaj."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"If your shop is already there, write to %(email)s with the address of its "
