msgid "A person does it by hand: you see here when it is done."
msgstr "To nekdo opravi ročno: tukaj vidite, kdaj je opravljeno."

msgid "Your shop on OpenStreetMap: the community could not do it."
msgstr "Vaša trgovina na OpenStreetMap: skupnosti tega ni uspelo opraviti."

msgid "See what the map says about you, and update it."
msgstr "Poglejte, kaj zemljevid pove o vas, in ga posodobite."

