msgstr "OpenStreetMap pravi, da vaša trgovina ne sprejema več bitcoina."

msgid "If that is not true, ask the community below: we look at it with you."
msgstr "Če to ni res, vprašajte skupnost spodaj: pogledamo skupaj z vami."

msgid "Something on OpenStreetMap is not like on this site, and a person of the community has to look at it. You do not need to do anything."
msgstr "Nekaj na OpenStreetMap ni tako kot na tem spletnem mestu in nekdo iz skupnosti mora to pogledati. Vam ni treba storiti ničesar."

