msgid "As of the check of %(date)s."
msgstr "Po preverjanju z dne %(date)s."

msgid "OpenStreetMap link proposed"
msgstr "Predlagana povezava z OpenStreetMap"

msgid "OpenStreetMap decisions"
msgstr "Odločitve glede OpenStreetMap"

msgid ""
"A ticked box stays on for a detail you write later: customers see it as soon "
"as it is there."
msgstr ""
"Označeno polje ostane vklopljeno tudi za podatek, ki ga vpišete pozneje: "
"stranke ga vidijo, takoj ko je tam."

msgid "version of the text"
msgstr "različica besedila"

msgid "Export the selected declarations as a spreadsheet (CSV)"
msgstr "Izvozite izbrane izjave kot preglednico (CSV)"

msgid "basic pass earned"
msgstr "osnovna prepustnica pridobljena"

msgid "last review"
msgstr "zadnja ponovitev"

msgid "merchant training"
msgstr "usposabljanje trgovca"

msgid "shop"
msgstr "trgovina"

msgid "statement"
msgstr "izjava"

msgid "text shown"
msgstr "prikazano besedilo"

msgid "language"
msgstr "jezik"

msgid "declaration"
msgstr "izjava"

msgid "declarations"
msgstr "izjave"

msgid ""
"I did the exercises of the practice register. I know what the register says "
"when a customer pays, says they paid but the payment has not arrived, or "
"does not pay, and when the phone switches off."
msgstr ""
"Vaje vadbene blagajne imam za sabo. Vem, kaj pove blagajna, ko stranka "
"plača, ko pravi, da je plačala, a plačilo ni prispelo, ali ko ne plača, in "
"ko se telefon ugasne."

msgid ""
"I checked my wallet's backup. My recovery words are written on paper, in a "
"place only I know, and I checked them against the wallet."
msgstr ""
"Varnostna kopija moje denarnice je preverjena. Obnovitvene besede so "
"zapisane na papirju, na mestu, ki ga poznam samo jaz, in primerjane z "
"denarnico."

msgid ""
"I tried a withdrawal. I sent a small amount from my wallet to another "
"address, and I saw it arrive."
msgstr ""
"Dvig je preizkušen. Majhen znesek iz moje denarnice je šel na drug naslov in "
"njegov prihod je viden."

msgid "Practice done"
msgstr "Vadba opravljena"

msgid "Backup checked"
msgstr "Varnostna kopija preverjena"

msgid "Withdrawal tried"
msgstr "Dvig preizkušen"

msgid "Do the exercises of the practice register, then say so here."
msgstr "Opravite vaje vadbene blagajne, nato to sporočite tukaj."

msgid "Check your backup with the guide, then say so here."
msgstr "Z navodili preverite varnostno kopijo, nato to sporočite tukaj."

msgid ""
"Send a small amount to another address with the guide, then say so here."
msgstr ""
"Z navodili pošljite majhen znesek na drug naslov, nato to sporočite tukaj."

msgid ""
"A sale is paid only when the register says so. The customer's phone and a "
"screenshot do not count."
msgstr ""
"Prodaja je plačana šele, ko to pove blagajna. Telefon stranke in posnetek "
"zaslona ne štejeta."

msgid "Never give the recovery words of a wallet to anyone."
msgstr "Obnovitvenih besed denarnice nikoli nikomur."

msgid "If in doubt, call the owner."
msgstr "Če ste v dvomih, pokličite lastnika."

msgid "Trained merchant"
msgstr "Usposobljen trgovec"

msgid "The conditions of the help"
msgstr "Pogoji pomoči"

msgid ""
"I read the conditions of the help. I know what the volunteers do and what "
"stays with me: my wallet, my recovery words, my backup and the count of my "
"sales."
msgstr ""
"Pogoje pomoči poznam. Vem, kaj naredijo prostovoljci in kaj ostane pri meni: "
"moja denarnica, moje obnovitvene besede, moja varnostna kopija in obračun "
"mojih prodaj."

msgid "Basic pass"
msgstr "Osnovna prepustnica"

msgid "Do the modules of the path: it takes a few minutes each."
msgstr "Opravite module poti: vsak vzame le nekaj minut."

msgid "Too many tries in a short time: wait a few minutes."
msgstr "Preveč poskusov v kratkem času: počakajte nekaj minut."

msgid "All the answers are right."
msgstr "Vsi odgovori so pravilni."

msgid ""
"Some answers are not right yet. Read the lines under them and try again: "
"there is no penalty and no limit."
msgstr ""
"Nekateri odgovori še niso pravilni. Preberite vrstice pod njimi in poskusite "
"znova: brez kazni in brez omejitev."

msgid "You have the basic pass. Well done!"
msgstr "Imate osnovno prepustnico. Odlično!"

msgid "Saved. Thank you."
msgstr "Shranjeno. Hvala."

msgid "Tick every statement you agree with, then press the button."
msgstr "Označite vsako izjavo, s katero se strinjate, nato pritisnite gumb."

msgid "Tick the box to say you did it, then press the button."
msgstr "Označite polje, da potrdite, da ste to opravili, nato pritisnite gumb."

msgid "Review done. See you next year!"
msgstr "Ponovitev opravljena. Se vidimo prihodnje leto!"

msgid ""
"Some answers are not right yet. Read the lines under them and try again."
msgstr ""
"Nekateri odgovori še niso pravilni. Preberite vrstice pod njimi in poskusite "
"znova."

msgid "One more thing:"
msgstr "Še nekaj:"

msgid "the badge also needs your basic pass. It takes a few minutes."
msgstr "za znak potrebujete tudi osnovno prepustnico. Vzame le nekaj minut."

msgid "Start the path"
msgstr "Začnite pot"

msgid "Register (waiting for the pass)"
msgstr "Blagajna (čaka na prepustnico)"

msgid "The register opens soon"
msgstr "Blagajna se kmalu odpre"

msgid ""
"The register that takes real money opens when you have the basic pass: a few "
"short modules, with a little game. Your wallet and your recovery words are "
"yours, and we want you to know what to do if something goes wrong."
msgstr ""
"Blagajna, ki sprejema pravi denar, se odpre, ko imate osnovno prepustnico: "
"nekaj kratkih modulov, z malo igre. Denarnica in obnovitvene besede so vaše, "
"in želimo, da veste, kaj storiti, če gre kaj narobe."

msgid ""
"The owner has not finished the training yet: the register opens when they "
"have. Tell them."
msgstr ""
"Lastnik še ni končal usposabljanja: blagajna se odpre, ko ga konča. Povejte "
"mu."

msgid ""
"The owner of the shop has not finished the training yet: the register opens "
"when they have."
msgstr ""
"Lastnik trgovine še ni končal usposabljanja: blagajna se odpre, ko ga konča."

msgid "Three rules of the counter"
msgstr "Tri pravila za pultom"

msgid "Before the first sale, read them. They are short."
msgstr "Preberite jih pred prvo prodajo. Kratka so."

msgid "I understood"
msgstr "Razumem"

msgid "Your merchant pass"
msgstr "Vaša trgovska prepustnica"

msgid ""
"A few short modules, a little game, and you know what to do. Your shop is "
"yours: so are the wallet and the recovery words. A wrong answer is never a "
"problem: you read the line under it and try again."
msgstr ""
"Nekaj kratkih modulov, malo igre, in veste, kaj storiti. Trgovina je vaša, "
"prav tako denarnica in obnovitvene besede. Napačen odgovor ni nikoli težava: "
"preberete vrstico pod njim in poskusite znova."

msgid "Steps and days for the shop"
msgstr "Koraki in dnevi za trgovino"

msgid "Your shop shows the «Trained merchant» sign."
msgstr "Vaša trgovina prikazuje oznako »Usposobljen trgovec«."

msgid ""
"The register that takes real money opens with the basic pass. The practice "
"register always works."
msgstr ""
"Blagajna, ki sprejema pravi denar, se odpre z osnovno prepustnico. Vadbena "
"blagajna deluje vedno."

msgid ""
"The basic pass is not required to take payments, but we ask you to get it."
msgstr ""
"Osnovna prepustnica ni pogoj za sprejemanje plačil, vendar vas prosimo, da "
"jo pridobite."

msgid "The path to the basic pass"
msgstr "Pot do osnovne prepustnice"

msgid "Steps with a guide"
msgstr "Koraki z navodili"

msgid "These steps are about a shop. Add your shop first."
msgstr "Ti koraki se nanašajo na trgovino. Najprej dodajte svojo trgovino."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"For «%(name)s». You do each one by yourself, following a guide, then you say "
"so here."
msgstr ""
"Za »%(name)s«. Vsakega opravite sami, po navodilih, nato to sporočite tukaj."

msgid "Open the guide"
msgstr "Odprite navodila"

msgid "I did the exercises of the practice register."
msgstr "Vaje vadbene blagajne imam za sabo."

msgid "I checked my wallet's backup."
msgstr "Varnostna kopija moje denarnice je preverjena."

msgid "I tried a withdrawal."
msgstr "Dvig je preizkušen."

msgid "earned"
msgstr "pridobljeno"

msgid "The yearly review"
msgstr "Letna ponovitev"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"A short review, one question for each module, every year. The next is due on "
"%(date)s. Nothing is locked if you are late: we only remind you."
msgstr ""
"Kratka ponovitev, eno vprašanje za vsak modul, vsako leto. Naslednja je "
"%(date)s. Če zamujate, se nič ne zaklene: samo opomnimo vas."

msgid "Do the review now"
msgstr "Opravite ponovitev zdaj"

msgid "The register is waiting for you."
msgstr "Blagajna vas čaka."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"The register of «%(names)s» opens as soon as you have the basic pass. It "
"takes a few minutes, and you can try the practice register meanwhile."
msgstr ""
"Blagajna trgovine »%(names)s« se odpre, takoj ko imate osnovno prepustnico. "
"Vzame le nekaj minut, medtem pa lahko preizkusite vadbeno blagajno."

msgid ""
"The basic pass is not required, but we ask you to get it: a few short "
"modules, and you know what to do if something goes wrong."
msgstr ""
"Osnovna prepustnica ni obvezna, vendar vas prosimo, da jo pridobite: nekaj "
"kratkih modulov in veste, kaj storiti, če gre kaj narobe."

msgid "A short review is coming."
msgstr "Kmalu bo na vrsti kratka ponovitev."

msgid "Time for the short review."
msgstr "Čas je za kratko ponovitev."

msgid "One question for each module, whenever you like, no penalty."
msgstr "Eno vprašanje za vsak modul, kadar želite, brez kazni."

msgid "Start the review"
msgstr "Začnite ponovitev"

msgid "Some texts changed."
msgstr "Nekatera besedila so se spremenila."

msgid "Read them again and confirm; your pass stays."
msgstr "Preberite jih znova in potrdite: vaša prepustnica ostane."

msgid "Badges"
msgstr "Značke"

msgid "not yet"
msgstr "še ne"

msgid "Your path and badges"
msgstr "Vaša pot in značke"

msgid "Go on with the path"
msgstr "Nadaljujte pot"

msgid "Read the page"
msgstr "Preberite stran"

msgid "It opens in the same window; come back here when you finish."
msgstr "Odpre se v istem oknu: ko končate, se vrnite sem."

msgid "Questions"
msgstr "Vprašanja"

msgid "Not this one."
msgstr "Ta ne."

msgid "Right"
msgstr "Pravilno"

msgid "Try again"
msgstr "Poskusite znova"

msgid "Check my answers"
msgstr "Preverite moje odgovore"

msgid "What you tell us"
msgstr "Kaj nam poveste"

msgid "After the questions you confirm a few statements."
msgstr "Po vprašanjih potrdite nekaj izjav."

msgid ""
"We keep a note of what you confirm, with the date: it is the proof that you "
"were told. Tick only what you agree with."
msgstr ""
"Kar potrdite, si zabeležimo z datumom: to je dokaz, da ste bili obveščeni. "
"Označite samo tisto, s čimer se strinjate."

msgid "This text changed since you confirmed it: read it again."
msgstr ""
"To besedilo se je spremenilo, odkar ste ga potrdili: preberite ga znova."

msgid "Confirm what I ticked"
msgstr "Potrdite označeno"

msgid "This module is done."
msgstr "Ta modul je opravljen."

#, python-format
msgid "Next: %(name)s"
msgstr "Naprej: %(name)s"

msgid "Back to your path"
msgstr "Nazaj na vašo pot"

msgid ""
"One question for each module. No penalty: a wrong answer comes with a line "
"to read, and you try again."
msgstr ""
"Eno vprašanje za vsak modul. Brez kazni: napačnemu odgovoru sledi vrstica za "
"branje in poskusite znova."

msgid "The owner has the basic pass of the training."
msgstr "Lastnik ima osnovno prepustnico usposabljanja."

msgid "The register is waiting for the owner's basic pass."
msgstr "Blagajna čaka na lastnikovo osnovno prepustnico."

msgid ""
"The register page says «The register opens soon» and no new sale starts, by "
"the community's choice. Tell the owner to open «Your merchant pass» in the "
"panel: a few short modules. The practice register works meanwhile. Nothing "
"else is wrong: do not change anything."
msgstr ""
"Stran blagajne pravi »Blagajna se kmalu odpre« in nobena nova prodaja se ne "
"začne, po odločitvi skupnosti. Lastniku recite, naj na nadzorni plošči odpre "
"»Vaša trgovska prepustnica«: nekaj kratkih modulov. Medtem vadbena blagajna "
"deluje. Drugega ni nič pokvarjeno: ničesar ne spreminjajte."

msgid "The owner has not done the training yet."
msgstr "Lastnik še ni opravil usposabljanja."

msgid "The register works for now. Remind the owner of the basic pass."
msgstr "Blagajna za zdaj deluje. Lastnika spomnite na osnovno prepustnico."

#, python-format
msgid "%(counter)s question"
msgid_plural "%(counter)s questions"
msgstr[0] "%(counter)s vprašanje"
msgstr[1] "%(counter)s vprašanji"
msgstr[2] "%(counter)s vprašanja"
msgstr[3] "%(counter)s vprašanj"

#, python-format
msgid "%(done)s of %(counter)s statement"
msgid_plural "%(done)s of %(counter)s statements"
msgstr[0] "%(done)s od %(counter)s izjave"
msgstr[1] "%(done)s od %(counter)s izjav"
msgstr[2] "%(done)s od %(counter)s izjav"
msgstr[3] "%(done)s od %(counter)s izjav"

msgid "ADMIN ZONE"
msgstr "OBMOČJE ADMINISTRACIJE"

msgid "The register is ready: it asks your Lightning wallet for each payment."
msgstr ""
"Blagajna je pripravljena: za vsako plačilo vpraša vašo Lightning denarnico."

msgid ""
"Your Lightning wallet receives, but it does not tell the register when a "
"payment arrives: check each payment in your wallet app before you confirm it "
"on the register."
msgstr ""
"Vaša Lightning denarnica prejema, vendar blagajni ne sporoči, kdaj prispe "
"plačilo: vsako plačilo preverite v aplikaciji denarnice, preden ga potrdite "
"na blagajni."

msgid "The register cannot take payments: write to the community."
msgstr "Blagajna ne more sprejemati plačil: pišite skupnosti."

msgid ""
"A customer paid more than the price: the extra is theirs. Give it back from "
"your wallet."
msgstr ""
"Stranka je plačala več, kot je cena: razlika je njena. Vrnite jo iz svoje "
"denarnice."

msgid ""
"The money is not in your wallet: a Lightning payment is instant, so ask the "
"customer to look at their wallet and try again."
msgstr ""
"Denarja ni v vaši denarnici: plačilo Lightning je takojšnje, zato stranko "
"prosite, naj pogleda v svojo denarnico in poskusi znova."

msgid ""
"You gave too much change: the register cannot take it back, and a payment "
"already made does not change."
msgstr ""
"Vrnili ste preveč drobiža: blagajna ga ne more vzeti nazaj in že opravljeno "
"plačilo se ne spremeni."

#, python-format
msgid "%(count)d shops can be certified again."
msgstr "Trgovine, ki jih je mogoče znova certificirati: %(count)d."

msgid ""
"A phone where the register was opened before keeps taking Lightning "
"payments, even when the site does not answer."
msgstr ""
"Telefon, na katerem je bila blagajna že odprta, še naprej sprejema plačila "
"Lightning, tudi ko se spletno mesto ne odziva."

msgid ""
"A shop is certified when its Lightning address works and its owner has "
"earned the basic pass of the training."
msgstr ""
"Trgovina je certificirana, ko njen Lightning naslov deluje in je lastnik "
"pridobil osnovno prepustnico usposabljanja."

msgid ""
"Certified shop: its Lightning address works, and its owner has done the "
"community's training."
msgstr ""
"Certificirana trgovina: njen Lightning naslov deluje in lastnik je opravil "
"usposabljanje skupnosti."

msgid ""
"Do not give money back yourself: tell the owner the time and the amount."
msgstr "Denarja ne vračajte sami: lastniku povejte uro in znesek."

msgid ""
"Give each person their own register: you turn one off at once when someone "
"leaves or loses the phone. Your own register is different: whoever knows its "
"link can always open it."
msgstr ""
"Vsaki osebi dajte njeno blagajno: eno takoj izklopite, ko kdo odide ali "
"izgubi telefon. Vaša lastna blagajna je drugačna: kdor pozna njeno povezavo, "
"jo lahko vedno odpre."

msgid ""
"Give each person who takes payments their own register. With it they can "
"only take payments, which go to your wallet: they see where the money goes, "
"and nothing else of your wallet, your sales or your settings."
msgstr ""
"Vsaki osebi, ki sprejema plačila, dajte njeno blagajno. Z njo lahko samo "
"sprejema plačila, ki gredo v vašo denarnico: vidi, kam gre denar, in nič "
"drugega o vaši denarnici, vaših prodajah ali vaših nastavitvah."

msgid "Nothing to do now: the community hears about it the day the closure ends."
msgstr "Zdaj ni treba storiti ničesar: skupnost bo izvedela na dan, ko se zaprtje konča."

msgid "Nothing to do now: the merchant and the community hear about it the day the shop opens again."
msgstr "Zdaj ni treba storiti ničesar: trgovec in skupnost bosta izvedela na dan, ko se trgovina znova odpre."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"Registers: %(working)d with a Lightning address that works, %(to_look)d "
"shops to look at."
msgstr ""
"Blagajne: z delujočim Lightning naslovom %(working)d, trgovine za pregled "
"%(to_look)d."

msgid ""
"Scan this code with the other phone, or send the link. No sign-in needed: "
"with it one can only take payments, which go to your wallet. Your settings "
"stay yours."
msgstr ""
"To kodo skenirajte z drugim telefonom ali pošljite povezavo. Prijava ni "
"potrebna: z njo je mogoče samo sprejemati plačila, denar pa gre v vašo "
"denarnico. Nastavitve ostanejo vaše."

msgid "The certificate still waits for: {missing}."
msgstr "Certifikat še čaka na: {missing}."

msgid ""
"The list of sales at the bottom of the register, on the phone that took the "
"sale, shows how each sale ended."
msgstr ""
"Seznam prodaj na dnu blagajne, na telefonu, ki je izvedel prodajo, pokaže, "
"kako se je vsaka prodaja končala."

msgid ""
"The sales stay on the registers' phones and never reach the site, and the "
"wallets are asked only by the diagnosis. When a merchant calls, ask it one "
"shop at a time:"
msgstr ""
"Prodaje ostanejo na telefonih blagajn in nikoli ne pridejo na spletno mesto, "
"denarnice pa sprašuje samo diagnoza. Ko trgovec pokliče, jo zaženite za eno "
"trgovino naenkrat:"

msgid ""
"The site checked your Lightning address after you opened again: it works. "
"Thank you for keeping the shop on the map."
msgstr ""
"Spletno mesto je po ponovnem odprtju preverilo vaš Lightning naslov: deluje. "
"Hvala, da trgovino ohranjate na zemljevidu."

msgid "Then the badge “Certified shop” goes on your card by itself."
msgstr "Potem se na vašem vpisu sam pojavi znak »Certificirana trgovina«."

msgid "This link cannot be turned off."
msgstr "Te povezave ni mogoče izklopiti."

msgid ""
"You have everything for the certificate: the site gives it at its next check "
"of your Lightning address."
msgstr ""
"Za certifikat imate vse: spletno mesto ga podeli ob naslednjem preverjanju "
"vašega Lightning naslova."

msgid ""
"Your Lightning address has not passed the site's check yet: the first "
"milestone says how it stands."
msgstr ""
"Vaš Lightning naslov še ni prestal preverjanja spletnega mesta: prvi mejnik "
"pove, kako je s tem."

msgid "a Lightning address that works"
msgstr "Lightning naslov, ki deluje"

msgid "the owner's basic pass of the training"
msgstr "lastnikova osnovna prepustnica usposabljanja"

msgid "with a Lightning address that works"
msgstr "z Lightning naslovom, ki deluje"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(count)d shop was checked on OpenStreetMap after our last check or closing "
"date:"
msgid_plural ""
"%(count)d shops were checked on OpenStreetMap after our last check or "
"closing date:"
msgstr[0] ""
"%(count)d trgovina je bila na OpenStreetMap preverjena po našem zadnjem "
"preverjanju ali datumu zaprtja:"
msgstr[1] ""
"%(count)d trgovini sta bili na OpenStreetMap preverjeni po našem zadnjem "
"preverjanju ali datumu zaprtja:"
msgstr[2] ""
"%(count)d trgovine so bile na OpenStreetMap preverjene po našem zadnjem "
"preverjanju ali datumu zaprtja:"
msgstr[3] ""
"%(count)d trgovin je bilo na OpenStreetMap preverjenih po našem zadnjem "
"preverjanju ali datumu zaprtja:"

msgctxt "meetup state"
msgid "Cancelled"
msgstr "Odpovedano"

msgid "Too many emails in a short time: wait a few minutes and try again."
msgstr ""
"Preveč e-poštnih sporočil v kratkem času: počakajte nekaj minut in poskusite "
"znova."

msgid ""
"Too many requests from your connection in a short time: wait a few minutes "
"and try again."
msgstr ""
"Preveč zahtev z vaše povezave v kratkem času: počakajte nekaj minut in "
"poskusite znova."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"A link was already sent to %(email)s a few minutes ago. Look in your mail, "
"and in the spam folder: each link lasts 15 minutes. To ask for a new one, "
"wait a few minutes."
msgstr ""
"Povezava je bila na %(email)s poslana že pred nekaj minutami. Poglejte v "
"pošto, tudi med neželeno pošto: vsaka povezava velja 15 minut. Za novo "
"počakajte nekaj minut."

msgid ""
"Too many sign-in codes from your connection in a short time: in a few "
"minutes the wallet code is back. The email works now."
msgstr ""
"Preveč kod za prijavo z vaše povezave v kratkem času: čez nekaj minut bo "
"koda za denarnico spet na voljo. E-pošta deluje že zdaj."

msgid "This register is turned off"
msgstr "Ta blagajna je izklopljena"

msgid "Signed in as %(who)s."
msgstr "Prijavljeni ste kot %(who)s."

msgid "Not you? Sign out"
msgstr "To niste vi? Odjava"

msgid "Password change"
msgstr "Sprememba gesla"

msgid "On-chain payments too"
msgstr "Tudi on-chain plačila"

msgid ""
"The chat number or @name where the site writes to you: account changes, a "
"Lightning address that stops working, help answers, the reopening after a "
"closure. Up to three, separated by commas: each chat gets its own copy."
msgstr ""
"Številka klepeta ali @ime, kamor vam spletno mesto piše: spremembe profila, "
"Lightning naslov, ki preneha delovati, odgovori na prošnje za pomoč, ponovno "
"odprtje po zaprtju. Največ tri, ločene z vejicami: vsak klepet dobi svojo "
"kopijo."

msgid "This chat cannot receive the site's messages."
msgstr "Ta klepet ne more prejemati sporočil spletnega mesta."

msgid ""
"Only a sign for customers, on the map and on your page. Where on-chain "
"payments go is set in your register, on your phone: the site never sees it."
msgstr ""
"To je le oznaka za stranke, na zemljevidu in na vaši strani. Kam gredo on-"
"chain plačila, nastavite v blagajni, na svojem telefonu: spletno mesto tega "
"nikoli ne vidi."

msgid "Add your Lightning address."
msgstr "Dodajte svoj Lightning naslov."

msgid "I take on-chain payments too"
msgstr "Sprejemam tudi on-chain plačila"

msgid ""
"The customer leaves without paying. The register says «Payment expired»: "
"nothing was charged, the goods stay with you. In the real register it "
"happens when the code expires."
msgstr ""
"Stranka odide brez plačila. Blagajna pokaže »Plačilo poteklo«: nič ni bilo "
"plačano, blago ostane pri vas. Na pravi blagajni se to zgodi, ko koda poteče."

msgid "No connection: the shop's Lightning wallet cannot be reached."
msgstr "Ni povezave: Lightning denarnica trgovine ni dosegljiva."

msgid "No connection: your Lightning wallet cannot be reached."
msgstr "Ni povezave: vaša Lightning denarnica ni dosegljiva."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "The sources do not agree: {rates}. Which rate do you want to use?"
msgstr "Viri se ne ujemajo: {rates}. Kateri tečaj želite uporabiti?"

msgid ""
"No source answers and the last good rate is too old: the register cannot "
"charge."
msgstr ""
"Noben vir ne odgovarja, zadnji dobri tečaj pa je prestar: blagajna ne more "
"sprejeti plačila."

msgid "No source answers: the register cannot calculate the amount in sats."
msgstr "Noben vir ne odgovarja: blagajna ne more izračunati zneska v sat."

msgid "Your Lightning wallet does not answer: the register cannot charge."
msgstr ""
"Vaša Lightning denarnica se ne odziva: blagajna ne more sprejeti plačila."

msgid ""
"Your Lightning wallet answers from another address: the register cannot use "
"it."
msgstr ""
"Vaša Lightning denarnica odgovarja z drugega naslova: blagajna je ne more "
"uporabiti."

msgid ""
"Your Lightning wallet sent an invoice that is old or already used for "
"another sale: do not use it. Try again in a moment."
msgstr ""
"Vaša Lightning denarnica je poslala zahtevek za plačilo, ki je star ali že "
"uporabljen za drugo prodajo: ne uporabite ga. Poskusite znova čez trenutek."

msgid ""
"Careful: your Lightning wallet does not tell the register when a payment "
"arrives. Hand over the goods only after you see the payment in your wallet, "
"then confirm here."
msgstr ""
"Pozor: vaša Lightning denarnica blagajni ne sporoči, kdaj prispe plačilo. "
"Blago izročite šele, ko vidite plačilo v denarnici, nato potrdite tukaj."

msgid ""
"Your Lightning wallet says an invoice was paid, but the register cannot "
"check that it is this sale's. Look in your wallet: if you see the payment, "
"tap «I see the payment in my wallet»."
msgstr ""
"Vaša Lightning denarnica sporoča, da je bil zahtevek za plačilo plačan, "
"vendar blagajna ne more preveriti, ali je od te prodaje. Poglejte v "
"denarnico: če vidite plačilo, tapnite »Plačilo vidim v svoji denarnici«."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"This phone's clock is {minutes} min away from the site's: set the date and "
"time right in the phone's settings."
msgstr ""
"Ura tega telefona se od ure spletnega mesta razlikuje za {minutes} min: v "
"nastavitvah telefona nastavite pravi datum in uro."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Sales on this phone: {count}"
msgstr "Prodaje na tem telefonu: {count}"

msgid "Preparing a new on-chain address..."
msgstr "Pripravljam nov on-chain naslov ..."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "On-chain address …/{path} of your key: {address}"
msgstr "On-chain naslov …/{path} vašega ključa: {address}"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Your fixed on-chain address: {address}"
msgstr "Vaš stalni on-chain naslov: {address}"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "On-chain, to the shop: {address}"
msgstr "On-chain, trgovini: {address}"

msgid ""
"Payment seen: waiting for a confirmation in a block. It can take ten minutes "
"or more."
msgstr ""
"Plačilo zaznano: čaka na potrditev v bloku. Lahko traja deset minut ali več."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Less than asked has arrived: {seen} of {sats}. Do not hand over the goods: "
"ask the customer to pay the rest, or cancel."
msgstr ""
"Prispelo je manj, kot je bilo zahtevano: {seen} od {sats}. Ne izročite "
"blaga: stranko prosite, naj plača preostanek, ali prekličite."

msgid "Next customer: check this sale later"
msgstr "Naslednja stranka: to prodajo preverite pozneje"

msgid ""
"The explorer does not answer: the register cannot see the payment. Look in "
"your wallet."
msgstr ""
"Raziskovalec blokov se ne odziva: blagajna ne vidi plačila. Poglejte v svojo "
"denarnico."

msgid ""
"The explorer does not answer: with a fixed address the register cannot tell "
"this sale's payment from earlier ones. Use Lightning, or try again in a "
"moment."
msgstr ""
"Raziskovalec blokov se ne odziva: pri stalnem naslovu blagajna plačila te "
"prodaje ne more ločiti od prejšnjih. Uporabite Lightning ali poskusite znova "
"čez trenutek."

msgid ""
"The on-chain key on this phone is not valid any more: check it in the "
"settings."
msgstr ""
"On-chain ključ na tem telefonu ni več veljaven: preverite ga v nastavitvah."

msgid ""
"The on-chain key of this register's pairing does not give addresses any "
"more: ask the owner for a new pairing code, and take this sale with "
"Lightning."
msgstr ""
"On-chain ključ seznanitve te blagajne ne daje več naslovov: lastnika prosite "
"za novo kodo za seznanitev, to prodajo pa sprejmite prek Lightninga."

msgid ""
"The register asked the explorer about many addresses of this chain and did "
"not find one that is surely unused: the history on this phone may miss many "
"sales. Take this sale with Lightning, or try again later."
msgstr ""
"Blagajna je raziskovalca blokov vprašala za veliko naslovov tega zaporedja "
"in ni našla nobenega, ki bi bil zanesljivo neuporabljen: v zgodovini na tem "
"telefonu morda manjka veliko prodaj. To prodajo sprejmite prek Lightninga "
"ali poskusite znova pozneje."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Too little for on-chain: the least is {sats}, below it wallets refuse the "
"payment or its fee eats it. Take this amount with Lightning."
msgstr ""
"Premalo za on-chain: najmanj je {sats}, pod tem zneskom denarnice plačilo "
"zavrnejo ali ga poje omrežnina. Ta znesek sprejmite prek Lightninga."

msgid "Seen, waiting for a confirmation"
msgstr "Zaznano, čaka na potrditev"

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Bitcoin discount −{percent}%: {amount} to pay. Tap to remove it for this "
"sale."
msgstr ""
"Bitcoin popust −{percent} %: za plačilo {amount}. Tapnite, da ga odstranite "
"s te prodaje."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "No discount on this sale. Tap to give the −{percent}% bitcoin discount."
msgstr ""
"Brez popusta pri tej prodaji. Tapnite, da daste bitcoin popust −{percent} %."

msgid ""
"This register is not paired yet: ask the owner to show you the pairing code "
"of this register, and scan it with this phone's camera."
msgstr ""
"Ta blagajna še ni seznanjena: lastnika prosite, naj vam pokaže kodo za "
"seznanitev te blagajne, in jo skenirajte s kamero tega telefona."

msgid ""
"The shop's Lightning address changed after this register was paired: ask the "
"owner for a new pairing code."
msgstr ""
"Lightning naslov trgovine se je spremenil po seznanitvi te blagajne: "
"lastnika prosite za novo kodo za seznanitev."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Paired with the owner's code on {date}."
msgstr "Seznanjena z lastnikovo kodo {date}."

msgid "On-chain: yes."
msgstr "On-chain: da."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Register paired. Payments go to {address}."
msgstr "Blagajna seznanjena. Plačila gredo na {address}."

msgid "This pairing code cannot be used: ask the owner for a new one."
msgstr "Te kode za seznanitev ni mogoče uporabiti: lastnika prosite za novo."

msgid ""
"This register was paired, but its pairing no longer matches the site's "
"settings: it cannot take payments. Ask the owner for a new pairing code."
msgstr ""
"Ta blagajna je bila seznanjena, vendar se seznanitev ne ujema več z "
"nastavitvami spletnega mesta: ne more sprejemati plačil. Lastnika prosite za "
"novo kodo za seznanitev."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "The shop's Lightning address changed: before it was {before}, now it is {after}. If you did not change it, do not take payments and tell the community."
msgstr "Lightning naslov trgovine se je spremenil: prej je bil {before}, zdaj je {after}. Če ga niste spremenili vi, ne sprejemajte plačil in obvestite skupnost."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "On-chain addresses of this register not paid in a row: {count}."
msgstr "Zaporedni neplačani on-chain naslovi te blagajne: {count}."

msgid ""
"A wallet stops looking after 20 unused addresses in a row (the gap limit): "
"raise it in your wallet's settings, or the next payments may not show there. "
"The money is safe all the same."
msgstr ""
"Denarnica neha iskati po 20 zaporednih neuporabljenih naslovih (gap limit): "
"v nastavitvah denarnice ga povečajte, sicer se naslednja plačila tam morda "
"ne bodo prikazala. Denar je kljub temu na varnem."

msgid ""
"A fixed address: every payment goes to the same address, so two sales of the "
"same amount at the same time cannot be told apart, a payment arriving late "
"for a cancelled sale or an earlier payment replaced by its sender can be "
"taken for the sale on the screen, and anyone who sees it sees all your "
"sales. An extended public key (zpub) is better. Tick the box to use it "
"anyway."
msgstr ""
"Stalni naslov: vsako plačilo gre na isti naslov, zato dveh prodaj z enakim "
"zneskom ob istem času ni mogoče ločiti, plačilo, ki pozno prispe za "
"preklicano prodajo, ali prejšnje plačilo, ki ga je pošiljatelj zamenjal, se "
"lahko zamenja za prodajo na zaslonu, in kdor ga vidi, vidi vse vaše prodaje. "
"Bolje je uporabiti razširjeni javni ključ (zpub). Označite polje, če ga "
"vseeno želite uporabiti."

msgid "Tick the box to confirm."
msgstr "Za potrditev označite polje."

msgid "This is neither an extended public key nor an address of this network."
msgstr "To ni niti razširjeni javni ključ niti naslov tega omrežja."

msgid "This key or address is of another network."
msgstr "Ta ključ ali naslov je iz drugega omrežja."

msgid ""
"This is a private key: never write it anywhere. Use the public one (zpub, "
"xpub…)."
msgstr ""
"To je zasebni ključ: nikoli ga nikamor ne pišite. Uporabite javnega (zpub, "
"xpub …)."

msgid "Choose at least two price sources."
msgstr "Izberite vsaj dva vira tečaja."

msgid "Write the currency as three letters, like EUR."
msgstr "Valuto zapišite s tremi črkami, na primer EUR."

msgid ""
"Saved on this phone. Staff registers get the new settings only with a new "
"pairing code."
msgstr ""
"Shranjeno na tem telefonu. Blagajne zaposlenih dobijo nove nastavitve šele z "
"novo kodo za seznanitev."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Careful: {count} on-chain sales of this copy were paid or asked for payment "
"to addresses that are not of your current key: {times}. Check them in your "
"wallet."
msgstr ""
"Pozor: on-chain prodaje te kopije ({count}) so bile plačane ali so zahtevale "
"plačilo na naslove, ki niso iz vašega trenutnega ključa: {times}. Preverite "
"jih v denarnici."

msgid ""
"Check the staff registers' on-chain sales in your wallet too: only the "
"wallet shows that a payment really arrived."
msgstr ""
"V denarnici preverite tudi on-chain prodaje blagajn zaposlenih: samo "
"denarnica pokaže, da je plačilo res prispelo."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Last copy on Nostr: {date}, on {count} relays."
msgstr "Zadnja kopija na Nostru: {date}, na relejih: {count}."

msgid "No copy on Nostr yet."
msgstr "Na Nostru še ni nobene kopije."

msgid "No relay took the copy: the register tries again after the next sale."
msgstr ""
"Noben rele kopije ni sprejel: blagajna poskusi znova po naslednji prodaji."

msgid "This is not a Nostr public key (npub…)."
msgstr "To ni javni ključ Nostr (npub …)."

msgid "This is not a Nostr private key (nsec…)."
msgstr "To ni zasebni ključ Nostr (nsec …)."

msgid "This private key is not the one of the public key in the settings."
msgstr "Ta zasebni ključ ne pripada javnemu ključu v nastavitvah."

msgid "No relay answers: try again in a moment."
msgstr "Noben rele se ne odziva: poskusite znova čez trenutek."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"From Nostr: {added} new sales, {updated} updated, {refused} copies that are "
"not yours. The staff registers' sales keep arriving while this page is open."
msgstr ""
"Z Nostra: novih prodaj {added}, posodobljenih {updated}, kopij, ki niso "
"vaše, {refused}. Prodaje blagajn zaposlenih prihajajo, dokler je ta stran "
"odprta."

msgid ""
"Forget the Nostr keys of all the staff registers paired from this phone? "
"Their copies will no longer come into this register until you pair them "
"again."
msgstr ""
"Pozabite ključe Nostr vseh blagajn zaposlenih, seznanjenih s tega telefona? "
"Njihove kopije ne bodo več prihajale v to blagajno, dokler jih znova ne "
"seznanite."

msgid ""
"The staff registers' Nostr keys are forgotten: pair them again to receive "
"their sales."
msgstr ""
"Ključi Nostr blagajn zaposlenih so pozabljeni: znova jih seznanite, da boste "
"prejemali njihove prodaje."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "{count} copies from keys this phone does not know were left out."
msgstr "Izpuščene kopije iz ključev, ki jih ta telefon ne pozna: {count}."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{copies} copies on Nostr ({sales} sales) come from {keys} keys this phone "
"does not know. They may be your own, from a phone you no longer have, or "
"written by anyone who knows your public key. Take them, every sale marked as "
"reported, to check in your wallet?"
msgstr ""
"Kopije na Nostru: {copies} (prodaje: {sales}) prihajajo iz ključev, ki jih "
"ta telefon ne pozna (ključi: {keys}). Lahko so vaše, s telefona, ki ga "
"nimate več, ali pa jih je napisal kdorkoli, ki pozna vaš javni ključ. Jih "
"prevzamete, z vsako prodajo označeno kot prijavljeno, za preverjanje v "
"denarnici?"

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"From keys this phone does not know: {added} sales taken as reported, {left} "
"left out (bring those back with the encrypted file)."
msgstr ""
"Iz ključev, ki jih ta telefon ne pozna: prevzetih kot prijavljenih prodaj "
"{added}, izpuščenih {left} (te obnovite s šifrirano datoteko)."

msgid ""
"The phone has no more room for the register's history: download a copy now."
msgstr ""
"Telefon nima več prostora za zgodovino blagajne: takoj prenesite kopijo."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Last copy: {date}."
msgstr "Zadnja kopija: {date}."

msgid "No copy downloaded yet."
msgstr "Prenesena ni še nobena kopija."

msgid "It is older than the reminder you chose: download a copy now."
msgstr "Starejša je od opomnika, ki ste ga izbrali: takoj prenesite kopijo."

msgid "Day closed. Now download the encrypted copy."
msgstr "Dan zaključen. Zdaj prenesite šifrirano kopijo."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Closed at {time}."
msgstr "Zaključeno ob {time}."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "{method}: {count} paid, {amount} ({sats})"
msgstr "{method}, plačane prodaje: {count}, {amount} ({sats})"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Of these, {count} marked as paid by you: check them in your wallet."
msgstr ""
"Od tega ste jih kot plačane označili vi: {count}. Preverite jih v denarnici."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Of these, {count} reported by a staff register: check them in your wallet."
msgstr ""
"Od tega jih je {count} prijavila blagajna zaposlenega: preverite jih v "
"denarnici."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Of these, {count} paid after you cancelled them: settle it with the customer."
msgstr ""
"Od tega jih je {count} plačanih, potem ko ste jih preklicali: uredite s "
"stranko."

msgid "paid after it was cancelled"
msgstr "plačano po preklicu"

msgid "No paid sales on this day."
msgstr "Ta dan ni plačanih prodaj."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Not checked: {count}. Look for them in your wallet."
msgstr "Niso preverjene: {count}. Poiščite jih v denarnici."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Not paid (expired or cancelled): {count}"
msgstr "Niso plačane (potekle ali preklicane): {count}"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "The passphrase must be at least {count} characters long."
msgstr "Geslo mora imeti vsaj {count} znakov."

msgid "The two passphrases are different."
msgstr "Gesli se razlikujeta."

msgid "Just a moment..."
msgstr "Trenutek ..."

msgid "This device cannot encrypt the copy: try an up-to-date Chrome or Safari."
msgstr "Na tej napravi kopije ni mogoče šifrirati: poskusite s posodobljenim Chromom ali Safarijem."

msgid ""
"Copy downloaded. Keep it somewhere other than this phone, and keep the "
"passphrase too."
msgstr ""
"Kopija prenesena. Hranite jo drugje kot na tem telefonu in shranite tudi "
"geslo."

msgid "Wrong passphrase, or a damaged file."
msgstr "Napačno geslo ali poškodovana datoteka."

msgid ""
"This copy comes from a newer version of the register: reload the page and "
"try again."
msgstr ""
"Ta kopija je iz novejše različice blagajne: znova naložite stran in "
"poskusite še enkrat."

msgid "This file is not a copy of a register."
msgstr "Ta datoteka ni kopija blagajne."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Copy imported: {added} new sales, {updated} updated."
msgstr "Kopija uvožena: novih prodaj {added}, posodobljenih {updated}."

msgid ""
"Its sales came in as reported, to check in your wallet: this phone already "
"has sales, and the box saying it is a copy of this register was not ticked."
msgstr ""
"Njene prodaje so prišle kot prijavljene, za preverjanje v denarnici: ta "
"telefon že ima prodaje, polje, ki pove, da je to kopija te blagajne, pa ni "
"bilo označeno."

msgid "Date and time"
msgstr "Datum in ura"

msgid "Business day"
msgstr "Delovni dan"

msgid "Satoshis"
msgstr "Satoši"

msgid "Exchange rate (per BTC)"
msgstr "Menjalni tečaj (za BTC)"

msgid "How the rate was chosen"
msgstr "Kako je bil tečaj izbran"

msgid "Rate sources"
msgstr "Viri tečaja"

msgid "Payment hash"
msgstr "Zgoščena vrednost plačila (hash)"

msgid "Discount (%)"
msgstr "Popust (%)"

msgid "Price before the discount"
msgstr "Cena pred popustom"

msgid "On-chain address"
msgstr "On-chain naslov"

msgid "Sale ID"
msgstr "ID prodaje"

msgid "two sources agreed"
msgstr "dva vira sta se ujemala"

msgid "chosen at the register"
msgstr "izbrano pri blagajni"

msgid "last good rate, chosen at the register"
msgstr "zadnji dobri tečaj, izbran pri blagajni"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Lightning: {address}"
msgstr "Lightning: {address}"

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"On-chain: the receive addresses of your wallet, …/{path}, counted with your "
"other registers. The first one is {address}."
msgstr ""
"On-chain: naslovi za prejemanje vaše denarnice, …/{path}, šteti skupaj z "
"vašimi drugimi blagajnami. Prvi je {address}."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "On-chain: your fixed address {address}."
msgstr "On-chain: vaš stalni naslov {address}."

msgid ""
"On-chain: no. To add it, set it in your register's settings on this phone, "
"then come back here."
msgstr ""
"On-chain: ne. Če ga želite dodati, ga nastavite v nastavitvah blagajne na "
"tem telefonu, nato se vrnite sem."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Discount {discount}%, currency {currency}, a confirmation above {above}."
msgstr "Popust {discount} %, valuta {currency}, potrditev nad {above}."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Discount {discount}%, currency {currency}."
msgstr "Popust {discount} %, valuta {currency}."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Sales sent to you on Nostr as they happen, encrypted to {owner}."
msgstr "Prodaje, ki vam jih sproti pošiljamo na Nostr, šifrirane za {owner}."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The shop's Lightning address is {after}, but the register on this phone "
"takes payments into {before}. Open your register first and check it: no code "
"until they are the same."
msgstr ""
"Lightning naslov trgovine je {after}, blagajna na tem telefonu pa sprejema "
"plačila na {before}. Najprej odprite svojo blagajno in preverite: kode ni, "
"dokler nista enaka."

msgid "The code cannot be made on this device: try an up-to-date Chrome or Safari, or open this page on the phone with your register."
msgstr "Na tej napravi kode ni mogoče ustvariti: poskusite s posodobljenim Chromom ali Safarijem ali odprite to stran na telefonu s svojo blagajno."

msgid ""
"The shop's Lightning wallet does not answer: the register cannot charge."
msgstr ""
"Lightning denarnica trgovine se ne odziva: blagajna ne more sprejeti plačila."

msgid ""
"The shop's Lightning wallet answers from another address: the register "
"cannot use it."
msgstr ""
"Lightning denarnica trgovine odgovarja z drugega naslova: blagajna je ne "
"more uporabiti."

msgid ""
"The shop's Lightning wallet sent an invoice that is old or already used for "
"another sale: do not use it. Try again in a moment."
msgstr ""
"Lightning denarnica trgovine je poslala zahtevek za plačilo, ki je star ali "
"že uporabljen za drugo prodajo: ne uporabite ga. Poskusite znova čez "
"trenutek."

msgid ""
"Careful: this register cannot see when this payment arrives. Hand over the "
"goods only after the owner sees the payment in their wallet, then confirm "
"here."
msgstr ""
"Pozor: ta blagajna ne vidi, kdaj to plačilo prispe. Blago izročite šele, ko "
"lastnik vidi plačilo v svoji denarnici, nato potrdite tukaj."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Of these, {count} marked as paid: the owner checks them in the wallet."
msgstr ""
"Od tega jih je {count} označenih kot plačane: lastnik jih preveri v "
"denarnici."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Not checked: {count}. Tell the owner."
msgstr "Niso preverjene: {count}. Obvestite lastnika."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Of these, {count} paid after they were cancelled: tell the owner."
msgstr "Od tega jih je {count} plačanih po preklicu: obvestite lastnika."

msgid "Shift ended. Now download the encrypted copy and give it to the owner."
msgstr "Izmena končana. Zdaj prenesite šifrirano kopijo in jo dajte lastniku."

msgid "Log out"
msgstr "Odjava"

msgid "Home"
msgstr "Domov"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(shops)s register in this site, as the database knows it now: nothing here "
"asks the wallets."
msgid_plural ""
"%(shops)s registers in this site, as the database knows them now: nothing "
"here asks the wallets."
msgstr[0] ""
"%(shops)s blagajna na tem spletnem mestu, kot jo zdaj pozna baza podatkov: "
"ta stran denarnic ne sprašuje ničesar."
msgstr[1] ""
"%(shops)s blagajni na tem spletnem mestu, kot ju zdaj pozna baza podatkov: "
"ta stran denarnic ne sprašuje ničesar."
msgstr[2] ""
"%(shops)s blagajne na tem spletnem mestu, kot jih zdaj pozna baza podatkov: "
"ta stran denarnic ne sprašuje ničesar."
msgstr[3] ""
"%(shops)s blagajn na tem spletnem mestu, kot jih zdaj pozna baza podatkov: "
"ta stran denarnic ne sprašuje ničesar."

msgid ""
"This register is the real one, with the same screens and the same words. The "
"code it shows cannot be paid by any wallet, and nothing is sent anywhere."
msgstr ""
"Ta blagajna je prava, z enakimi zasloni in enakimi besedami. Kode, ki jo "
"pokaže, ne more plačati nobena denarnica, in nič se nikamor ne pošlje."

msgid "The customer does not pay"
msgstr "Stranka ne plača"

msgid "Start a sale and press «Does not pay»."
msgstr "Začnite prodajo in pritisnite »Ne plača«."

msgid ""
"Nothing was charged: keep the goods. The register says «Payment expired» and "
"is ready for the next sale."
msgstr ""
"Nič ni bilo plačano: blago obdržite. Blagajna pokaže »Plačilo poteklo« in je "
"pripravljena za naslednjo prodajo."

msgid ""
"Open the register again on the same phone: the sale comes back and says how "
"it ended. On another phone it does not: look in your wallet."
msgstr ""
"Znova odprite blagajno na istem telefonu: prodaja se vrne in pove, kako se "
"je končala. Na drugem telefonu ne: poglejte v svojo denarnico."

msgid ""
"Sales stay only on this phone and in the copies you download. The site does "
"not see or keep them: if you lose the phone without a copy, you lose the "
"history (not the money, which is in the shop's wallet)."
msgstr ""
"Prodaje ostanejo samo na tem telefonu in v kopijah, ki jih prenesete. "
"Spletno mesto jih ne vidi in ne hrani: če izgubite telefon brez kopije, "
"izgubite zgodovino (ne denarja, ki je v denarnici trgovine)."

msgid ""
"Sales stay only on this phone and in the copies you download. The site does "
"not see or keep them: if you lose the phone without a copy, you lose the "
"history (not the money, which is in your wallet)."
msgstr ""
"Prodaje ostanejo samo na tem telefonu in v kopijah, ki jih prenesete. "
"Spletno mesto jih ne vidi in ne hrani: če izgubite telefon brez kopije, "
"izgubite zgodovino (ne denarja, ki je v vaši denarnici)."

msgid "Understood"
msgstr "Razumem"

msgid "I changed it: use the new address"
msgstr "Sprememba je moja: uporabite nov naslov"

msgid "OK, on-chain"
msgstr "V redu, on-chain"

msgid ""
"Open the register again on the same phone: the sale comes back, or its line "
"below says how it ended. On another phone it does not: tell the owner the "
"time and the amount."
msgstr ""
"Znova odprite blagajno na istem telefonu: prodaja se vrne ali pa njena "
"vrstica spodaj pove, kako se je končala. Na drugem telefonu ne: lastniku "
"povejte uro in znesek."

msgid "Time to download a copy of your sales."
msgstr "Čas je, da prenesete kopijo svojih prodaj."

msgid "Sales on this phone"
msgstr "Prodaje na tem telefonu"

msgid "This device may delete the sales when it needs room: keep your copies up to date."
msgstr "Ta naprava lahko izbriše prodaje, ko potrebuje prostor: sproti posodabljajte svoje kopije."

msgid "End of shift"
msgstr "Konec izmene"

msgid "Day closing"
msgstr "Dnevni zaključek"

msgid "Sales of the day"
msgstr "Prodaje dneva"

msgid "End the shift"
msgstr "Zaključite izmeno"

msgid "Close the day"
msgstr "Zaključite dan"

msgid "Copies"
msgstr "Kopije"

msgid "Remind me to download a copy"
msgstr "Opomnik za prenos kopije"

msgid "Never: I do it when I want"
msgstr "Nikoli: prenesem, kadar želim"

msgid "Every day"
msgstr "Vsak dan"

msgid "Every week"
msgstr "Vsak teden"

msgid "Every month"
msgstr "Vsak mesec"

msgid "At the end of every shift"
msgstr "Ob koncu vsake izmene"

msgid "At every day closing"
msgstr "Ob vsakem dnevnem zaključku"

msgid "All the sales"
msgstr "Vse prodaje"

msgid "Download the CSV for the accountant"
msgstr "Prenesite CSV za računovodjo"

msgid ""
"The full copy is encrypted with a passphrase you choose: without it nobody "
"can open the copy, not even you. Write it down somewhere safe."
msgstr ""
"Celotna kopija je šifrirana z geslom, ki ga izberete sami: brez njega kopije "
"ne more odpreti nihče, niti vi. Zapišite ga na varno mesto."

msgid "Passphrase (at least 10 characters)"
msgstr "Geslo (vsaj 10 znakov)"

msgid "The passphrase again"
msgstr "Ponovite geslo"

msgid "Download the encrypted copy"
msgstr "Prenesite šifrirano kopijo"

msgid ""
"On a new phone: the sales already here stay, and each sale is counted once."
msgstr ""
"Na novem telefonu: prodaje, ki so že tukaj, ostanejo, vsaka prodaja pa se "
"šteje samo enkrat."

msgid ""
"On a new phone, or to add a staff register's sales at the end of a shift: "
"the sales already here stay, and each sale is counted once."
msgstr ""
"Na novem telefonu ali za dodajanje prodaj blagajne zaposlenega ob koncu "
"izmene: prodaje, ki so že tukaj, ostanejo, vsaka prodaja pa se šteje samo "
"enkrat."

msgid "File of the copy"
msgstr "Datoteka kopije"

msgid "Its passphrase"
msgstr "Njeno geslo"

msgid ""
"It is a copy of this register, made on this phone or on the one it replaces"
msgstr ""
"To je kopija te blagajne, narejena na tem telefonu ali na tistem, ki ga "
"nadomešča"

msgid "Import the copy"
msgstr "Uvozite kopijo"

msgid "Copy on Nostr"
msgstr "Kopija na Nostru"

msgid "Send the copy now"
msgstr "Pošljite kopijo zdaj"

msgid ""
"The sales of the staff registers paired from this phone arrive by themselves "
"while this page is open. Your Nostr private key is needed only to bring back "
"your own copies on a new phone, and to read the staff registers this phone "
"no longer has the keys of: it stays on this page until you close it, never "
"stored and never sent."
msgstr ""
"Prodaje blagajn zaposlenih, seznanjenih s tega telefona, prihajajo same, "
"dokler je ta stran odprta. Vaš zasebni ključ Nostr potrebujete samo za "
"obnovo lastnih kopij na novem telefonu in za branje blagajn, katerih ključev "
"ta telefon nima več: ostane na tej strani, dokler je ne zaprete, nikoli ni "
"shranjen in nikoli poslan."

msgid "Your Nostr private key (nsec)"
msgstr "Vaš zasebni ključ Nostr (nsec)"

msgid "Bring the sales from Nostr"
msgstr "Prenesite prodaje z Nostra"

msgid "Register settings"
msgstr "Nastavitve blagajne"

msgid "On-chain"
msgstr "On-chain"

msgid "I checked it: it is my wallet's"
msgstr "Preverjeno: je iz moje denarnice"

msgid "Price sources (at least two)"
msgstr "Viri tečaja (vsaj dva)"

msgid "Colour of the register"
msgstr "Barva blagajne"

msgid "A line on the register and on the staff registers (optional)"
msgstr "Vrstica na blagajni in na blagajnah zaposlenih (neobvezno)"

msgid ""
"With your Nostr public key, this register keeps an encrypted copy of its "
"sales on the community's relays, and the staff registers paired after this "
"send you their sales as they happen. Only your private key opens them."
msgstr ""
"Z vašim javnim ključem Nostr ta blagajna hrani šifrirano kopijo svojih "
"prodaj na relejih skupnosti, blagajne zaposlenih, seznanjene po tem, pa vam "
"sproti pošiljajo svoje prodaje. Odpre jih samo vaš zasebni ključ."

msgid "Public relays to use too (optional)"
msgstr "Dodatni javni releji (neobvezno)"

msgid "Forget the staff registers' Nostr keys"
msgstr "Pozabite ključe Nostr blagajn zaposlenih"

msgid "Customers pay into your Lightning address."
msgstr "Stranke plačujejo na vaš Lightning naslov."

msgid ""
"No problem: leave the address empty. Your shop is saved, and a guide shows "
"you how to get a free wallet in a few minutes. Your shop goes on the map, "
"with its register, when the wallet is added."
msgstr ""
"Ni težave: naslov pustite prazen. Trgovina se shrani, navodila pa vam "
"pokažejo, kako v nekaj minutah dobiti brezplačno denarnico. Trgovina pride "
"na zemljevid, z blagajno vred, ko dodate denarnico."

msgid ""
"The code pairs the register with yours: it carries where the money goes and "
"your preferences, read from this phone. Open this page on the phone with "
"your register, so that on-chain and your settings come along. The site never "
"sees them."
msgstr ""
"Koda seznani blagajno z vašo: prenese, kam gre denar, in vaše nastavitve, "
"prebrane s tega telefona. To stran odprite na telefonu s svojo blagajno, da "
"se prenesejo tudi on-chain in vaše nastavitve. Spletno mesto jih nikoli ne "
"vidi."

msgid ""
"The code pairs the register with yours: it carries where the money goes and "
"your preferences, read from this phone. Open this page on the phone with "
"your register, so that your settings come along. The site never sees them."
msgstr ""
"Koda seznani blagajno z vašo: prenese, kam gre denar, in vaše nastavitve, "
"prebrane s tega telefona. To stran odprite na telefonu s svojo blagajno, da "
"se prenesejo tudi vaše nastavitve. Spletno mesto jih nikoli ne vidi."

msgid "The code is drawn by the browser: turn JavaScript on."
msgstr "Kodo nariše brskalnik: vklopite JavaScript."

msgid ""
"Send it only to the person, in a private message: the link carries where the "
"money goes."
msgstr ""
"Pošljite jo samo tej osebi, v zasebnem sporočilu: povezava vsebuje, kam gre "
"denar."

msgid ""
"Changed your settings, the on-chain key or the Lightning address? Make a new "
"code and scan it with the register's phone: it is paired again."
msgstr ""
"Ste spremenili nastavitve, on-chain ključ ali Lightning naslov? Ustvarite "
"novo kodo in jo skenirajte s telefonom blagajne: znova se seznani."

msgid ""
"Changed your settings or the Lightning address? Make a new code and scan it "
"with the register's phone: it is paired again."
msgstr ""
"Ste spremenili nastavitve ali Lightning naslov? Ustvarite novo kodo in jo "
"skenirajte s telefonom blagajne: znova se seznani."

msgid "If the wallet does not tell the register"
msgstr "Če denarnica ne obvesti blagajne"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"Some wallets do not tell the register when a payment arrives: then the "
"register says so in red, under the code. Hand over the goods only after the "
"owner sees the payment in the shop's wallet, then press “%(seen)s”."
msgstr ""
"Nekatere denarnice blagajni ne sporočijo, kdaj prispe plačilo: takrat "
"blagajna to pove z rdečo, pod kodo. Blago izročite šele, ko lastnik vidi "
"plačilo v denarnici trgovine, nato pritisnite »%(seen)s«."

#, python-format
msgid "“%(expired)s”: the time ran out, nothing was charged. Start again."
msgstr "»%(expired)s«: čas je potekel, nič ni bilo plačano. Začnite znova."

#, python-format
msgid "“%(cancel)s” only if the customer has not paid."
msgstr "»%(cancel)s« samo, če stranka ni plačala."

msgid ""
"Too much or too little: a Lightning payment is always the exact amount of "
"the code."
msgstr "Preveč ali premalo: plačilo Lightning je vedno natančen znesek kode."

#, python-format
msgid "“%(check_failed)s” Wait: do not cancel and do not start over."
msgstr "»%(check_failed)s« Počakajte: ne prekličite in ne začnite znova."

msgid ""
"The register works even when the site does not answer: the sales stay on the "
"phone, and the site never sees them."
msgstr ""
"Blagajna deluje tudi, ko se spletno mesto ne odziva: prodaje ostanejo na "
"telefonu in spletno mesto jih nikoli ne vidi."

msgid ""
"Under the keypad the register lists the sales made on this phone, with how "
"each one ended."
msgstr ""
"Pod tipkovnico blagajna navede prodaje na tem telefonu in kako se je vsaka "
"končala."

msgid "Copy the text"
msgstr "Kopirajte besedilo"

msgid "Reported by (check in the wallet)"
msgstr "Prijavil (preverite v denarnici)"

msgid ""
"This is a copy of the practice register: its sales are pretend, and it does "
"not come into the real register."
msgstr ""
"To je kopija vadbene blagajne: njene prodaje so namišljene in ne pride v "
"pravo blagajno."

msgid "This is a copy of a real register: it does not come into the practice."
msgstr "To je kopija prave blagajne: ne pride v vadbo."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Marked as paid by {who}"
msgstr "Kot plačano označil {who}"

msgid "Marked as paid by hand on another phone"
msgstr "Ročno označeno kot plačano na drugem telefonu"

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Still waiting for a payment or a confirmation: {count}. The register looks "
"again by itself."
msgstr ""
"Še čaka na plačilo ali potrditev: {count}. Blagajna sama znova preveri."

msgid "Write the amount as a number, like 50 or 49.90."
msgstr "Znesek zapišite kot število, na primer 50 ali 49,90."

msgid ""
"Many addresses after the last one this phone knows look used (by the "
"explorer's answers). If your wallet really used them, set the starting "
"number in Settings; otherwise ask the community about its explorer. Take "
"this sale with Lightning."
msgstr ""
"Veliko naslovov za zadnjim, ki ga ta telefon pozna, je videti uporabljenih "
"(po odgovorih raziskovalca blokov). Če jih je vaša denarnica res uporabila, "
"v Nastavitvah nastavite začetno številko; sicer skupnost vprašajte o njenem "
"raziskovalcu blokov. To prodajo sprejmite prek Lightninga."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{count} sales of this register's own were left as they were. If the file is "
"a copy of this register, and only if you made it yourself on this register, "
"tick «It is a copy of this register» and import it again."
msgstr ""
"Prodaje te blagajne ({count}) so ostale, kakršne so bile. Če je datoteka "
"kopija te blagajne, in samo če ste jo na tej blagajni naredili sami, "
"označite »To je kopija te blagajne« in jo uvozite znova."

msgid ""
"Many addresses after the last one this register knows look used (by the "
"explorer's answers). Tell the owner: if the wallet really used them, the "
"owner adds this register again and pairs it (a new path of addresses); "
"otherwise ask the community about its explorer. Take this sale with "
"Lightning."
msgstr ""
"Veliko naslovov za zadnjim, ki ga ta blagajna pozna, je videti uporabljenih "
"(po odgovorih raziskovalca blokov). Povejte lastniku: če jih je denarnica "
"res uporabila, lastnik to blagajno doda znova in jo seznani (nova pot "
"naslovov); sicer skupnost vprašajte o njenem raziskovalcu blokov. To prodajo "
"sprejmite prek Lightninga."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"On-chain address …/{path} of your key: {address}. Check that your wallet "
"shows the same one at that number, then tick the box and save."
msgstr ""
"On-chain naslov …/{path} vašega ključa: {address}. Preverite, ali vaša "
"denarnica pri tej številki kaže isti naslov, nato označite polje in shranite."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "The next on-chain sale uses the address …/{path}."
msgstr "Naslednja on-chain prodaja uporabi naslov …/{path}."

msgid "Write the starting number as a whole number, like 120."
msgstr "Začetno številko zapišite kot celo število, na primer 120."

msgid ""
"The starting number needs an extended public key of your wallet (zpub, "
"xpub…)."
msgstr ""
"Za začetno številko potrebujete razširjeni javni ključ svoje denarnice "
"(zpub, xpub …)."

msgid "private part approved on"
msgstr "zasebni del odobren dne"

msgid "private part approved by"
msgstr "zasebni del odobril"

msgid "Certified, private part waiting for approval"
msgstr "Certificirana, zasebni del čaka na odobritev"

msgid "Open the private part to the owner"
msgstr "Odprite zasebni del lastniku"

msgid "Close the private part to the owner"
msgstr "Zaprite zasebni del lastniku"

msgid "Private part opened for %(count)d shops."
msgstr "Zasebni del odprt, število trgovin: %(count)d."

msgid "Private part closed for %(count)d shops."
msgstr "Zasebni del zaprt, število trgovin: %(count)d."

msgid ""
"This Lightning address is already used by another shop. Use the address of "
"your own wallet."
msgstr ""
"Ta Lightning naslov že uporablja druga trgovina. Uporabite naslov svoje "
"denarnice."

msgid "Certified: the private part waits for your approval."
msgstr "Certificirana: zasebni del čaka na vašo odobritev."

msgid ""
"Look at the shop and its owner; if all is well, open the private part with "
"the action «Open the private part to the owner»."
msgstr ""
"Poglejte trgovino in lastnika; če je vse v redu, odprite zasebni del z "
"dejanjem »Odprite zasebni del lastniku«."

msgid "Its Lightning address is also on a shop of another owner."
msgstr "Njen Lightning naslov je tudi na trgovini drugega lastnika."

msgid ""
"Find out whose wallet it is: the other owner's shop must change its address. "
"Until then the site certifies neither shop."
msgstr ""
"Ugotovite, čigava je denarnica: trgovina drugega lastnika mora spremeniti "
"naslov. Do takrat spletno mesto ne certificira nobene od obeh."

msgid ""
"More than asked has arrived: {seen} of {sats}. It may be a payment for "
"something else to the same address: look in your wallet, and confirm by hand "
"only if it is this sale's."
msgstr ""
"Prispelo je več, kot je bilo zahtevano: {seen} od {sats}. Morda je to "
"plačilo za kaj drugega na isti naslov: poglejte v denarnico in ročno "
"potrdite samo, če je od te prodaje."

msgid ""
"A payment of {seen} reached this address before this sale or long after it: "
"it is not counted for this sale. Look in your wallet."
msgstr ""
"Plačilo {seen} je na ta naslov prispelo pred to prodajo ali dolgo po njej: "
"za to prodajo ne šteje. Poglejte v denarnico."

msgid ""
"The customer looks at the code and does not know what to do: their wallet "
"does not read Lightning codes. Maybe it pays only on-chain: do not despair. "
"Cancel this sale, type the amount again and press «OK, on-chain»."
msgstr ""
"Stranka gleda kodo in ne ve, kaj storiti: njena denarnica ne bere kod "
"Lightning. Morda plačuje samo on-chain: ne obupajte. Prekličite to prodajo, "
"znova vpišite znesek in pritisnite »V redu, on-chain«."

msgid ""
"An on-chain code: the customer's wallet pays it as an ordinary bitcoin "
"payment. Wait for «Payment received» here, as with Lightning."
msgstr ""
"On-chain koda: denarnica stranke jo plača kot navadno plačilo z bitcoinom. "
"Tukaj počakajte na »Plačilo prejeto«, kot pri Lightningu."

msgid ""
"With a key, each sale takes the next unused receive address of your wallet, "
"so the payments show in any wallet. These are the same addresses your wallet "
"may give to someone else: a payment to one of them may be for something "
"else. The register counts a payment only if it is the sale's amount and "
"arrives during the sale, and otherwise shows what arrived: check it in your "
"wallet. Never give out the wallet's receive addresses elsewhere while you "
"use the register."
msgstr ""
"S ključem vsaka prodaja vzame naslednji neuporabljeni naslov za prejemanje "
"vaše denarnice, zato so plačila vidna v vsaki denarnici. To so isti naslovi, "
"ki jih vaša denarnica lahko da drugim: plačilo na enega od njih je lahko za "
"kaj drugega. Blagajna plačilo šteje samo, če je v znesku prodaje in prispe "
"med prodajo, sicer pokaže, kaj je prispelo: preverite to v denarnici. Dokler "
"uporabljate blagajno, naslovov za prejemanje iz denarnice ne dajajte drugam."

msgid ""
"Only when the register says that many addresses after the last one it knows "
"look used, and your wallet really used them (a wallet in use for a long "
"time, or a phone restored with too little history): read the number of the "
"last used receive address (…/0) in your wallet (for example in Sparrow's "
"address list) and type the next one. The register then uses that number, the "
"next one, and so on. Empty: no change. All the registers of the shop then go "
"on from there."
msgstr ""
"Samo ko blagajna pravi, da je veliko naslovov za zadnjim, ki ga pozna, "
"videti uporabljenih, in jih je vaša denarnica res uporabila (denarnica, ki "
"jo uporabljate že dolgo, ali telefon, obnovljen s premalo zgodovine): v "
"denarnici preberite številko zadnjega uporabljenega naslova za prejemanje (…/"
"0) (na primer na seznamu naslovov v Sparrowu) in vpišite naslednjo. Blagajna "
"nato uporabi to številko, naslednjo in tako naprej. Prazno: brez sprememb. "
"Vse blagajne trgovine nato nadaljujejo od tam."

msgid "Path of the on-chain addresses after your key (optional)"
msgstr "Pot on-chain naslovov za vašim ključem (neobvezno)"

msgid ""
"Empty: 0, the receive chain of a standard wallet (…/0/0, …/0/1, …). Change "
"it only if your wallet receives on another path after the key you pasted, "
"for example 0/5: whole numbers separated by «/», at most four, none hardened "
"(no ' or h). All the registers of the shop use it; a staff register after "
"you pair it again. Sales already made keep their addresses."
msgstr ""
"Prazno: 0, veriga za prejemanje standardne denarnice (…/0/0, …/0/1, …). "
"Spremenite jo samo, če vaša denarnica za prilepljenim ključem prejema na "
"drugi poti, na primer 0/5: cela števila, ločena z »/«, največ štiri, nobeno "
"hardened (brez ' ali h). Uporabljajo jo vse blagajne trgovine; blagajna "
"zaposlenega, ko jo znova seznanite. Že opravljene prodaje obdržijo svoje "
"naslove."

msgid ""
"To take on-chain sales here, sign in on this phone as the shop's owner: all "
"the shop's registers share one count of the addresses, kept by the site, so "
"that none is given twice. Take this sale with Lightning."
msgstr ""
"Za sprejemanje on-chain plačil tukaj se na tem telefonu prijavite kot "
"lastnik trgovine: vse blagajne trgovine si delijo eno štetje naslovov, ki ga "
"vodi spletno mesto, da noben naslov ni dan dvakrat. To prodajo sprejmite "
"prek Lightninga."

msgid ""
"The site does not answer, and the shop's registers share one count of the on-"
"chain addresses through it: no address without it. Take this sale with "
"Lightning, or try again in a moment."
msgstr ""
"Spletno mesto se ne odziva, blagajne trgovine pa si prek njega delijo eno "
"štetje on-chain naslovov: brez njega ni naslova. To prodajo sprejmite prek "
"Lightninga ali poskusite znova čez trenutek."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "On-chain addresses in use: …/{path} of your key."
msgstr "Uporabljeni on-chain naslovi: …/{path} vašega ključa."

msgid ""
"Not a path: whole numbers separated by «/», at most four, none hardened (no "
"' or h)."
msgstr ""
"To ni pot: cela števila, ločena z »/«, največ štiri, nobeno hardened (brez ' "
"ali h)."

msgid "A path needs an extended public key, not a fixed address."
msgstr "Pot potrebuje razširjeni javni ključ, ne stalnega naslova."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"First address of this key at …/{path}: {address}. Check that your wallet "
"shows the same one, then tick the box."
msgstr ""
"Prvi naslov tega ključa na …/{path}: {address}. Preverite, ali vaša "
"denarnica kaže istega, nato označite polje."

msgid ""
"The shop's on-chain addresses are not ready for this register yet: ask the "
"owner to open this register's code page on the owner's phone once more. Take "
"this sale with Lightning."
msgstr ""
"On-chain naslovi trgovine za to blagajno še niso pripravljeni: lastnika "
"prosite, naj na svojem telefonu še enkrat odpre stran s kodo te blagajne. To "
"prodajo sprejmite prek Lightninga."

msgid "the explorer does not say whether it spends unconfirmed payments"
msgstr "raziskovalec blokov ne pove, ali porablja nepotrjena plačila"

msgid "Advanced"
msgstr "Napredno"

msgid ""
"The exchange rate is the average of two of these sources that agree. Your "
"choice goes to the staff registers with their pairing code: they cannot "
"change it."
msgstr ""
"Menjalni tečaj je povprečje dveh od teh virov, ki se ujemata. Vaša izbira "
"gre na blagajne zaposlenih z njihovo kodo za seznanitev: ne morejo je "
"spremeniti."

msgid "Does not understand the code"
msgstr "Ne razume kode"

msgid "The customer does not understand your code"
msgstr "Stranka ne razume vaše kode"

msgid ""
"Start a sale and press «Does not understand the code». Cancel the sale, type "
"the amount again, press «OK, on-chain», then «Pays»."
msgstr ""
"Začnite prodajo in pritisnite »Ne razume kode«. Prekličite prodajo, znova "
"vpišite znesek, pritisnite »V redu, on-chain«, nato »Plača«."

msgid ""
"Do not despair: some wallets pay only on-chain. If the owner set up on-chain "
"for this register, press «OK, on-chain» instead of OK. Wait for «Payment "
"received» as usual: it can take ten minutes or more."
msgstr ""
"Ne obupajte: nekatere denarnice plačujejo samo on-chain. Če je lastnik za to "
"blagajno vklopil on-chain, pritisnite »V redu, on-chain« namesto OK. Kot "
"vedno počakajte na »Plačilo prejeto«: lahko traja deset minut ali več."

msgid ""
"Do not despair: maybe the customer's wallet pays only on-chain. With on-"
"chain set up in the register's settings, press «OK, on-chain» instead of OK. "
"It has advantages for you too: the money arrives straight in your wallet, "
"with no channel to look after. Wait for «Payment received»: it can take ten "
"minutes or more."
msgstr ""
"Ne obupajte: morda denarnica stranke plačuje samo on-chain. Z on-chain, "
"vklopljenim v nastavitvah blagajne, pritisnite »V redu, on-chain« namesto "
"OK. Prednosti ima tudi za vas: denar pride naravnost v vašo denarnico, brez "
"kanalov, za katere bi morali skrbeti. Počakajte na »Plačilo prejeto«: lahko "
"traja deset minut ali več."

msgid "Confidence: sure ({why})."
msgstr "Zanesljivost: gotovo ({why})."

msgid "Confidence: probable ({why})."
msgstr "Zanesljivost: verjetno ({why})."

msgid "Confidence: low, wait for a confirmation ({why})."
msgstr "Zanesljivost: nizka, počakajte na potrditev ({why})."

msgid "confirmed in a block"
msgstr "potrjeno v bloku"

msgid "confirmations: {count}"
msgstr "potrditve: {count}"

msgid "fee {rate} sat/vB, at least the next block's {target}"
msgstr "omrežnina {rate} sat/vB, vsaj toliko kot za naslednji blok ({target})"

msgid "fee {rate} sat/vB, at least the half hour's {target}"
msgstr "omrežnina {rate} sat/vB, vsaj toliko kot za pol ure ({target})"

msgid ""
"fee {rate} sat/vB, below the half hour's {target}: it may take up to an hour"
msgstr ""
"omrežnina {rate} sat/vB, manj kot za pol ure ({target}): lahko traja do ene "
"ure"

msgid ""
"fee {rate} sat/vB, below the next hour's {target}: it may wait long, or be "
"dropped or replaced"
msgstr ""
"omrežnina {rate} sat/vB, manj kot za naslednjo uro ({target}): lahko dolgo "
"čaka ali je zavržena ali zamenjana"

msgid "the sender marked it as replaceable (RBF)"
msgstr "plačnik jo je označil kot zamenljivo (RBF)"

msgid "not marked as replaceable (no RBF)"
msgstr "ni označena kot zamenljiva (brez RBF)"

msgid ""
"it spends a payment not confirmed yet: if that one is dropped, this goes "
"with it"
msgstr "porablja še nepotrjeno plačilo: če je to zavrženo, ji ta sledi"

msgid "no unconfirmed parent"
msgstr "brez nepotrjene predhodnice"

msgid "Confidence: sure"
msgstr "Zanesljivost: gotovo"

msgid "Confidence: probable"
msgstr "Zanesljivost: verjetno"

msgid "Confidence: low"
msgstr "Zanesljivost: nizka"

msgid "the explorer does not say the fee level"
msgstr "raziskovalec blokov ne pove ravni omrežnin"

msgid "Change the Lightning address"
msgstr "Spremenite Lightning naslov"

msgid "Payments go now to:"
msgstr "Plačila zdaj gredo na:"

#, python-format
msgid "The address can be changed once a day."
msgid_plural ""
"The address can be changed once every %(days)s days: next time from %(when)s."
msgstr[0] ""
"Naslov je mogoče spremeniti enkrat na %(days)s dan: naslednjič od %(when)s."
msgstr[1] ""
"Naslov je mogoče spremeniti enkrat na %(days)s dni: naslednjič od %(when)s."
msgstr[2] ""
"Naslov je mogoče spremeniti enkrat na %(days)s dni: naslednjič od %(when)s."
msgstr[3] ""
"Naslov je mogoče spremeniti enkrat na %(days)s dni: naslednjič od %(when)s."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"If you need it sooner, write to <a href=\"mailto:%(email)s\">%(email)s</a>."
msgstr ""
"Če ga potrebujete prej, pišite na <a href=\"mailto:%(email)s\">%(email)s</a>."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"To keep your money safe, the address changes only after a sign-in of the "
"last %(minutes)s minutes. Sign out and sign in again, with your wallet or "
"with the email link, then come back here."
msgstr ""
"Za zaščito vašega denarja se naslov spremeni samo po prijavi v zadnjih "
"%(minutes)s minutah. Odjavite se in znova prijavite, z denarnico ali s "
"povezavo po e-pošti, nato se vrnite sem."

msgid "Sign in again"
msgstr "Znova se prijavite"

msgid ""
"The check is taking too long. You can go on: the address is checked again "
"when you save."
msgstr ""
"Preizkus traja predolgo. Lahko nadaljujete: naslov se znova preizkusi, ko "
"shranite."

msgid ""
"I could not check the address now. You can go on: it is checked again when "
"you save."
msgstr ""
"Naslova zdaj ni bilo mogoče preizkusiti. Lahko nadaljujete: znova se "
"preizkusi, ko shranite."

msgid "What happens"
msgstr "Kaj se zgodi"

msgid ""
"We try the new address, as the first time. Your shop, its page and its sign "
"stay the same: the sign's code leads to the shop's page, so you do not need "
"to print it again."
msgstr ""
"Nov naslov preizkusimo, kot prvič. Vaša trgovina, njena stran in njena tabla "
"ostanejo enake: koda na tabli vodi na stran trgovine, zato je ni treba znova "
"natisniti."

msgid ""
"Open your register again and confirm the new address. The registers of your "
"staff stop until you give each one a new pairing code."
msgstr ""
"Znova odprite svojo blagajno in potrdite nov naslov. Blagajne vaših "
"zaposlenih se ustavijo, dokler vsaki ne daste nove kode za seznanitev."

msgid ""
"Sales already started on the old address are still recognised for a few "
"days: keep the old wallet until they are settled."
msgstr ""
"Prodaje, ki so se že začele na starem naslovu, se še nekaj dni prepoznajo: "
"staro denarnico obdržite, dokler niso zaključene."

#, python-format
msgid "We send you a confirmation and tell the community. The address can be changed again after a day."
msgid_plural "We send you a confirmation and tell the community. The address can be changed again after %(days)s days."
msgstr[0] "Pošljemo vam potrditev in obvestimo skupnost. Naslov je mogoče znova spremeniti po %(days)s dnevu."
msgstr[1] "Pošljemo vam potrditev in obvestimo skupnost. Naslov je mogoče znova spremeniti po %(days)s dneh."
msgstr[2] "Pošljemo vam potrditev in obvestimo skupnost. Naslov je mogoče znova spremeniti po %(days)s dneh."
msgstr[3] "Pošljemo vam potrditev in obvestimo skupnost. Naslov je mogoče znova spremeniti po %(days)s dneh."

msgid ""
"If your shop is certified, the badge comes back as soon as we see the new "
"address work, usually within the hour."
msgstr ""
"Če je trgovina certificirana, se znak vrne takoj, ko vidimo, da nov naslov "
"deluje, običajno v eni uri."

msgid "Change the address"
msgstr "Spremenite naslov"

#, python-format
msgid "On %(when)s you changed the Lightning address from %(before)s to %(after)s. Open each register again and confirm it; give your staff new pairing codes. The printed sign stays valid. If it was not you, write to the community now."
msgstr "%(when)s ste spremenili Lightning naslov iz %(before)s v %(after)s. Znova odprite vsako blagajno in ga potrdite; zaposlenim dajte nove kode za seznanitev. Natisnjena tabla ostane veljavna. Če tega niste storili vi, takoj pišite skupnosti."

msgid ""
"We are checking the new address: until then the certified badge is paused."
msgstr ""
"Nov naslov preizkušamo: do takrat je znak certificirane trgovine začasno "
"ustavljen."

msgid ""
"To use another wallet later, you change the address from the shop's page in "
"your panel: the shop and its sign stay the same."
msgstr ""
"Če boste pozneje želeli uporabljati drugo denarnico, naslov spremenite na "
"strani trgovine na nadzorni plošči: trgovina in njena tabla ostaneta enaki."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"Open your wallet and check that your Lightning address is still this one. If "
"your wallet changed it, or changed how it works, <a "
"href=\"%(new_shop)s\">change it</a> to an address that tells the register "
"when a payment arrives, or write to <a href=\"mailto:%(email)s\">%(email)s</"
"a>."
msgstr ""
"Odprite denarnico in preverite, ali je vaš Lightning naslov še vedno ta. Če "
"ga je denarnica spremenila ali spremenila način delovanja, ga <a "
"href=\"%(new_shop)s\">zamenjajte</a> z naslovom, ki blagajni sporoči, kdaj "
"prispe plačilo, ali pišite na <a href=\"mailto:%(email)s\">%(email)s</a>."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"Open your wallet and check that your Lightning address is still this one. If "
"it changed, <a href=\"%(new_shop)s\">change it here</a>. If it is the same, "
"your wallet's provider may be having trouble: try again later, or write to "
"<a href=\"mailto:%(email)s\">%(email)s</a>."
msgstr ""
"Odprite denarnico in preverite, ali je vaš Lightning naslov še vedno ta. Če "
"se je spremenil, ga <a href=\"%(new_shop)s\">spremenite tukaj</a>. Če je "
"enak, ima ponudnik denarnice morda težave: poskusite znova pozneje ali "
"pišite na <a href=\"mailto:%(email)s\">%(email)s</a>."

msgid ""
"2. If your wallet changed it, or changed how it works, the register needs a "
"Lightning address that tells it when a payment arrives: change it from your "
"shop's page in your panel, or write to {email} and we help you."
msgstr ""
"2. Če ga je denarnica spremenila ali spremenila način delovanja, blagajna "
"potrebuje Lightning naslov, ki ji sporoči, kdaj prispe plačilo: spremenite "
"ga na strani trgovine na nadzorni plošči ali pišite na {email} in vam "
"pomagamo."

msgid ""
"3. If it is different, or your wallet no longer has one, change it from your "
"shop's page in your panel: the shop and its sign stay the same. If you need "
"help, write to {email}."
msgstr ""
"3. Če je drugačen ali ga denarnica nima več, ga spremenite na strani "
"trgovine na nadzorni plošči: trgovina in njena tabla ostaneta enaki. Če "
"potrebujete pomoč, pišite na {email}."

msgid ""
"Call the merchant: the panel already shows them what to do. If the wallet "
"changed, only they can change the address, from their panel. Never change it "
"for them."
msgstr ""
"Pokličite trgovca: nadzorna plošča mu že pove, kaj storiti. Če se je "
"denarnica spremenila, lahko naslov spremeni samo on, na svoji nadzorni "
"plošči. Nikoli ga ne spreminjajte namesto njega."

msgid "The Lightning address of a suspended shop cannot be changed."
msgstr "Lightning naslova začasno umaknjene trgovine ni mogoče spremeniti."

msgid "This is already your shop's Lightning address."
msgstr "To je že Lightning naslov vaše trgovine."

msgid ""
"Done: payments now go to {address}. Open each register again and confirm the "
"new address."
msgstr ""
"Opravljeno: plačila zdaj gredo na {address}. Znova odprite vsako blagajno in "
"potrdite nov naslov."

msgid "Your shop changed while you were saving: look at it again."
msgstr "Vaša trgovina se je spremenila med shranjevanjem: poglejte jo znova."

msgid "Lightning address changed by the owner"
msgstr "Lightning naslov je spremenil lastnik"

msgid "previous Lightning address"
msgstr "prejšnji Lightning naslov"

msgid "The same wait follows a change of your account's recovery email."
msgstr ""
"Enako čakanje velja po spremembi e-poštnega naslova za obnovitev dostopa do "
"vašega profila."

msgid "Historic shop: no register."
msgstr "Zgodovinska trgovina: brez blagajne."

msgid "Suspended: no register can be added."
msgstr "Začasno ustavljena: blagajne ni mogoče dodati."

msgid "answered by your own explorer"
msgstr "odgovoril vaš raziskovalec blokov"

msgid "answered by {host}: your own explorer did not answer"
msgstr "odgovoril {host}: vaš raziskovalec blokov se ne odziva"

msgid "answered by {host}"
msgstr "odgovoril {host}"

msgid "Saved. Reload the register for the new explorer to be used."
msgstr ""
"Shranjeno. Znova naložite blagajno, da bo uporabila novi raziskovalec blokov."

msgid ""
"Your own explorer must be an https address (https://host/api): no password "
"in it, no query."
msgstr ""
"Vaš raziskovalec blokov mora biti naslov https (https://host/api), brez "
"gesla in brez poizvedbe."

msgid "The site could not save your own explorer: try again."
msgstr ""
"Spletno mesto ni moglo shraniti vašega raziskovalca blokov: poskusite znova."

msgid "Your own explorer (optional)"
msgstr "Vaš raziskovalec blokov (neobvezno)"

msgid ""
"The https address of the API of an Esplora or mempool explorer on your own "
"node, for example the mempool app. The registers (yours and the staff's) ask "
"it first to check on-chain payments, and the community's explorers only when "
"it does not answer. It must allow this site's address in its CORS settings "
"and have a valid https certificate; the Bitcoin Core RPC alone cannot be "
"used."
msgstr ""
"Naslov https API-ja raziskovalca blokov Esplora ali mempool na vašem "
"vozlišču, na primer aplikacije mempool. Blagajne (vaša in blagajne "
"zaposlenih) ga vprašajo najprej, ko preverjajo on-chain plačila, "
"raziskovalce skupnosti pa samo, če se ne odzove. V nastavitvah CORS mora "
"dovoliti naslov tega spletnega mesta in imeti veljavno potrdilo https; "
"samega RPC Bitcoin Core ni mogoče uporabiti."

msgid ""
"{count} copies of staff registers cannot be read on this phone (it no longer "
"holds their keys): give your Nostr private key below to read them."
msgstr ""
"Kopij blagajn zaposlenih na tem telefonu ni mogoče prebrati (nima več "
"njihovih ključev): {count}. Spodaj vnesite svoj zasebni ključ Nostr, da jih "
"preberete."

msgid ""
"Of these, {count} reported by a staff register and checked by this register "
"with the payment provider: no need to look in the wallet."
msgstr ""
"Od tega jih je {count} prijavila blagajna zaposlenega in jih je ta blagajna "
"preverila pri ponudniku plačila: v denarnico ni treba gledati."

msgid "checked with the provider"
msgstr "preverjeno pri ponudniku"

msgid "shops on the site (the demo shops do not count)"
msgstr "trgovine na spletnem mestu (preizkusne ne štejejo)"

msgid "shops saved without a wallet yet (sign-ups not finished)"
msgstr "trgovine, shranjene še brez denarnice (nedokončane prijave)"

msgid "accounts of merchants and visitors who signed in (staff left out)"
msgstr "profili trgovcev in obiskovalcev, ki so se prijavili (brez ekipe)"

msgid ""
"requests for help kept, solved ones too (delete the old ones in /admin/)"
msgstr "shranjene prošnje za pomoč, tudi rešene (stare izbrišite v /admin/)"

msgid "meetups copied from Nostr and kept"
msgstr "srečanja, kopirana z Nostra in shranjena"

msgid "staff registers turned on at the same time in one shop"
msgstr "hkrati vklopljene blagajne zaposlenih v eni trgovini"

msgid "new accounts from one network address in an hour"
msgstr "novi profili z enega omrežnega naslova v eni uri"

msgid "new shops or wallets connected from one network address in an hour"
msgstr ""
"nove trgovine ali povezane denarnice z enega omrežnega naslova v eni uri"

msgid "requests for help from one shop in a day"
msgstr "prošnje za pomoč ene trgovine v enem dnevu"

msgid "This site cannot take more of this for now: the community has been told. Please try again later."
msgstr "Spletno mesto zaenkrat ne more sprejeti več tega: skupnost je obveščena. Poskusite znova pozneje."

msgid "The community cannot take more requests here right now. Please write to {email}."
msgstr "Skupnost trenutno od tod ne more sprejeti več prošenj. Pišite na {email}."

msgid ""
"%(what)s: %(used)d of %(limit)d. The limit is reached: the site refuses new "
"ones, and keeps all it has."
msgstr ""
"%(what)s: %(used)d od %(limit)d. Meja je dosežena: spletno mesto zavrača "
"nove in hrani vse, kar ima."

msgid "%(what)s: %(used)d of %(limit)d, close to the limit."
msgstr "%(what)s: %(used)d od %(limit)d, blizu meje."

msgid ""
"Clear what nobody needs any more in the administration, or raise the limit: "
"`limits.%(key)s` in community.yml, then restart the site. Spam and a site "
"that grows are the two reasons for a full limit: look before raising it."
msgstr ""
"V administraciji izbrišite, česar nihče več ne potrebuje, ali zvišajte mejo: "
"`limits.%(key)s` v community.yml, nato znova zaženite spletno mesto. "
"Neželena pošta in spletno mesto, ki raste, sta dva razloga za polno mejo: "
"pred zvišanjem poglejte."

msgid "Limits"
msgstr "Meje"

msgid ""
"What the site keeps, against its limit. At the limit it refuses what would "
"add one more and deletes nothing. The limits are the ones in community.yml "
"(limits), or the defaults."
msgstr ""
"Kaj spletno mesto hrani, v primerjavi z mejo. Ob meji zavrne, kar bi dodalo "
"še eno, in ne izbriše ničesar. Meje so tiste iz community.yml (limits) ali "
"privzete vrednosti."

msgid "no limit"
msgstr "brez meje"

msgid "default"
msgstr "privzeto"

msgid "set in community.yml"
msgstr "nastavljeno v community.yml"

msgid "Quick start: {left} of {limit} left before the training."
msgstr "Hiter začetek: ostane {left} od {limit} pred usposabljanjem."

msgid ""
"This sale is {amount} and only {left} of the quick start is left. Type less, "
"or finish the training to take any amount."
msgstr ""
"Ta prodaja znaša {amount}, od hitrega začetka pa ostane le {left}. Vpišite "
"manj ali končajte usposabljanje, da boste lahko sprejeli kateri koli znesek."

msgid "Quick start used up. Finish the training to keep taking payments."
msgstr ""
"Hiter začetek je porabljen. Končajte usposabljanje, da boste še naprej "
"sprejemali plačila."

msgid ""
"The quick start counts in {currency}: set that currency in the settings."
msgstr ""
"Hiter začetek se šteje v {currency}: v nastavitvah nastavite to valuto."

msgid "Start the training"
msgstr "Začnite usposabljanje"

msgid "Open register (quick start)"
msgstr "Odprite blagajno (hiter začetek)"

msgid "Quick start."
msgstr "Hiter začetek."

msgid ""
"The register of «%(names)s» already takes your first payments, up to a small "
"amount in total. The rest opens as soon as you have the basic pass: it takes "
"a few minutes. The staff registers wait for it."
msgstr ""
"Blagajna trgovine »%(names)s« že sprejema vaša prva plačila, do majhnega "
"skupnega zneska. Ostalo se odpre takoj, ko imate osnovno prepustnico: vzame "
"le nekaj minut. Blagajne zaposlenih čakajo nanjo."

msgid ""
"emails sent this month (the mail provider's quota; see config/mailbudget.py)"
msgstr ""
"e-poštna sporočila, poslana ta mesec (kvota ponudnika pošte; glejte config/"
"mailbudget.py)"

msgid "emails sent today (by default a tenth of the month's limit)"
msgstr "e-poštna sporočila, poslana danes (privzeto desetina mesečne meje)"

msgid "emails a visitor can make the site send to the same address in a day"
msgstr ""
"e-poštna sporočila, ki jih lahko obiskovalec v enem dnevu sproži na isti "
"naslov"

msgid ""
"times more emails (per address and per network address) for the staff and "
"the allowed addresses, who may be testing"
msgstr ""
"večkratnik e-poštnih sporočil (na naslov in na omrežni naslov) za ekipo in "
"dovoljene naslove, ki morda preizkušajo"

msgid ""
"This site cannot send more emails for now. Please try again later. If you "
"made your account with a Lightning wallet, you can sign in with it."
msgstr ""
"Spletno mesto zaenkrat ne more poslati več e-poštnih sporočil. Poskusite "
"znova pozneje. Če ste profil ustvarili z Lightning denarnico, se lahko "
"prijavite z njo."

msgid "Too many emails asked from your connection today: try again tomorrow."
msgstr ""
"Z vaše povezave je bilo danes zahtevanih preveč e-poštnih sporočil: "
"poskusite znova jutri."

msgid ""
"emails one network address can make the site send in a day (three times as "
"many for its wider network)"
msgstr ""
"e-poštna sporočila, ki jih lahko en omrežni naslov v enem dnevu sproži "
"(trikrat toliko za njegovo širše omrežje)"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(what)s: %(used)d of %(limit)d. The limit is reached: only the security "
"notices still go out, up to the total."
msgstr ""
"%(what)s: %(used)d od %(limit)d. Meja je dosežena: odhajajo samo še "
"varnostna obvestila, do skupnega števila."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"Look in the web log for who asks for so many links (limits.emails_per_month, "
"limits.emails_per_day): many addresses at once is an attack, and the quota "
"of the mail provider is what it uses up. Raise the limit only if the "
"provider allows more."
msgstr ""
"V spletnem dnevniku poglejte, kdo zahteva toliko povezav "
"(limits.emails_per_month, limits.emails_per_day): veliko naslovov hkrati je "
"napad in porablja kvoto ponudnika pošte. Mejo zvišajte samo, če ponudnik "
"dovoli več."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"A shop with many notices may be in trouble (its Lightning address, a change "
"of address): look at its page in the administration. Many sign-in links to "
"one address are someone using the site against it."
msgstr ""
"Trgovina z veliko obvestili ima morda težave (njen Lightning naslov, "
"sprememba naslova): poglejte njeno stran v administraciji. Veliko povezav za "
"prijavo na en naslov pomeni, da nekdo spletno mesto uporablja proti tej "
"osebi."

#, python-format
msgid "%(count)d address received more than %(cap)d emails today."
msgid_plural "%(count)d addresses received more than %(cap)d emails today."
msgstr[0] ""
"%(count)d naslov je danes prejel več kot %(cap)d e-poštnih sporočil."
msgstr[1] ""
"%(count)d naslova sta danes prejela več kot %(cap)d e-poštnih sporočil."
msgstr[2] ""
"%(count)d naslovi so danes prejeli več kot %(cap)d e-poštnih sporočil."
msgstr[3] ""
"%(count)d naslovov je danes prejelo več kot %(cap)d e-poštnih sporočil."

msgid ""
"The owner turned off this register: it takes no more payments. Ask the owner "
"for a new register."
msgstr ""
"Lastnik je izklopil to blagajno: ne sprejema več plačil. Lastnika prosite za "
"novo blagajno."

msgid "0: always wait."
msgstr "0: vedno čakajte."

msgid "0: no discount."
msgstr "0: brez popusta."

msgid "Bitcoin discount −{percent}%: {amount} to pay."
msgstr "Bitcoin popust −{percent} %: za plačilo {amount}."

#, python-format
msgid "Discount for paying in bitcoin (%%)"
msgstr "Popust za plačilo z bitcoinom (%%)"

msgid "Empty: Lightning only."
msgstr "Prazno: samo Lightning."

msgid "Empty: found by itself. Only to correct it."
msgstr "Prazno: najde ga sama. Samo za popravek."

msgid "Empty: no copy on Nostr."
msgstr "Prazno: brez kopije na Nostru."

msgid ""
"First receive address of this key: {address}. Check that your wallet shows "
"the same one, then tick the box and save."
msgstr ""
"Prvi naslov za prejemanje tega ključa: {address}. Preverite, ali vaša "
"denarnica kaže istega, nato označite polje in shranite."

msgid "History and day closing"
msgstr "Zgodovina in dnevni zaključek"

msgid "History and end of shift"
msgstr "Zgodovina in konec izmene"

msgid "How on-chain works"
msgstr "Kako deluje on-chain"

msgid "It is the shop's address on the site: you change it there."
msgstr "To je naslov trgovine na spletnem mestu: spremeni se tam."

msgid "Let the registers remove the discount on a sale"
msgstr "Blagajnam dovolite, da odstranijo popust pri prodaji"

msgid "Look"
msgstr "Videz"

msgid "Looking for the first unused address of your wallet…"
msgstr "Iščem prvi neuporabljeni naslov vaše denarnice …"

msgid "On-chain (optional)"
msgstr "On-chain (neobvezno)"

msgid "On-chain addresses"
msgstr "On-chain naslovi"

msgid "Prices"
msgstr "Cene"

msgid ""
"Sales started and never paid use addresses too: after 20 unpaid in a row, "
"raise the wallet's gap limit. Use this register on one phone only: another "
"phone takes a staff register."
msgstr ""
"Tudi začete in nikoli plačane prodaje porabijo naslove: po 20 zaporednih "
"neplačanih povečajte gap limit denarnice. To blagajno uporabljajte samo na "
"enem telefonu: drug telefon dobi blagajno zaposlenega."

msgid "Sales stay only on this phone: download a copy now and then."
msgstr "Prodaje ostanejo samo na tem telefonu: občasno prenesite kopijo."

msgid "Saved on this phone. Staff registers get them with their pairing code."
msgstr ""
"Ostanejo na tem telefonu. Blagajne zaposlenih jih dobijo s kodo za "
"seznanitev."

msgid "Settings"
msgstr "Nastavitve"

msgid "Start at address number"
msgstr "Začnite pri naslovu številka"

msgid ""
"The explorer did not answer: the register looks for the first unused address "
"at the first on-chain sale."
msgstr ""
"Raziskovalec blokov se ni odzval: blagajna prvi neuporabljeni naslov poišče "
"ob prvi on-chain prodaji."

msgid "Three letters, for example EUR."
msgstr "Tri črke, na primer EUR."

msgid "Wait for a block above this amount"
msgstr "Nad tem zneskom počakajte na blok"

msgid "What it is"
msgstr "Kaj je to"

msgid "When to change it"
msgstr "Kdaj ga spremeniti"

msgid "When to set it"
msgstr "Kdaj ga nastaviti"

msgid ""
"When you save a new key, the register asks the explorer once for the first "
"unused address of your wallet, keeps it on this phone and goes on from "
"there, one address per sale."
msgstr ""
"Ko shranite nov ključ, blagajna raziskovalca blokov enkrat vpraša za prvi "
"neuporabljeni naslov vaše denarnice, ga shrani na tem telefonu in nadaljuje "
"od tam, en naslov na prodajo."

msgid "Write the discount as a whole number from 0 to 100."
msgstr "Popust zapišite kot celo število od 0 do 100."

msgid "Your Nostr public key (npub)"
msgstr "Vaš javni ključ Nostr (npub)"

msgid ""
"Your wallet has used many addresses: the register would start at number "
"{index}."
msgstr ""
"Vaša denarnica je uporabila veliko naslovov: blagajna bi začela pri številki "
"{index}."

msgid "Your wallet's public key (zpub, xpub…) or a fixed address"
msgstr "Javni ključ vaše denarnice (zpub, xpub …) ali stalni naslov"

#, python-format
msgid "Towards the basic pass: %(value)s of %(total)s modules done"
msgstr ""
"Na poti do osnovne prepustnice: opravljenih modulov %(value)s od %(total)s"

#, python-format
msgid "Towards the next badge: %(value)s of %(total)s steps done"
msgstr ""
"Na poti do naslednje značke: opravljenih korakov %(value)s od %(total)s"

#, python-format
msgid "Basic pass since %(date)s."
msgstr "Osnovna prepustnica od %(date)s."

msgid "No basic pass yet."
msgstr "Osnovne prepustnice še ni."

#, python-format
msgid "You have the basic pass since %(date)s."
msgstr "Osnovno prepustnico imate od %(date)s."

msgid "The modules stay open: read them again whenever you like."
msgstr "Moduli ostanejo odprti: preberite jih znova, kadar želite."

msgid "To read again"
msgstr "Za ponovno branje"

msgid "To confirm"
msgstr "Za potrditev"

msgid "To finish"
msgstr "Za dokončanje"

#, python-format
msgid "Setting up the shop: %(done)s of %(total)s done"
msgstr "Priprava trgovine: opravljeno %(done)s od %(total)s"

msgid "Setting up the shop: all done. Well done!"
msgstr "Priprava trgovine: vse opravljeno. Odlično!"

msgid "To print"
msgstr "Za tiskanje"

msgid "Your page"
msgstr "Vaša stran"

msgid "Leave the panel (the register stays open)"
msgstr "Zapustite nadzorno ploščo (blagajna ostane odprta)"

msgid ""
"Handing over your own phone? Open the register and press «Leave the panel "
"(the register stays open)»."
msgstr ""
"Svoj telefon dajete drugemu? Odprite blagajno in pritisnite »Zapustite "
"nadzorno ploščo (blagajna ostane odprta)«."

#, python-format
msgid "Exercise %(number)s of %(total)s: %(title)s"
msgstr "Vaja %(number)s od %(total)s: %(title)s"

msgid "All exercises done: read «Now the real thing» below."
msgstr "Vse vaje opravljene: spodaj preberite »Zdaj zares«."

msgid "Exercises below"
msgstr "Vaje so spodaj"

#, python-format
msgid "One detail is not written yet."
msgid_plural "%(counter)s details are not written yet."
msgstr[0] "%(counter)s podatek še ni vpisan."
msgstr[1] "%(counter)s podatka še nista vpisana."
msgstr[2] "%(counter)s podatki še niso vpisani."
msgstr[3] "%(counter)s podatkov še ni vpisanih."

msgid "Add them"
msgstr "Dodajte jih"

msgid "not written yet"
msgstr "še ni vpisano"

msgid ""
"The rest you can add whenever you want: you need none of it to create the "
"shop."
msgstr "Ostalo dodate, kadar želite: za ustvarjanje trgovine ni potrebno."

msgid "Source code (AGPLv3)"
msgstr "Izvorna koda (AGPLv3)"

msgid "Training"
msgstr "Usposabljanje"

msgid ""
"This part of the register did not load: check the connection and try again."
msgstr "Ta del blagajne se ni naložil: preverite povezavo in poskusite znova."

msgid "Sound when a payment arrives"
msgstr "Zvok, ko prispe plačilo"

msgid "Your register keeps working."
msgstr "Vaša blagajna deluje naprej."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"The last day is %(date)s. After that the register opens only with the basic "
"pass."
msgstr ""
"Zadnji dan je %(date)s. Potem se blagajna odpre samo z osnovno prepustnico."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"You have %(days)s more day, until %(date)s, to get the basic pass. After "
"that the register opens only with it."
msgid_plural ""
"You have %(days)s more days, until %(date)s, to get the basic pass. After "
"that the register opens only with it."
msgstr[0] ""
"Imate še %(days)s dan, do %(date)s, da pridobite osnovno prepustnico. Potem "
"se blagajna odpre samo z njo."
msgstr[1] ""
"Imate še %(days)s dneva, do %(date)s, da pridobite osnovno prepustnico. "
"Potem se blagajna odpre samo z njo."
msgstr[2] ""
"Imate še %(days)s dni, do %(date)s, da pridobite osnovno prepustnico. Potem "
"se blagajna odpre samo z njo."
msgstr[3] ""
"Imate še %(days)s dni, do %(date)s, da pridobite osnovno prepustnico. Potem "
"se blagajna odpre samo z njo."

# Team access (team/, docs/features/team-access.md)
msgid "Team access"
msgstr "Dostop ekipe"

msgid "team"
msgstr "ekipa"

msgid "staff"
msgstr "ekipa"

msgid "moderator"
msgstr "moderator"

msgid "linking key"
msgstr "ključ denarnice"

msgid "role"
msgstr "vloga"

msgid "created"
msgstr "ustvarjeno"

msgid "last sign-in"
msgstr "zadnja prijava"

msgid "revoked"
msgstr "preklican"

msgid "team key"
msgstr "ključ ekipe"

msgid "team keys"
msgstr "ključi ekipe"

msgid "expires"
msgstr "poteče"

msgid "used"
msgstr "uporabljeno"

msgid "team invite"
msgstr "povabilo ekipe"

msgid "team invites"
msgstr "povabila ekipe"

msgid "active"
msgstr "dejaven"

msgid "open"
msgstr "odprto"

msgid "expired"
msgstr "poteklo"

msgid "Revoke the selected keys: their passes stop at once"
msgstr "Prekličite izbrane ključe: njihove vstopnice takoj prenehajo veljati"

msgid "End the passes of the selected keys: every browser signs in again"
msgstr ""
"Končajte vstopnice izbranih ključev: vsak brskalnik se mora znova prijaviti"

#, python-format
msgid "%(count)d key revoked."
msgid_plural "%(count)d keys revoked."
msgstr[0] "%(count)d ključ preklican."
msgstr[1] "%(count)d ključa preklicana."
msgstr[2] "%(count)d ključi preklicani."
msgstr[3] "%(count)d ključev preklicanih."

#, python-format
msgid "The passes of %(count)d key ended."
msgid_plural "The passes of %(count)d keys ended."
msgstr[0] "Končane vstopnice %(count)d ključa."
msgstr[1] "Končane vstopnice %(count)d ključev."
msgstr[2] "Končane vstopnice %(count)d ključev."
msgstr[3] "Končane vstopnice %(count)d ključev."

#, python-format
msgid "The invite for %(name)s (%(role)s)"
msgstr "Povabilo za %(name)s (%(role)s)"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"Send this link, or the code, to that person by a channel you trust. Whoever "
"opens it first and signs with a Lightning wallet becomes a team key: it "
"works once, and until %(expires)s."
msgstr ""
"To povezavo ali kodo pošljite tej osebi po kanalu, ki mu zaupate. Kdor jo "
"odpre prvi in podpiše z Lightning denarnico, postane ključ ekipe: velja samo "
"enkrat in do %(expires)s."

msgid "The link of the invite"
msgstr "Povezava povabila"

msgid "The link of the invite as a QR code"
msgstr "Povezava povabila kot QR koda"

msgid ""
"It is shown only now: the site keeps a hash of it, not the link. If it gets "
"lost, delete the invite and make another."
msgstr ""
"Prikazana je samo zdaj: spletno mesto hrani njen prstni odtis (hash), ne "
"povezave. Če se izgubi, izbrišite povabilo in naredite novo."

msgid "Back to the invites"
msgstr "Nazaj na povabila"

#, python-format
msgid "Join the team of %(site)s"
msgstr "Pridružite se ekipi %(site)s"

#, python-format
msgid "This invitation is for %(name)s (%(role)s)."
msgstr "To povabilo je za %(name)s (%(role)s)."

msgid ""
"Scan the code with your Lightning wallet, or tap it if the wallet is on this "
"phone. The wallet makes a key for this site only: from then on, that wallet "
"opens the site under construction for you, from any connection."
msgstr ""
"Kodo skenirajte z Lightning denarnico ali jo tapnite, če je denarnica na tem "
"telefonu. Denarnica ustvari ključ samo za to spletno mesto: od takrat vam ta "
"denarnica odpre spletno mesto v gradnji, s katere koli povezave."

msgid "Code to join the team with the wallet"
msgstr "Koda za pridružitev ekipi z denarnico"

msgid "The invitation works once: use the wallet you will keep."
msgstr "Povabilo velja samo enkrat: uporabite denarnico, ki jo boste obdržali."

msgid "Waiting for your wallet…"
msgstr "Čakam na vašo denarnico …"

msgid "This page needs JavaScript to notice your wallet's signature."
msgstr "Ta stran potrebuje JavaScript, da opazi podpis vaše denarnice."

msgid "Done: this browser now sees the site. Opening it…"
msgstr "Opravljeno: ta brskalnik zdaj vidi spletno mesto. Odpiram ga …"

msgid ""
"This wallet was not accepted: the invitation was used by another one, or "
"this wallet already has a key here. Ask whoever invited you."
msgstr ""
"Ta denarnica ni bila sprejeta: povabilo je uporabila druga ali pa ima ta "
"denarnica tukaj že ključ. Vprašajte tistega, ki vas je povabil."

msgid "The code expired."
msgstr "Koda je potekla."

msgid "Get a new one"
msgstr "Pridobite novo"

msgid ""
"From now on, never scan a sign-in code somebody else sends you, whatever "
"they say: your wallet would open the site for them."
msgstr ""
"Od zdaj naprej nikoli ne skenirajte kode za prijavo, ki vam jo pošlje kdo "
"drug, ne glede na to, kaj pravi: vaša denarnica bi spletno mesto odprla "
"njemu."

msgid "Too many requests from your connection: try again in a few minutes."
msgstr "Preveč zahtev z vaše povezave: poskusite znova čez nekaj minut."

msgid ""
"This invitation is not valid: it was used already, or it expired. Ask for a "
"new one."
msgstr ""
"To povabilo ni veljavno: bilo je že uporabljeno ali pa je poteklo. Prosite "
"za novo."

msgid "Invalid sign-in"
msgstr "Neveljavna prijava"

msgid "This invite is not valid any more."
msgstr "To povabilo ni več veljavno."

msgid ""
"This wallet already has a team key here, or had one: ask whoever invited you."
msgstr ""
"Ta denarnica tukaj že ima ključ ekipe ali ga je imela: vprašajte tistega, ki "
"vas je povabil."

msgid "This wallet is not in the team of this site."
msgstr "Ta denarnica ni v ekipi tega spletnega mesta."

msgid ""
"{name} joined the team ({role}): from now on their wallet opens the site "
"under construction. The team's keys:"
msgstr ""
"{name} je v ekipi ({role}): od zdaj naprej njegova denarnica odpira spletno "
"mesto v gradnji. Ključi ekipe:"

msgid ""
"{name} ({role}) opened the site under construction in a new browser. If it "
"was not them, revoke the key or end its passes:"
msgstr ""
"{name} ({role}) je odprl spletno mesto v gradnji v novem brskalniku. Če to "
"ni bila ta oseba, prekličite ključ ali končajte njegove vstopnice:"

msgid "Revoked: the wallet signs in no more, its passes stopped."
msgstr ""
"Preklican: denarnica se ne prijavi več, njene vstopnice ne veljajo več."

msgid "Passes ended: every browser signs in again."
msgstr "Vstopnice končane: vsak brskalnik se mora znova prijaviti."

msgid ""
"Tap the wallet's name above: it opens its official page or the right app in "
"the store. Install it from there, as you do with any app. Do not search for "
"the name in the store: other apps have similar names."
msgstr ""
"Tapnite ime denarnice zgoraj: odpre njeno uradno stran ali pravo aplikacijo "
"v trgovini z aplikacijami. Od tam jo namestite, kot vsako aplikacijo. Imena "
"ne iščite v trgovini z aplikacijami: druge aplikacije imajo podobna imena."

msgid ""
"Open the app and create a new wallet. Depending on the wallet, it shows you "
"some recovery words (12 or 24) or it saves a passkey in your phone's "
"password manager. Write the words on paper, in order, and keep the paper "
"somewhere safe: with a passkey, look for the recovery words in the wallet's "
"settings (often under Backup) and write them down too. With them you get "
"your money back if you lose the phone."
msgstr ""
"Odprite aplikacijo in ustvarite novo denarnico. Odvisno od denarnice vam "
"pokaže obnovitvene besede (12 ali 24) ali pa shrani ključ za dostop "
"(passkey) v upravitelja gesel telefona. Besede zapišite na papir, po vrsti, "
"in papir hranite na varnem: pri ključu za dostop poiščite obnovitvene besede "
"v nastavitvah denarnice (pogosto pod »Backup«) in zapišite tudi te. Z "
"besedami dobite denar nazaj, če izgubite telefon."

msgid ""
"On an iPhone, if the page opened inside Gmail or another app, first open it "
"in Safari (the share button, then «Open in Safari»), then add it to the home "
"screen from there."
msgstr ""
"Na iPhonu, če se je stran odprla v Gmailu ali drugi aplikaciji, jo najprej "
"odprite v Safariju (gumb Deli, nato »Odpri v Safariju«) in jo od tam dodajte "
"na domači zaslon."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"You are taking %(name)s: sign in with any email of yours, or with your "
"wallet. Then you confirm that it is your shop."
msgstr ""
"Prevzemate %(name)s: prijavite se s katerim koli svojim e-poštnim naslovom "
"ali z denarnico. Nato potrdite, da je to vaša trgovina."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"You are taking %(name)s. Write your email: we send you a second email, with "
"the link to sign in. It lasts 15 minutes; then you confirm that it is your "
"shop."
msgstr ""
"Prevzemate %(name)s. Vpišite svoj e-poštni naslov: poslali vam bomo drugo "
"sporočilo s povezavo za prijavo. Velja 15 minut; nato potrdite, da je to "
"vaša trgovina."

msgid ""
"This looks like an email, not a Lightning address. You need the wallet's "
"Lightning address: open the wallet and look under Receive."
msgstr ""
"To je videti kot e-poštni naslov, ne kot Lightning naslov. Potrebujete "
"Lightning naslov denarnice: odprite denarnico in poglejte pod »Prejmi«."

msgid ""
"Tap the button below: it opens the wallet's official page or the right app "
"in the store. Install it from there, as you do with any app. Do not search "
"for the name in the store: other apps have similar names."
msgstr ""
"Tapnite gumb spodaj: odpre uradno stran denarnice ali pravo aplikacijo v "
"trgovini z aplikacijami. Od tam jo namestite, kot vsako aplikacijo. Imena ne "
"iščite v trgovini z aplikacijami: druge aplikacije imajo podobna imena."

msgid ""
"Open the app and create a new wallet. It shows you some recovery words, 12 "
"or 24; if it saves a passkey instead, find the words in the wallet's "
"settings (often under Backup)."
msgstr ""
"Odprite aplikacijo in ustvarite novo denarnico. Pokaže vam obnovitvene "
"besede, 12 ali 24; če namesto tega shrani ključ za dostop (passkey), besede "
"najdete v nastavitvah denarnice (pogosto pod »Backup«)."

msgid "part of the series"
msgstr "del serije"

msgid ""
"The community's regular meetups. Untick for a one-off event: the board then "
"shows its own title, and links only its own page, not the community's group."
msgstr ""
"Redna srečanja skupnosti. Odstranite kljukico za samostojen dogodek: oglasna "
"deska tedaj pokaže njegov naslov in poveže samo njegovo stran, ne skupine "
"skupnosti."

msgid "awaiting approval"
msgstr "čaka na odobritev"

msgid ""
"A new shop written by its owner: off maps and lists until someone approves "
"it. The register works."
msgstr ""
"Nova trgovina, ki jo je vpisal lastnik: ni na zemljevidih in seznamih, "
"dokler je kdo ne odobri. Blagajna deluje."

#, python-format
msgid "A new shop waits for your approval: %(name)s"
msgstr "Nova trgovina čaka na vašo odobritev: %(name)s"

msgid "New shop"
msgstr "Nova trgovina"

msgid "Approve the new shops: on the map and the lists"
msgstr "Odobrite nove trgovine: na zemljevid in na sezname"

#, python-format
msgid "Approved: %(count)d shops."
msgstr "Odobreno, število trgovin: %(count)d."

#, python-format
msgid "%(name)s is approved: it is on the map and the lists."
msgstr "%(name)s je odobrena: je na zemljevidu in na seznamih."

msgid ""
"The community looks at every new shop before it goes on the map: until then "
"the register works, and the shop is not on the map and the lists."
msgstr ""
"Skupnost pogleda vsako novo trgovino, preden pride na zemljevid: medtem "
"blagajna deluje, trgovine pa ni na zemljevidu ne na seznamih."

msgid ""
"Not on the map yet: the community looks at every new shop first. The "
"register already works."
msgstr ""
"Še ni na zemljevidu: skupnost najprej pogleda vsako novo trgovino. Blagajna "
"že deluje."

msgid ""
"The community looks at every new shop before it goes on the map: it will be "
"there once approved."
msgstr ""
"Skupnost pogleda vsako novo trgovino, preden pride na zemljevid: tam bo "
"takoj, ko bo odobrena."

msgid "A new shop waits for your approval before it goes on the map."
msgstr "Nova trgovina čaka na vašo odobritev, preden pride na zemljevid."

msgid "Look at the shop and its owner; if all is well, approve it."
msgstr "Poglejte trgovino in lastnika; če je vse v redu, jo odobrite."

msgid "Approve: on the map and the lists"
msgstr "Odobrite: na zemljevid in na sezname"

msgid ""
"The community looks at every new shop before it goes on the map: yours is "
"waiting. The register already works."
msgstr ""
"Skupnost pogleda vsako novo trgovino, preden pride na zemljevid: vaša čaka. "
"Blagajna že deluje."

#, python-format
msgid "%(name)s was already approved."
msgstr "%(name)s je bila že odobrena."

msgid "approved"
msgstr "odobreno"

msgid "approved on"
msgstr "odobreno dne"

msgid "approved by"
msgstr "odobril"

msgid ""
"Empty: the shop waits for an approval, off maps and lists. The register "
"works all the same."
msgstr ""
"Prazno: trgovina čaka na odobritev, zunaj zemljevidov in seznamov. Blagajna "
"vseeno deluje."

msgid ""
"The block explorer does not answer. Try again in a minute; meanwhile you can "
"take this sale with Lightning."
msgstr ""
"Raziskovalec blokov se ne odziva. Poskusite znova čez minuto; medtem lahko "
"plačilo sprejmete prek Lightninga."

msgid ""
"The register reaches neither the site nor the explorer: check the phone's "
"network, then try again."
msgstr ""
"Blagajna ne doseže ne spletnega mesta ne raziskovalca blokov: preverite "
"omrežje telefona, nato poskusite znova."

msgid "Blossom: %(count)s different user in the last 30 days."
msgid_plural "Blossom: %(count)s different users in the last 30 days."
msgstr[0] "Blossom: %(count)s različen uporabnik v zadnjih 30 dneh."
msgstr[1] "Blossom: %(count)s različna uporabnika v zadnjih 30 dneh."
msgstr[2] "Blossom: %(count)s različni uporabniki v zadnjih 30 dneh."
msgstr[3] "Blossom: %(count)s različnih uporabnikov v zadnjih 30 dneh."

msgid "Round the discounted price down to a whole amount"
msgstr "Znižano ceno zaokrožite navzdol na okrogel znesek"

msgid ""
"For round prices: 12.60 becomes 12.00. Never rounded up, and never to more "
"than twice the discount."
msgstr ""
"Za okrogle cene: 12,60 postane 12,00. Nikoli navzgor in nikoli za več kot "
"dvakratnik popusta."

msgid ""
"This wallet is not connected to any shop. If you registered your shop with "
"an email, sign out, sign in with that email, then open «Your account» and "
"choose «Sign in with a wallet too»: from then on this wallet opens your shop."
msgstr ""
"Ta denarnica ni povezana z nobeno trgovino. Če ste trgovino registrirali z e-"
"poštnim naslovom, se odjavite, prijavite s tem naslovom, nato odprite »Vaš "
"profil« in izberite »Prijava tudi z denarnico«: od takrat ta denarnica "
"odpira vašo trgovino."

msgid "Sign in with a wallet too"
msgstr "Prijava tudi z denarnico"

#, python-format
msgid "%(wallets)s connected"
msgstr "Povezane denarnice: %(wallets)s"

msgid "To sign in to this account with your Lightning wallet too."
msgstr "Za prijavo v ta profil tudi z vašo Lightning denarnico."

msgid ""
"A Lightning wallet that supports login can sign in to this account, like "
"your email. Without this step the wallet would open a new, empty account."
msgstr ""
"Lightning denarnica, ki podpira prijavo, se lahko prijavi v ta profil, tako "
"kot vaš e-poštni naslov. Brez tega koraka bi denarnica odprla nov, prazen "
"profil."

msgid "Scan the code with the wallet, or tap it: this page updates by itself."
msgstr "Kodo skenirajte z denarnico ali jo tapnite: ta stran se posodobi sama."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"This account has %(limit)s wallets, the most it can have: disconnect one to "
"connect another."
msgstr ""
"Ta profil ima že največje dovoljeno število denarnic (%(limit)s): odklopite "
"eno, da povežete drugo."

msgid ""
"Too many codes from your connection in a short time: in a few minutes the "
"code is back."
msgstr ""
"Preveč kod z vaše povezave v kratkem času: čez nekaj minut bo koda spet na "
"voljo."

msgid "Wallets that sign in to this account"
msgstr "Denarnice, ki se prijavljajo v ta profil"

msgid "the wallet this account was opened with"
msgstr "denarnica, s katero je bil ta profil odprt"

msgid "Disconnect"
msgstr "Odklopite"

msgid ""
"After a wallet is connected, the Lightning address of your shops cannot be "
"changed for some days: a safeguard in case it was not you."
msgstr ""
"Ko povežete denarnico, Lightning naslova vaših trgovin nekaj dni ni mogoče "
"spremeniti: zaščita za primer, da to niste bili vi."

msgid "Code to connect the wallet"
msgstr "Koda za povezavo denarnice"

msgid "Wallet disconnected: it no longer signs in to this account."
msgstr "Denarnica odklopljena: v ta profil se ne prijavlja več."

msgid ""
"This wallet is the only way into this account: add a recovery email first."
msgstr ""
"Ta denarnica je edini dostop do tega profila: najprej dodajte e-poštni "
"naslov za obnovitev."

msgid "This wallet already signs in to this account."
msgstr "Ta denarnica se v ta profil že prijavlja."

msgid ""
"This wallet already has an account of its own with a shop or an email, or is "
"connected to another account: it cannot be connected here."
msgstr ""
"Ta denarnica že ima svoj profil s trgovino ali e-poštnim naslovom ali pa je "
"povezana z drugim profilom: tukaj je ni mogoče povezati."

msgid "Too many wallets on this account: disconnect one first."
msgstr "Preveč denarnic v tem profilu: najprej odklopite eno."

msgid "This wallet was connected to another account just now."
msgstr "Ta denarnica je bila pravkar povezana z drugim profilom."

msgid "Wallet connected: from now on it signs in to this account."
msgstr "Denarnica povezana: od zdaj naprej se prijavlja v ta profil."

msgid "A wallet was connected to your account"
msgstr "Z vašim profilom je bila povezana denarnica"

msgid "If it was not you, sign in and disconnect it:"
msgstr "Če to niste bili vi, se prijavite in jo odklopite:"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"Your wallet was connected to this account (%(who)s) on %(when)s. If you did "
"that, all is well. If you did not, this is somebody else's account: whatever "
"you write here would be theirs too."
msgstr ""
"Vaša denarnica je bila %(when)s povezana s tem profilom (%(who)s). Če ste to "
"storili vi, je vse v redu. Če niste, je to profil nekoga drugega: kar tukaj "
"napišete, bi bilo tudi njegovo."

msgid "It is my account"
msgstr "To je moj profil"

msgid "Not mine: disconnect my wallet and sign out"
msgstr "Ni moj: odklopite mojo denarnico in me odjavite"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"The wallet %(signed)s signed the code. Connect it only if your own wallet "
"just said that it worked: if it said that the sign-in failed, somebody else "
"scanned the code first."
msgstr ""
"Denarnica %(signed)s je podpisala kodo. Povežite jo samo, če je vaša "
"denarnica pravkar sporočila, da je uspelo: če je sporočila, da prijava ni "
"uspela, je kodo pred vami skeniral nekdo drug."

msgid "Connect this wallet"
msgstr "Povežite to denarnico"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"From now on the wallet %(key)s signs in to your account, like your email."
msgstr ""
"Od zdaj naprej se denarnica %(key)s prijavlja v vaš profil, tako kot vaš e-"
"poštni naslov."

msgid "A wallet was disconnected from your account"
msgstr "Z vašega profila je bila odklopljena denarnica"

#, python-format
msgid "The wallet %(key)s no longer signs in to your account."
msgstr "Denarnica %(key)s se ne prijavlja več v vaš profil."

msgid "If it was not you, sign in and check the wallets of your account:"
msgstr ""
"Če to niste bili vi, se prijavite in preverite denarnice svojega profila:"

msgid "This email is the only way into this account: it cannot be removed."
msgstr ""
"Ta e-poštni naslov je edini dostop do tega profila: ni ga mogoče odstraniti."

msgid "More than one place? Add the others"
msgstr "Več kot ena poslovalnica? Dodajte druge"

msgid "The other places of your shop"
msgstr "Druge poslovalnice vaše trgovine"

msgid ""
"A shop with several branches is one shop here: one register, one Lightning "
"address, and a point on the map for each place. The first place is the "
"shop's own position, which you change with its details."
msgstr ""
"Trgovina z več poslovalnicami je tukaj ena trgovina: ena blagajna, en "
"Lightning naslov in ena točka na zemljevidu za vsako poslovalnico. Prva "
"poslovalnica je lokacija trgovine, ki jo spremenite z njenimi podatki."

msgid "Remove"
msgstr "Odstranite"

msgid "No other place yet."
msgstr "Druge poslovalnice še ni."

msgid "This shop has the most places it can have: remove one to add another."
msgstr ""
"Ta trgovina ima največje število poslovalnic: odstranite eno, da dodate "
"drugo."

msgid "Add a place"
msgstr "Dodajte poslovalnico"

msgid "Where it is"
msgstr "Kje je"

msgid "I am there: use my position"
msgstr "Tam sem: uporabite mojo lokacijo"

msgid "Touch the place on the map."
msgstr "Tapnite mesto na zemljevidu."

msgid "Add this place"
msgstr "Dodajte to poslovalnico"

msgid "Also here"
msgstr "Tudi tukaj"

#, python-format
msgid "This shop has %(count)s other places, the most it can have."
msgstr "Ta trgovina ima največje število drugih poslovalnic: %(count)s."

msgid "Place added: it is a point of your shop on the map."
msgstr "Poslovalnica dodana: je točka vaše trgovine na zemljevidu."

msgid "Write the address or the town of this place."
msgstr "Vpišite naslov ali kraj te poslovalnice."

msgid "other place"
msgstr "druga poslovalnica"

msgid "other places"
msgstr "druge poslovalnice"

msgid ""
"This place's entry on OpenStreetMap, like node/123456. Empty: not linked."
msgstr ""
"Vpis te poslovalnice na OpenStreetMap, na primer node/123456. Prazno: ni "
"povezano."

msgid "This element is already the entry of a shop."
msgstr "Ta element je že vpis neke trgovine."

msgid "Type the amount on the keyboard."
msgstr "Znesek vpišite s tipkovnico."

msgid "Show the keys"
msgstr "Prikažite tipke"

msgid "Hide the keys"
msgstr "Skrijte tipke"

msgid "Today"
msgstr "Danes"

msgid "Your last sales"
msgstr "Vaše zadnje prodaje"

msgid "Version in use"
msgstr "Različica v uporabi"

msgid ""
"This link was already used: each one works once. Ask for a new one here "
"below."
msgstr ""
"Ta povezava je bila že uporabljena: vsaka deluje samo enkrat. Spodaj "
"zahtevajte novo."

msgid "The same, by register:"
msgstr "Enako, po blagajnah:"

msgid "Your own register"
msgstr "Vaša lastna blagajna"

msgid "Change"
msgstr "Spremenite"

msgid "Change a place"
msgstr "Spremenite poslovalnico"

msgid "Save this place"
msgstr "Shranite to poslovalnico"

msgid "Place saved."
msgstr "Poslovalnica shranjena."

msgid "Rename"
msgstr "Preimenujte"

msgid "Save the name"
msgstr "Shranite ime"

msgid ""
"The register's phone shows the new name the next time it opens with the "
"site: no new code is needed. The sales already made keep the old name."
msgstr ""
"Telefon blagajne pokaže novo ime, ko se blagajna naslednjič odpre s spletnim "
"mestom: nova koda ni potrebna. Že opravljene prodaje ohranijo staro ime."

msgid ""
"«{before}» is now «{name}». Its phone shows the new name the next time the "
"register opens with the site; the sales already made keep the old one."
msgstr ""
"»{before}« se zdaj imenuje »{name}«. Njen telefon pokaže novo ime, ko se "
"blagajna naslednjič odpre s spletnim mestom; že opravljene prodaje ohranijo "
"staro."

msgid "…and 1 more"
msgid_plural "…and %(counter)s more"
msgstr[0] "… in še %(counter)s"
msgstr[1] "… in še %(counter)s"
msgstr[2] "… in še %(counter)s"
msgstr[3] "… in še %(counter)s"

msgid "hours a staff register's one-time pairing code works (1 to 72)"
msgstr ""
"koliko ur velja enkratna koda za seznanitev blagajne zaposlenega (od 1 do 72)"

msgid "Where it is used"
msgstr "Kje se uporablja"

msgid "Only to find it in this list: it changes nothing in the register."
msgstr ""
"Samo zato, da jo najdete na tem seznamu: v blagajni ne spremeni ničesar."

msgid "No place chosen"
msgstr "Poslovalnica ni izbrana"

msgid "Rename or change the place"
msgstr "Preimenujte ali spremenite poslovalnico"

msgid "«{name}» is saved."
msgstr "»{name}« je shranjena."

msgid "Up to three chat numbers or @names, separated by commas."
msgstr "Največ tri številke klepetov ali @imena, ločene z vejicami."

msgid "The same chat is written twice."
msgstr "Isti klepet je vpisan dvakrat."

msgid "Another register of this shop has this name: choose a different one."
msgstr "Druga blagajna te trgovine že ima to ime: izberite drugo."

#, python-format
msgid "The same name as «%(other)s», a shop of another owner in the same area."
msgstr "Enako ime kot »%(other)s«, trgovina drugega lastnika na istem območju."

#, python-format
msgid "A name very like «%(other)s», a shop of another owner in the same area."
msgstr ""
"Zelo podobno ime kot »%(other)s«, trgovina drugega lastnika na istem območju."

#, python-format
msgid "The two are only %(metres)d m apart."
msgstr "Oddaljeni sta samo %(metres)d m."

#, python-format
msgid "The same contacts as «%(other)s», a shop of another owner: %(kinds)s."
msgstr ""
"Enaki kontakti kot pri »%(other)s«, trgovini drugega lastnika: %(kinds)s."

#, python-format
msgid "«%(other)s» is paid at another Lightning address, at another provider."
msgstr ""
"»%(other)s« prejema plačila na drug Lightning naslov, pri drugem ponudniku."

#, python-format
msgid "«%(other)s» is paid at another Lightning address."
msgstr "»%(other)s« prejema plačila na drug Lightning naslov."

msgid ""
"The owner's account was opened just before the shop, with no recovery email "
"and no other shop."
msgstr ""
"Profil lastnika je bil odprt tik pred trgovino, brez e-poštnega naslova za "
"obnovitev in brez drugih trgovin."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"A shop of another owner elsewhere has a name like this one: «%(other)s» (a "
"chain, perhaps)."
msgstr ""
"Trgovina drugega lastnika drugje ima podobno ime: »%(other)s« (morda veriga)."

msgid "Check before approving"
msgstr "Preverite pred odobritvijo"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"Not approved: %(count)d shops that look like a shop already on the site. "
"Approve them one by one from /admin/today/, after checking."
msgstr ""
"Ni odobreno: število trgovin, ki so videti kot trgovina, ki je že na "
"spletnem mestu: %(count)d. Odobrite jih eno za drugo na /admin/today/, ko "
"jih preverite."

msgid "See that shop"
msgstr "Oglejte si to trgovino"

msgid "Approve anyway"
msgstr "Vseeno odobrite"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"A shop of another owner %(km)s km away has a name like this one: «%(other)s»."
msgstr ""
"Trgovina drugega lastnika, oddaljena %(km)s km, ima podobno ime: »%(other)s«."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"A shop of another owner in the same town has a name like this one: "
"«%(other)s»."
msgstr "Trgovina drugega lastnika v istem kraju ima podobno ime: »%(other)s«."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"Ask the owner of «%(other)s» whether this new shop is theirs, or genuine."
msgstr ""
"Lastnika »%(other)s« vprašajte, ali je ta nova trgovina njegova ali pristna."

msgid "Check this shop"
msgstr "Preverite to trgovino"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(name)s, already on the map, was changed by its owner and now looks like a "
"shop already on the site."
msgstr ""
"%(name)s, ki je že na zemljevidu, je lastnik spremenil in je zdaj videti kot "
"trgovina, ki je že na spletnem mestu."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(name)s is not approved: it looks like a shop already on the site. Check "
"what its line says, then tick the box and approve it."
msgstr ""
"%(name)s ni odobrena: videti je kot trgovina, ki je že na spletnem mestu. "
"Preverite, kaj pravi njena vrstica, nato označite polje in jo odobrite."

msgid ""
"This new shop looks like a shop already on the site. Before approving it, "
"check what the lines below say."
msgstr ""
"Ta nova trgovina je videti kot trgovina, ki je že na spletnem mestu. Preden "
"jo odobrite, preverite, kaj pravijo spodnje vrstice."

msgid "Check first"
msgstr "Najprej preverite"

msgid "I checked what the lines above say: this new shop is genuine."
msgstr "Zgornje vrstice so preverjene: ta nova trgovina je pristna."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"«%(other)s» is on the site without an owner and waits for its claim link: if "
"it is the same business, send that link to this merchant instead of "
"approving a second shop."
msgstr ""
"»%(other)s« je na spletnem mestu brez lastnika in čaka na svojo povezavo za "
"prevzem: če gre za isto podjetje, pošljite to povezavo temu trgovcu, namesto "
"da odobrite drugo trgovino."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"«%(other)s» is on the site without an owner: if it is the same business, "
"give that shop to this owner in the administration instead of approving a "
"second one."
msgstr ""
"»%(other)s« je na spletnem mestu brez lastnika: če gre za isto podjetje, to "
"trgovino v administraciji dodelite temu lastniku, namesto da odobrite drugo."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"«%(other)s» closes on %(date)s: this new shop may be its successor, or a "
"move. Ask its owner."
msgstr ""
"»%(other)s« se zapre %(date)s: ta nova trgovina je morda njena naslednica "
"ali selitev. Vprašajte njenega lastnika."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"«%(other)s» closed on %(date)s: check whether this new shop is its reopening."
msgstr ""
"»%(other)s« se je zaprla %(date)s: preverite, ali je ta nova trgovina njeno "
"ponovno odprtje."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"Not approved: %(count)d shops, because the checks for copies of other shops "
"could not be run (whoever runs the site should look at the log). Approve "
"them one by one from /admin/today/, after looking at each yourself."
msgstr ""
"Ni odobrenih trgovin (število: %(count)d), ker preverjanj za kopije drugih "
"trgovin ni bilo mogoče izvesti (upravljavec spletnega mesta naj pogleda "
"dnevnik). Odobrite jih eno za drugo na /admin/today/, ko si vsako sami "
"ogledate."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(name)s is not approved: the checks for copies of other shops could not be "
"run. Look at the shop yourself, then tick the box and approve it."
msgstr ""
"%(name)s ni odobrena: preverjanj za kopije drugih trgovin ni bilo mogoče "
"izvesti. Sami si oglejte trgovino, nato označite polje in jo odobrite."

msgid "The checks could not be run"
msgstr "Preverjanj ni bilo mogoče izvesti"

msgid ""
"The site could not compare this new shop with the others to find copies: "
"whoever runs the site should look at the log. Look at the shop yourself "
"before approving it."
msgstr ""
"Spletno mesto te nove trgovine ni moglo primerjati z drugimi, da bi našlo "
"kopije: upravljavec spletnega mesta naj pogleda dnevnik. Preden jo odobrite, "
"si trgovino oglejte sami."

msgid "The checks could not be run: I looked at this shop myself."
msgstr "Preverjanj ni bilo mogoče izvesti: trgovina je bila pregledana osebno."

#, python-format
msgid "Closes on %(date)s"
msgstr "Zapre se %(date)s"

msgid "Until then nothing changes: it stays among the places to pay."
msgstr "Do takrat se nič ne spremeni: ostane med mesti, kjer lahko plačate."

msgid ""
"Your shop has a closing day ({note}): until then nothing changes and it "
"stays among the places to pay. From the day after it stays on the map as "
"history. The register and the sign still work."
msgstr ""
"Vaša trgovina ima dan zaprtja ({note}): do takrat se nič ne spremeni in "
"ostane med mesti, kjer lahko plačate. Od naslednjega dne ostane na "
"zemljevidu kot zgodovina. Blagajna in tabla še delujeta."

msgid ""
"On the map with its own pin, not among the places to pay. The register stays "
"yours and keeps working, for as long as you want."
msgstr ""
"Na zemljevidu s svojo oznako, ne med mesti, kjer lahko plačate. Blagajna "
"ostane vaša in deluje naprej, dokler želite."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"On the map with its own pin, not among the places to pay. Register and "
"payments keep working until %(until)s."
msgstr ""
"Na zemljevidu s svojo oznako, ne med kraji za plačilo. Blagajna in plačila "
"delujejo do %(until)s."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"On the map with its own pin, not among the places to pay. The register "
"stopped on %(until)s, a year after closing."
msgstr ""
"Na zemljevidu s svojo oznako, ne med kraji za plačilo. Blagajna se je "
"ustavila %(until)s, leto dni po zaprtju."

msgid "Log in"
msgstr "Prijava"

msgid "Second factor"
msgstr "Drugi faktor"

msgid "Code:"
msgstr "Koda:"

msgid "Confirm"
msgstr "Potrdite"

msgid "Start again"
msgstr "Začnite znova"

msgid "Turn it off"
msgstr "Izklopite ga"

msgid "Turn the second factor off"
msgstr "Izklopite drugi faktor"

msgid "Turn the second factor on"
msgstr "Vklopite drugi faktor"

msgid "Too many wrong codes. Wait a little and try again."
msgstr "Preveč napačnih kod. Malo počakajte in poskusite znova."

msgid ""
"That code is not right, or it was already used. Type the code the app shows "
"now. If it keeps failing, the clock of the phone may be wrong: set it to the "
"network's time."
msgstr ""
"Koda ni pravilna ali je bila že uporabljena. Vpišite kodo, ki jo aplikacija "
"kaže zdaj. Če še naprej ne deluje, je ura na telefonu morda napačna: "
"nastavite jo na čas omrežja."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"The password of %(name)s is right. Now type the code that your authenticator "
"app shows for this site."
msgstr ""
"Geslo za %(name)s je pravilno. Zdaj vpišite kodo, ki jo vaša aplikacija za "
"preverjanje pristnosti kaže za to spletno mesto."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"The second factor of your account is on since %(date)s: the sign-in asks for "
"the password and then for a code from your authenticator app."
msgstr ""
"Drugi faktor vašega profila je vklopljen od %(date)s: prijava zahteva geslo "
"in nato kodo iz vaše aplikacije za preverjanje pristnosti."

msgid ""
"Lost the phone? Whoever runs the machine removes it with manage.py "
"admin_totp reset and your name; then set it up again."
msgstr ""
"Ste izgubili telefon? Upravljavec strežnika ga odstrani z manage.py "
"admin_totp reset in vašim imenom; nato ga znova nastavite."

msgid ""
"This site asks every staff account for a second factor: set it up to go on."
msgstr ""
"To spletno mesto zahteva drugi faktor za vsak profil ekipe: nastavite ga, da "
"lahko nadaljujete."

msgid ""
"A second factor asks, after the password, for a code that changes every 30 "
"seconds, from an authenticator app on your phone (any app for TOTP codes). "
"Whoever learns the password cannot sign in without the phone."
msgstr ""
"Drugi faktor po geslu zahteva še kodo, ki se spremeni vsakih 30 sekund, iz "
"aplikacije za preverjanje pristnosti na vašem telefonu (katere koli "
"aplikacije za kode TOTP). Kdor izve geslo, se brez telefona ne more "
"prijaviti."

msgid "Open the authenticator app and add an account by scanning this code."
msgstr ""
"Odprite aplikacijo za preverjanje pristnosti in dodajte profil tako, da "
"skenirate to kodo."

msgid ""
"Type below the code the app shows, to confirm. Until then nothing changes."
msgstr ""
"Spodaj vpišite kodo, ki jo kaže aplikacija, da potrdite. Do takrat se nič ne "
"spremeni."

msgid "QR code of the second factor, for the authenticator app"
msgstr "QR koda drugega faktorja za aplikacijo za preverjanje pristnosti"

msgid ""
"The QR code is drawn by the browser: turn JavaScript on, or type the key "
"below into the app."
msgstr ""
"QR kodo nariše brskalnik: vklopite JavaScript ali v aplikacijo vpišite "
"spodnji ključ."

msgid "Or type this key into the app (time-based, 6 digits, 30 seconds):"
msgstr ""
"Ali pa ta ključ vpišite v aplikacijo (časovno odvisen, 6 števk, 30 sekund):"

msgid ""
"This key is shown only now. Do not keep a copy of it anywhere else than in "
"the app."
msgstr ""
"Ta ključ je prikazan samo zdaj. Kopije ne hranite nikjer drugje kot v "
"aplikaciji."

msgid "The second factor is off: the sign-in asks only for the password."
msgstr "Drugi faktor je izklopljen: prijava zahteva samo geslo."

msgid ""
"The second factor is on: from the next sign-in, the password and then a code "
"from the app."
msgstr ""
"Drugi faktor je vklopljen: od naslednje prijave geslo in nato koda iz "
"aplikacije."

msgid ""
"The time to type the code ran out, or the account changed. Sign in again."
msgstr ""
"Čas za vpis kode je potekel ali pa se je profil spremenil. Znova se "
"prijavite."

msgid "second factor of the admin's sign-in"
msgstr "drugi faktor prijave v administracijo"

msgid ""
"The second factor of your account's sign-in to the administration was turned "
"on, turned off or removed."
msgstr ""
"Drugi faktor prijave vašega profila v administracijo je bil vklopljen, "
"izklopljen ali odstranjen."

msgid "The staff account {name} turned its second factor on."
msgstr "Profil ekipe {name} je vklopil svoj drugi faktor."

msgid "The staff account {name} turned its second factor off."
msgstr "Profil ekipe {name} je izklopil svoj drugi faktor."

msgid ""
"The second factor of the staff account {name} was reset with manage.py "
"admin_totp reset."
msgstr ""
"Drugi faktor profila ekipe {name} je bil ponastavljen z manage.py admin_totp "
"reset."

msgid ""
"A wrong second-factor code after the right password for the staff account "
"{name}: its password may be known to someone else. Change it."
msgstr ""
"Napačna koda drugega faktorja po pravilnem geslu za profil ekipe {name}: "
"njegovo geslo morda pozna še kdo drug. Spremenite ga."

msgid "After signing with the wallet, reload this page."
msgstr "Ko podpišete z denarnico, znova naložite to stran."

msgid "Asked %(when)s, solved %(solved)s by %(who)s."
msgstr "Vprašano %(when)s, rešeno %(solved)s, rešil %(who)s."

msgid "Asked %(when)s."
msgstr "Vprašano %(when)s."

msgid "Call back:"
msgstr "Pokličite nazaj:"

msgid "End this browser's pass"
msgstr "Končajte vstopnico tega brskalnika"

msgid ""
"For the volunteers who look after the shops. Scan the code with the "
"Lightning wallet of your team key, or tap it if the wallet is on this phone."
msgstr ""
"Za prostovoljce, ki skrbijo za trgovine. Kodo skenirajte z Lightning "
"denarnico svojega ključa ekipe ali se je dotaknite, če je denarnica na tem "
"telefonu."

msgid ""
"Lost a phone, or signed in where you should not have? Ask an administrator "
"to end all the passes of your key."
msgstr ""
"Ste izgubili telefon ali se prijavili tam, kjer se ne bi smeli? Prosite "
"administratorja, naj konča vse vstopnice vašega ključa."

msgid "Name"
msgstr "Ime"

msgid "No request for help is waiting."
msgstr "Nobena prošnja za pomoč ne čaka."

msgid "Requests for help"
msgstr "Prošnje za pomoč"

msgid "Role"
msgstr "Vloga"

msgid ""
"Scan a sign-in code only on a page you opened yourself: never one somebody "
"else sends you, whatever they say. Your wallet would open this area for them."
msgstr ""
"Kodo za prijavo skenirajte samo na strani, ki ste jo odprli sami: nikoli "
"kode, ki vam jo pošlje kdo drug, ne glede na to, kaj pravi. Vaša denarnica "
"bi mu odprla to območje."

msgid "Signed in. Opening the area…"
msgstr "Prijavljeni ste. Odpiram območje …"

msgid "Solved in the last days"
msgstr "Rešeno v zadnjih dneh"

msgid ""
"The address is not shown here: whoever has the administration writes to it."
msgstr "Naslov tukaj ni prikazan: piše mu tisti, ki ima administracijo."

msgid ""
"The merchant sees «Solved» in their panel. Never ask a merchant for the "
"secret words of their wallet, for a key or for a password."
msgstr ""
"Trgovec na svoji nadzorni plošči vidi »Rešeno«. Trgovca nikoli ne sprašujte "
"za skrivne besede njegove denarnice, za ključ ali za geslo."

msgid "The requests for help"
msgstr "Prošnje za pomoč"

msgid ""
"This browser is signed in with a team key whose role (%(role)s) does not "
"open this area. Sign in with the wallet of a moderator's key."
msgstr ""
"Ta brskalnik je prijavljen s ključem ekipe, katerega vloga (%(role)s) ne "
"odpre tega območja. Prijavite se z denarnico ključa moderatorja."

msgid "This browser's pass ends"
msgstr "Vstopnica tega brskalnika poteče"

msgid "This wallet was not accepted."
msgstr "Ta denarnica ni bila sprejeta."

msgid "Volunteers' area"
msgstr "Območje prostovoljcev"

msgid "What the site knew when they asked"
msgstr "Kaj je spletno mesto vedelo, ko so vprašali"

msgid "You"
msgstr "Vi"

msgid ""
"Your wallet's key opens this area: no password, no account. It is not a "
"right in the administration, and nothing here changes a shop, an owner or an "
"address."
msgstr ""
"Ključ vaše denarnice odpre to območje: brez gesla, brez profila. To ni "
"pravica v administraciji in nič tukaj ne spremeni trgovine, lastnika ali "
"naslova."

msgid "action"
msgstr "dejanje"

msgid "done to"
msgstr "izvedeno na"

msgid "ended the pass of a browser"
msgstr "je končal vstopnico brskalnika"

msgid "in the volunteers' area"
msgstr "v območju prostovoljcev"

msgid "marked a request for help as solved"
msgstr "je prošnjo za pomoč označil kot rešeno"

msgid "marked a request for help as waiting again"
msgstr "je prošnjo za pomoč znova označil kot čakajočo"

msgid "volunteer's action"
msgstr "dejanje prostovoljca"

msgid "volunteers' actions"
msgstr "dejanja prostovoljcev"

msgid ""
"{name} ({role}) signed in with their wallet in a new browser. If it was not "
"them, revoke the key or end its passes:"
msgstr ""
"{name} ({role}) se je z denarnico prijavil v novem brskalniku. Če to ni bil "
"on, prekličite ključ ali končajte njegove vstopnice:"

msgid "{name} joined the team ({role}). The team's keys:"
msgstr "{name} se je pridružil ekipi ({role}). Ključi ekipe:"

msgid "%(count)d action"
msgid_plural "%(count)d actions"
msgstr[0] "%(count)d dejanje"
msgstr[1] "%(count)d dejanji"
msgstr[2] "%(count)d dejanja"
msgstr[3] "%(count)d dejanj"

msgid "Asked %(when)s, solved %(solved)s from the administration."
msgstr "Vprašano %(when)s, rešeno %(solved)s iz administracije."

msgid "%(when)s, from %(via)s, by %(who)s."
msgstr "%(when)s, prek %(via)s, izvedel %(who)s."

msgid "%(when)s, from %(via)s."
msgstr "%(when)s, prek %(via)s."

msgid ""
"A new shop goes on the map and the lists only once somebody approves it. Its "
"register works already. If you doubt, leave it waiting and tell an "
"administrator."
msgstr ""
"Nova trgovina pride na zemljevid in na sezname šele, ko jo nekdo odobri. "
"Njena blagajna že deluje. Če dvomite, pustite jo v čakanju in obvestite "
"administratorja."

msgid ""
"A request that cannot be done is answered by an administrator, who writes "
"the merchant why."
msgstr ""
"Na prošnjo, ki je ni mogoče izpolniti, odgovori administrator, ki trgovcu "
"napiše, zakaj."

msgid "Account changes"
msgstr "Spremembe profilov"

msgid "Asked %(when)s, closed %(done)s by %(who)s."
msgstr "Vprašano %(when)s, zaključeno %(done)s, zaključil %(who)s."

msgid "Asked %(when)s, closed %(done)s from the administration."
msgstr "Vprašano %(when)s, zaključeno %(done)s iz administracije."

msgid "Changes to the owners' accounts"
msgstr "Spremembe profilov lastnikov"

msgid "Closed in the last days"
msgstr "Zaključeno v zadnjih dneh"

msgid ""
"In the volunteers' area: approve the new shops that wait, except those that "
"look like a copy of another shop."
msgstr ""
"V območju prostovoljcev: odobritev novih trgovin, ki čakajo, razen tistih, "
"ki so videti kot kopija druge trgovine."

msgid "New shops"
msgstr "Nove trgovine"

msgid "Newer"
msgstr "Novejše"

msgid "No OpenStreetMap request is waiting."
msgstr "Nobena prošnja za OpenStreetMap ne čaka."

msgid "No change in the register."
msgstr "V evidenci ni sprememb."

msgid "No new shop is waiting."
msgstr "Nobena nova trgovina ne čaka."

msgid "Not told:"
msgstr "Niso obveščeni:"

msgid "Older"
msgstr "Starejše"

msgid "Pages"
msgstr "Strani"

msgid "The editor"
msgstr "Urejevalnik"

msgid "The merchant asked the community to put the shop on OpenStreetMap, or to update its entry. You do it by hand on openstreetmap.org, with your own account, using the lines of the request: the site writes nothing there. Then mark it done: the merchant sees it in the panel."
msgstr "Trgovec je prosil skupnost, naj trgovino doda na OpenStreetMap ali posodobi njen vpis. To opravite ročno na openstreetmap.org, s svojim profilom, z vrsticami iz prošnje: spletno mesto tam ne zapiše ničesar. Nato označite, da je opravljeno: trgovec to vidi na nadzorni plošči."

msgid "The shop's entry"
msgstr "Vpis trgovine"

msgid ""
"This shop is not approved from here: an administrator looks at it and "
"approves it from the administration."
msgstr ""
"Te trgovine ni mogoče odobriti od tod: pregleda in odobri jo administrator v "
"administraciji."

msgid "Told:"
msgstr "Obveščeni:"

msgid "What to write:"
msgstr "Kaj napisati:"

msgid "What whoever runs the site changed in the accounts of shops' owners, newest first: a second pair of eyes on the people who can change them. It names who did it. If a change looks wrong, ask the merchant whether they expected it, and tell the community."
msgstr "Kaj je upravljavec spletnega mesta spremenil v profilih lastnikov trgovin, od najnovejšega: drugi par oči za tiste, ki jih lahko spreminjajo. Navede, kdo je to storil. Če se vam sprememba zdi napačna, trgovca vprašajte, ali jo je pričakoval, in obvestite skupnost."

msgid "Written %(when)s."
msgstr "Napisano %(when)s."

msgid ""
"You do not approve new shops: an administrator can allow it on your key."
msgstr ""
"Novih trgovin ne odobravate: administrator vam to lahko dovoli na vašem "
"ključu."

msgid "You may approve new shops."
msgstr "Nove trgovine lahko odobravate."

msgid "approved a new shop"
msgstr "je odobril novo trgovino"

msgid "marked an OpenStreetMap request as done"
msgstr "je prošnjo za OpenStreetMap označil kot opravljeno"

msgid "may approve new shops"
msgstr "lahko odobrava nove trgovine"

msgid ""
"In the volunteers' area: approve the new shops that wait, except those that "
"look like a copy of another shop. Only staff who may approve shops can set "
"it. On an invite, the link is worth this right: whoever opens it first and "
"signs gets it. Send it by a channel you trust, delete the invite if it went "
"astray, revoke the key if it was taken."
msgstr ""
"V območju prostovoljcev: odobritev novih trgovin, ki čakajo, razen tistih, "
"ki so videti kot kopija druge trgovine. Nastavijo jo lahko samo člani ekipe, "
"ki lahko odobravajo trgovine. Pri povabilu povezava prinaša to pravico: dobi "
"jo, kdor jo prvi odpre in podpiše. Pošljite jo po kanalu, ki mu zaupate, "
"izbrišite povabilo, če je zašlo drugam, in prekličite ključ, če je bil "
"ukraden."

msgid ""
"Your wallet's key opens this area: no password, no account. It is not a "
"right in the administration. Here it changes no owner, account or address, "
"and it puts a new shop on the map only when you approve it."
msgstr ""
"Ključ vaše denarnice odpre to območje: brez gesla, brez profila. To ni "
"pravica v administraciji. Tukaj ne spremeni nobenega lastnika, profila ali "
"naslova, novo trgovino pa postavi na zemljevid samo, ko jo odobrite."

msgid "Test message"
msgstr "Preizkusno sporočilo"

msgid ""
"This is a test message from the site, sent with manage.py notify_test. If "
"you read it, the messages for the people who look after the site reach you "
"here. There is nothing to do."
msgstr ""
"To je preizkusno sporočilo spletnega mesta, poslano z manage.py notify_test. "
"Če ga berete, vas sporočila za tiste, ki skrbijo za spletno mesto, dosežejo "
"tukaj. Ničesar vam ni treba storiti."

msgid "Your panel says what to do."
msgstr "Vaša nadzorna plošča pove, kaj storiti."

msgid "{shop} is on the map"
msgstr "{shop} je na zemljevidu"

msgid "{shop} is approved"
msgstr "{shop} je odobrena"

msgid ""
"Good news: the community approved {shop}. It is on the map now, and in the "
"lists."
msgstr ""
"Dobra novica: skupnost je odobrila {shop}. Zdaj je na zemljevidu in na "
"seznamih."

msgid "Good news: the community approved {shop}."
msgstr "Dobra novica: skupnost je odobrila {shop}."

msgid "Its page, the one customers see: {link}"
msgstr "Njena stran, tista, ki jo vidijo stranke: {link}"

msgid ""
"You can print the sign now: its QR code opens that page. You find it in your "
"panel, together with the card for the till."
msgstr ""
"Zdaj lahko natisnete tablo: njena QR koda odpre to stran. Najdete jo na "
"nadzorni plošči, skupaj s kartico za blagajno."

msgid ""
"Try it: open the register and pay yourself a small amount from another "
"phone. The sign to print comes once the community has approved the shop."
msgstr ""
"Preizkusite jo: odprite blagajno in si z drugim telefonom plačajte majhen "
"znesek. Tabla za tisk pride, ko skupnost odobri trgovino."

msgid ""
"The sign and the card for customers come once the community has approved the "
"shop. You will hear from us then, if your account has an email or the shop a "
"Telegram chat."
msgstr ""
"Tabla in kartica za stranke prideta, ko skupnost odobri trgovino. Takrat vam "
"sporočimo, če ima vaš profil e-poštni naslov ali trgovina klepet v Telegramu."

msgid ""
"Wait for the community to approve the shop: then print the sign for the door "
"or the counter. The card for whoever stands at the till you can print now."
msgstr ""
"Počakajte, da skupnost odobri trgovino: nato natisnite tablo za vrata ali "
"pult. Kartico za tistega, ki je pri blagajni, lahko natisnete že zdaj."

msgid ""
"Try the register and give it to whoever works with you; print the sign once "
"the community has approved the shop. The steps are here below."
msgstr ""
"Preizkusite blagajno in jo dajte zaposlenim; tablo natisnite, ko skupnost "
"odobri trgovino. Koraki so spodaj."

msgid "The sign of %(name)s"
msgstr "Tabla trgovine %(name)s"

msgid ""
"The community looks at every new shop before it goes on the map. The codes "
"of the sign and of the card for customers open pages that show how to pay "
"only once the shop is approved: both come then. You will hear from us, if "
"your account has an email or the shop a Telegram chat."
msgstr ""
"Skupnost pregleda vsako novo trgovino, preden pride na zemljevid. Kode na "
"tabli in na kartici za stranke odprejo strani, ki kažejo, kako plačati, šele "
"ko je trgovina odobrena: obe prideta takrat. Sporočimo vam, če ima vaš "
"profil e-poštni naslov ali trgovina klepet v Telegramu."

msgid "The register already works, and so does the card for the till."
msgstr "Blagajna že deluje, prav tako kartica za blagajno."

msgid "More, whenever you like"
msgstr "Več, kadar želite"

msgid "On-chain payments: in the register's settings"
msgstr "On-chain plačila: v nastavitvah blagajne"

msgid "Encrypted copies of the register on Nostr: in the register's settings"
msgstr "Šifrirane kopije blagajne na Nostru: v nastavitvah blagajne"

msgid "A discount for whoever pays in bitcoin"
msgstr "Popust za tiste, ki plačajo v bitcoinih"

msgid "Now: %(title)s"
msgstr "Zdaj: %(title)s"

msgid "Your Lightning address does not answer"
msgstr "Vaš Lightning naslov se ne odziva"

msgid ""
"The message above says what to do. Until it works, customers cannot pay you "
"with Lightning."
msgstr ""
"Zgornje sporočilo pove, kaj storiti. Dokler ne deluje, vam stranke ne morejo "
"plačati z Lightningom."

msgid ""
"The register asks your wallet for each payment: the money goes straight to "
"you, never through this site."
msgstr ""
"Blagajna za vsako plačilo vpraša vašo denarnico: denar gre neposredno k vam, "
"nikoli prek tega spletnega mesta."

msgid ""
"Practise first without money if you like. Then open the register and pay "
"yourself a small amount from another phone, as a customer would. When it "
"says it is paid, mark it done here."
msgstr ""
"Če želite, najprej vadite brez denarja. Nato odprite blagajno in si z drugim "
"telefonom plačajte majhen znesek, kot bi to storila stranka. Ko pokaže, da "
"je plačano, to tukaj označite kot opravljeno."

msgid ""
"Open the register and pay yourself a small amount from another phone, as a "
"customer would. When it says it is paid, mark it done here."
msgstr ""
"Odprite blagajno in si z drugim telefonom plačajte majhen znesek, kot bi to "
"storila stranka. Ko pokaže, da je plačano, to tukaj označite kot opravljeno."

msgid "Take your first payments"
msgstr "Sprejmite prva plačila"

msgid ""
"When a customer wants to pay in bitcoin, open the register. The sales stay "
"on your phone, in the register's history."
msgstr ""
"Ko želi stranka plačati v bitcoinih, odprite blagajno. Prodaje ostanejo na "
"vašem telefonu, v zgodovini blagajne."

msgid ""
"Until you have the basic pass, the register takes payments up to %(amount)s "
"in total: it adds up the payments taken on the phone, and then asks for the "
"pass."
msgstr ""
"Dokler nimate osnovne prepustnice, blagajna sprejema plačila do skupnega "
"zneska %(amount)s: sešteje plačila, sprejeta na telefonu, nato pa zahteva "
"prepustnico."

msgid "Meanwhile, the basic pass: a few minutes"
msgstr "Medtem osnovna prepustnica: nekaj minut"

msgid "Get the basic pass"
msgstr "Pridobite osnovno prepustnico"

msgid ""
"The register waits for your basic pass: until you have it, it takes no real "
"payments."
msgstr ""
"Blagajna čaka na vašo osnovno prepustnico: dokler je nimate, ne sprejema "
"pravih plačil."

msgid "Next: %(title)s."
msgstr "Naslednje: %(title)s."

msgid "Print the sign"
msgstr "Natisnite tablo"

msgid "Your page on the map"
msgstr "Vaša stran na zemljevidu"

msgid ""
"At the end of the day, close it from the register's menu: you get the day's "
"total and the file for your accountant, all on your phone. Someone works "
"with you? Give them a register of their own."
msgstr ""
"Ob koncu dneva jo zaključite v meniju blagajne: dobite dnevni znesek in "
"datoteko za računovodjo, vse na telefonu. Z vami dela še kdo? Dajte mu "
"lastno blagajno."

msgid "Go further with the training"
msgstr "Nadaljujte z usposabljanjem"

msgid "The other modules of the training and the badges, whenever you like."
msgstr "Drugi moduli usposabljanja in značke, kadar želite."

msgid "Everything, if you want"
msgstr "Vse, če želite"

msgid "The shop and the wallet"
msgstr "Trgovina in denarnica"

msgid "The trial"
msgstr "Preizkus"

msgid "The first takings"
msgstr "Prvi izkupiček"

msgid "The basic pass"
msgstr "Osnovna prepustnica"

msgid "The routine"
msgstr "Vsakdan"

msgid "Going further"
msgstr "Naprej"

msgid ""
"It goes on the map as soon as you add the wallet where the money arrives: "
"your panel shows how."
msgstr ""
"Na zemljevid pride, takoj ko dodate denarnico, v katero prihaja denar: "
"nadzorna plošča vam pokaže, kako."

msgid ""
"It goes on the map as soon as its position is in its details: you can add it "
"from your panel."
msgstr ""
"Na zemljevid pride, takoj ko je njen položaj med njenimi podatki: dodate ga "
"lahko na nadzorni plošči."

msgid "The card for customers of %(name)s"
msgstr "Kartica za stranke trgovine %(name)s"

msgid ""
"A few short modules, a few minutes. Meanwhile the practice register works."
msgstr "Nekaj kratkih modulov, nekaj minut. Medtem vadbena blagajna deluje."

msgid "On this phone, {left} of it is still left."
msgstr "Na tem telefonu je od tega ostalo še {left}."

msgid "On this phone it is used up: the register now asks for the basic pass."
msgstr ""
"Na tem telefonu je porabljeno: blagajna zdaj zahteva osnovno prepustnico."

msgid "set aside on"
msgstr "odloženo dne"

msgid "set aside by"
msgstr "odložil"

msgid "set aside"
msgstr "odloženo"

msgid "Set aside: not for the map"
msgstr "Odloženo: ni za zemljevid"

msgid "Not set aside"
msgstr "Ni odloženo"

msgid "Put back among the waiting shops"
msgstr "Vrnite med trgovine, ki čakajo"

#, python-format
msgid "%(name)s waits for an approval again: it is on the list of the day."
msgstr "%(name)s znova čaka na odobritev: je na dnevnem seznamu."

#, python-format
msgid "%(name)s was not set aside."
msgstr "%(name)s ni bila odložena."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(name)s is set aside: it stays off the map and is not asked about again. "
"Its page in the admin puts it back among the waiting shops."
msgstr ""
"%(name)s je odložena: ostane zunaj zemljevida in o njej ne sprašujemo več. "
"Njena stran v administraciji jo vrne med trgovine, ki čakajo."

#, python-format
msgid "%(name)s was already set aside."
msgstr "%(name)s je bila že odložena."

msgid "Not for the map: set aside"
msgstr "Ni za zemljevid: odložite"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"The community set this shop aside: it will not go on the map. If that is not "
"right, write to <a href=\"mailto:%(email)s\">%(email)s</a>."
msgstr ""
"Skupnost je to trgovino odložila: ne bo prišla na zemljevid. Če to ni prav, "
"pišite na <a href=\"mailto:%(email)s\">%(email)s</a>."

msgid ""
"The sign and the card for customers are only for shops on the map, and the "
"community set this one aside."
msgstr ""
"Tabla in kartica za stranke sta samo za trgovine na zemljevidu, skupnost pa "
"je to odložila."

msgid ""
"The sign is only for shops on the map. The card for whoever stands at the "
"till you can print now."
msgstr ""
"Tabla je samo za trgovine na zemljevidu. Kartico za tistega, ki je pri "
"blagajni, lahko natisnete zdaj."

msgid ""
"Try the register and give it to whoever works with you; the sign is only for "
"shops on the map. The steps are here below."
msgstr ""
"Preizkusite blagajno in jo dajte zaposlenim; tabla je samo za trgovine na "
"zemljevidu. Koraki so spodaj."

msgid ""
"The community set your shop aside: it will not go on the map. The register "
"still works."
msgstr ""
"Skupnost je vašo trgovino odložila: ne bo prišla na zemljevid. Blagajna še "
"vedno deluje."

#, python-format
msgid "%(when)s, by %(who)s: not for the map"
msgstr "%(when)s, odločil %(who)s: ni za zemljevid"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"The owner stopped half-way through the basic pass of the training: %(shops)s."
msgstr ""
"Lastnik se je ustavil sredi osnovne prepustnice usposabljanja: %(shops)s."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"Call them: in their panel «Your merchant pass» goes on from where they "
"stopped, the step «%(step)s». Without the basic pass their register will "
"wait for it."
msgstr ""
"Pokličite jih: na njihovi nadzorni plošči »Vaša trgovska prepustnica« "
"nadaljuje tam, kjer so se ustavili, pri koraku »%(step)s«. Brez osnovne "
"prepustnice bo njihova blagajna čakala nanjo."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"The real register waits for the owner's basic pass of the training: "
"%(shops)s."
msgstr ""
"Prava blagajna čaka na lastnikovo osnovno prepustnico usposabljanja: "
"%(shops)s."

msgid ""
"Call them: their register waits for the basic pass, and «Your merchant pass» "
"in their panel says what is left."
msgstr ""
"Pokličite jih: njihova blagajna čaka na osnovno prepustnico, »Vaša trgovska "
"prepustnica« na njihovi nadzorni plošči pa pove, kaj še manjka."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"Call them: in their panel «Your merchant pass» goes on from where they "
"stopped, the step «%(step)s». Until the basic pass their register takes only "
"the quick start, then waits; the practice register works meanwhile."
msgstr ""
"Pokličite jih: na njihovi nadzorni plošči »Vaša trgovska prepustnica« "
"nadaljuje tam, kjer so se ustavili, pri koraku »%(step)s«. Do osnovne "
"prepustnice njihova blagajna sprejme samo hitri začetek, nato čaka; medtem "
"deluje vadbena blagajna."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"Call them: in their panel «Your merchant pass» goes on from where they "
"stopped, the step «%(step)s». Until the basic pass their register says «The "
"register opens soon» and takes no new sale; the practice register works "
"meanwhile."
msgstr ""
"Pokličite jih: na njihovi nadzorni plošči »Vaša trgovska prepustnica« "
"nadaljuje tam, kjer so se ustavili, pri koraku »%(step)s«. Do osnovne "
"prepustnice njihova blagajna pravi »Blagajna se kmalu odpre« in ne sprejme "
"nove prodaje; medtem deluje vadbena blagajna."

msgid ""
"Something about the registers of the staff: whoever has the administration "
"sees it."
msgstr "Nekaj je z blagajnami zaposlenih: vidi tisti, ki ima administracijo."

msgid "Too many tries. Wait a little and try again."
msgstr "Preveč poskusov. Malo počakajte in poskusite znova."

msgid ""
"The passkey was not accepted. Try again, with a passkey you added to this "
"account on this site."
msgstr ""
"Ključ za dostop ni bil sprejet. Poskusite znova s ključem za dostop, ki ste "
"ga temu profilu dodali na tem spletnem mestu."

#, python-format
msgid "The password of %(name)s is right. Now confirm with your passkey."
msgstr ""
"Geslo za %(name)s je pravilno. Zdaj potrdite s svojim ključem za dostop."

msgid "Use a passkey"
msgstr "Uporabite ključ za dostop"

msgid "This browser cannot use passkeys."
msgstr "Ta brskalnik ne more uporabljati ključev za dostop."

msgid "Type the code from the app below."
msgstr "Spodaj vpišite kodo iz aplikacije."

msgid "Passkeys need JavaScript: turn it on."
msgstr "Ključi za dostop potrebujejo JavaScript: vklopite ga."

msgid "Or type the code from the app below."
msgstr "Ali pa spodaj vpišite kodo iz aplikacije."

#, python-format
msgid "Passkeys work only at %(url)s, not at this address."
msgstr "Ključi za dostop delujejo samo na %(url)s, ne na tem naslovu."

msgid "The browser did not use a passkey, or it was cancelled."
msgstr "Brskalnik ni uporabil ključa za dostop ali pa je bilo preklicano."

msgid "This site asks every staff account for a passkey: add one to go on."
msgstr ""
"To spletno mesto zahteva ključ za dostop za vsak profil ekipe: dodajte ga, "
"da lahko nadaljujete."

msgid ""
"This is the last second factor of your account that this site accepts, and "
"the site requires one: add another before you remove it."
msgstr ""
"To je zadnji drugi faktor vašega profila, ki ga to spletno mesto sprejema, "
"spletno mesto pa ga zahteva: preden ga odstranite, dodajte drugega."

msgid ""
"The passkey was not added: the time ran out, it is already on this site, or "
"the browser's answer was not valid. Try again."
msgstr ""
"Ključ za dostop ni bil dodan: čas je potekel, na tem spletnem mestu že "
"obstaja ali pa odgovor brskalnika ni bil veljaven. Poskusite znova."

msgid "Passkeys"
msgstr "Ključi za dostop"

msgid ""
"A passkey is made by your phone, your computer or a security key, and signs "
"in only on this site: a fake page that copies this one gets nothing from it. "
"The site keeps only its public key."
msgstr ""
"Ključ za dostop ustvari vaš telefon, računalnik ali varnostni ključ in "
"prijavlja samo na tem spletnem mestu: lažna stran, ki kopira to, od njega ne "
"dobi ničesar. Spletno mesto hrani samo njegov javni ključ."

msgid ""
"This site accepts only passkeys. Add at least two, on two different devices "
"(a phone and a security key, for example): if one is lost, the other still "
"signs in."
msgstr ""
"To spletno mesto sprejema samo ključe za dostop. Dodajte vsaj dva, na dveh "
"različnih napravah (na primer telefon in varnostni ključ): če enega "
"izgubite, se z drugim še vedno prijavite."

msgid "Added"
msgstr "Dodano"

msgid "Last used"
msgstr "Zadnja uporaba"

msgid "Where it lives"
msgstr "Kje je shranjen"

msgid "Passkey"
msgstr "Ključ za dostop"

msgid "never"
msgstr "nikoli"

msgid "synced"
msgstr "sinhroniziran"

msgid "on this device only"
msgstr "samo na tej napravi"

msgid "New name"
msgstr "Novo ime"

msgid "Your account has no passkey yet."
msgstr "Vaš profil še nima ključa za dostop."

msgid "The browser did not make the passkey, or it was cancelled."
msgstr "Brskalnik ni ustvaril ključa za dostop ali pa je bilo preklicano."

msgid "Add a passkey"
msgstr "Dodajte ključ za dostop"

msgid "Its name:"
msgstr "Njegovo ime:"

msgid "phone, key on my keyring"
msgstr "telefon, ključ na mojem obesku"

msgid "The code from an app below works in every browser."
msgstr "Spodnja koda iz aplikacije deluje v vsakem brskalniku."

msgid "The code from an app below works without it."
msgstr "Spodnja koda iz aplikacije deluje tudi brez tega."

msgid ""
"Lost a phone or a key? Remove its passkey here from another one. Lost them "
"all? Whoever runs the machine removes them with manage.py admin_passkey "
"reset and your name."
msgstr ""
"Ste izgubili telefon ali ključ? Njegov ključ za dostop odstranite tukaj, "
"prijavljeni z drugim. Ste izgubili vse? Upravljavec strežnika jih odstrani z "
"manage.py admin_passkey reset in vašim imenom."

msgid "Code from an app"
msgstr "Koda iz aplikacije"

msgid ""
"This site accepts only passkeys: the code from the app is neither asked for "
"nor accepted."
msgstr ""
"To spletno mesto sprejema samo ključe za dostop: koda iz aplikacije se ne "
"zahteva in se ne sprejme."

msgid "This site accepts only passkeys: a code from an app cannot be set up."
msgstr ""
"To spletno mesto sprejema samo ključe za dostop: kode iz aplikacije ni "
"mogoče nastaviti."

msgid "The staff account {name} added a passkey."
msgstr "Profil ekipe {name} je dodal ključ za dostop."

msgid "The staff account {name} removed a passkey."
msgstr "Profil ekipe {name} je odstranil ključ za dostop."

msgid ""
"The passkeys of the staff account {name} were removed with manage.py "
"admin_passkey reset."
msgstr ""
"Ključi za dostop profila ekipe {name} so bili odstranjeni z manage.py "
"admin_passkey reset."

msgid ""
"A passkey of the staff account {name} signed with a count that did not grow: "
"it may have been copied. The sign-in was refused. Remove that passkey from "
"the account, and check who else may have it."
msgstr ""
"Ključ za dostop profila ekipe {name} je podpisal s števcem, ki se ni "
"povečal: morda je bil kopiran. Prijava je bila zavrnjena. Ta ključ za dostop "
"odstranite s profila in preverite, kdo drug ga morda ima."

msgid ""
"The passkey is added: from the next sign-in, the password and then the "
"passkey."
msgstr ""
"Ključ za dostop je dodan: od naslednje prijave geslo in nato ključ za dostop."

msgid "The passkey is removed."
msgstr "Ključ za dostop je odstranjen."

msgid "The code from the app is off."
msgstr "Koda iz aplikacije je izklopljena."

msgid "Use a wallet with a different Lightning address, or write to {email}."
msgstr "Uporabite denarnico z drugim Lightning naslovom ali pišite na {email}."

msgid "Phoenix addresses, the ones with the ₿ sign, cannot be used here."
msgstr "Naslovov Phoenix, tistih z znakom ₿, tukaj ni mogoče uporabiti."

msgid ""
"{provider} does not answer right now: check what you wrote after the @ and "
"try again in a minute."
msgstr ""
"{provider} se trenutno ne odziva: preverite, kaj ste napisali za @, in "
"poskusite znova čez minuto."

msgid ""
"{provider} answers, but it knows no such address: check what you wrote "
"before the @."
msgstr ""
"{provider} se odziva, vendar takega naslova ne pozna: preverite, kaj ste "
"napisali pred @."

msgid ""
"{provider} answers, but not as a Lightning address does (LNURL-pay, LUD-16): "
"check the address in your wallet, under Receive."
msgstr ""
"{provider} se odziva, vendar ne tako kot Lightning naslov (LNURL-pay, "
"LUD-16): preverite naslov v svoji denarnici, pod »Prejmi«."

msgid ""
"{provider} has its invoices made by another site, and the register asks only "
"the address's own: this wallet cannot be used with the register."
msgstr ""
"{provider} pusti, da njegove zahtevke za plačilo ustvarja drugo spletno "
"mesto, blagajna pa sprašuje samo spletno mesto naslova: te denarnice ni "
"mogoče uporabljati z blagajno."

msgid ""
"{provider} knows this address but gives no invoice for it: check in your "
"wallet that it can receive, and try again."
msgstr ""
"{provider} ta naslov pozna, vendar zanj ne izda zahtevka za plačilo: v "
"denarnici preverite, ali lahko prejema, in poskusite znova."

msgid ""
"This address can receive, but {provider} does not tell the register when a "
"payment arrives: it does not support LUD-21 (verify)."
msgstr ""
"Ta naslov lahko prejema, vendar {provider} blagajni ne sporoči, ko plačilo "
"prispe: ne podpira LUD-21 (verify)."

msgid ""
"This address can receive, but {provider} does not tell the register when a "
"payment arrives: its LUD-21 (verify) is on another site, which the register "
"does not ask."
msgstr ""
"Ta naslov lahko prejema, vendar {provider} blagajni ne sporoči, ko plačilo "
"prispe: njegov LUD-21 (verify) je na drugem spletnem mestu, ki ga blagajna "
"ne sprašuje."

msgid ""
"This address can receive, but {provider} does not tell the register when a "
"payment arrives: its LUD-21 (verify) does not answer as the register needs."
msgstr ""
"Ta naslov lahko prejema, vendar {provider} blagajni ne sporoči, ko plačilo "
"prispe: njegov LUD-21 (verify) se ne odziva tako, kot blagajna potrebuje."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"The password of %(name)s is right. This site now signs in with passkeys "
"only, and your account has none yet: type the code from your app this once. "
"It opens only the page where you add a passkey."
msgstr ""
"Geslo za %(name)s je pravilno. To spletno mesto zdaj prijavlja samo s ključi "
"za dostop, vaš profil pa še nima nobenega: tokrat vpišite kodo iz svoje "
"aplikacije. Odpre samo stran, kjer dodate ključ za dostop."

msgid ""
"You signed in with the code from the app only to add a passkey: add one now. "
"Until then this is the only page you reach."
msgstr ""
"S kodo iz aplikacije ste se prijavili samo zato, da dodate ključ za dostop: "
"dodajte ga zdaj. Do takrat je to edina stran, do katere pridete."

msgid ""
"A session opened with the code only to add a passkey cannot turn the code "
"off."
msgstr ""
"Seja, odprta s kodo samo za dodajanje ključa za dostop, kode ne more "
"izklopiti."

msgid ""
"A refused passkey after the right password for the staff account {name}: its "
"password may be known to someone else. Change it."
msgstr ""
"Zavrnjen ključ za dostop po pravilnem geslu za profil ekipe {name}: njegovo "
"geslo morda pozna še kdo drug. Spremenite ga."

msgid "(empty)"
msgstr "(prazno)"

msgid "{name}: set"
msgstr "{name}: nastavljeno"

msgid "{name}: removed"
msgstr "{name}: odstranjeno"

msgid "{name}: changed"
msgstr "{name}: spremenjeno"

msgid "lowered"
msgstr "znižano"

msgid ""
"Security settings changed since the previous start of the site ({time}):"
msgstr ""
"Varnostne nastavitve, spremenjene od prejšnjega zagona spletnega mesta "
"({time}):"

msgid ""
"The other secrets cannot be compared this time, because SECRET_KEY changed: "
"they are recorded again."
msgstr ""
"Drugih skrivnosti tokrat ni mogoče primerjati, ker se je SECRET_KEY "
"spremenil: znova so zabeležene."

msgid "If nobody of the team did this, look at the machine's .env."
msgstr "Če tega ni storil nihče iz ekipe, poglejte datoteko .env na strežniku."

msgid "Settings changed"
msgstr "Nastavitve spremenjene"

msgid ""
"A Lightning wallet linked here opens /admin/ for your account by itself, in "
"place of the password: one step, not two. Whoever holds your unlocked phone "
"with that wallet has your /admin/, as whoever knows your password has. The "
"password keeps working."
msgstr ""
"Lightning denarnica, povezana tukaj, sama odpre /admin/ za vaš profil, "
"namesto gesla: en korak, ne dva. Kdor ima v rokah vaš odklenjen telefon s to "
"denarnico, ima vaš /admin/, tako kot ga ima tisti, ki pozna vaše geslo. "
"Geslo deluje še naprej."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"A wallet signed with the key %(key)s. If it is yours, give it a name and "
"link it."
msgstr ""
"Denarnica je podpisala s ključem %(key)s. Če je vaša, ji dajte ime in jo "
"povežite."

msgid ""
"A wallet that signs in to the administration was linked to your account, or "
"removed from it."
msgstr ""
"Denarnica, ki se prijavlja v administracijo, je bila povezana z vašim "
"profilom ali odstranjena z njega."

msgid "Code to link a wallet to your account"
msgstr "Koda za povezavo denarnice z vašim profilom"

msgid "Code to sign in to the administration with your wallet"
msgstr "Koda za prijavo v administracijo z vašo denarnico"

msgid "It is not mine: cancel"
msgstr "Ni moja: prekličite"

msgid "Link a wallet"
msgstr "Povežite denarnico"

msgid "Link the wallet"
msgstr "Povežite denarnico"

msgid "Link this wallet"
msgstr "Povežite to denarnico"

msgid ""
"Lost the phone? Remove its wallet here, from another way in; or whoever runs "
"the machine removes them all with manage.py admin_wallet reset and your name."
msgstr ""
"Ste izgubili telefon? Njegovo denarnico odstranite tukaj, prijavljeni na "
"drug način; ali pa jih upravljavec strežnika odstrani vse z manage.py "
"admin_wallet reset in vašim imenom."

msgid "Once the wallet has signed, load this page again to confirm it."
msgstr "Ko denarnica podpiše, znova naložite to stran, da jo potrdite."

msgid ""
"Scan this code with the wallet you linked to your staff account, or tap it "
"on the phone that has the wallet: this page goes on by itself."
msgstr ""
"To kodo skenirajte z denarnico, ki ste jo povezali s svojim profilom ekipe, "
"ali se je dotaknite na telefonu, na katerem je denarnica: ta stran nadaljuje "
"sama."

msgid ""
"Scan this code with the wallet, or tap it on the phone that has it: this "
"page goes on by itself, and then asks you to confirm."
msgstr ""
"To kodo skenirajte z denarnico ali se je dotaknite na telefonu, na katerem "
"je: ta stran nadaljuje sama in vas nato prosi za potrditev."

msgid "Sign in with a wallet"
msgstr "Prijava z denarnico"

msgid "Sign in with the password"
msgstr "Prijava z geslom"

msgid "Sign in with your wallet"
msgstr "Prijava z vašo denarnico"

msgid "The code ran out of time. Load the page again for a new one."
msgstr "Kodi je potekel čas. Znova naložite stran za novo."

msgid "The staff account {name} linked a wallet that signs in to /admin/."
msgstr "Profil ekipe {name} je povezal denarnico, ki se prijavlja v /admin/."

msgid "The staff account {name} removed a wallet that signed in to /admin/."
msgstr ""
"Profil ekipe {name} je odstranil denarnico, ki se je prijavljala v /admin/."

msgid "The wallet is linked to your account."
msgstr "Denarnica je povezana z vašim profilom."

msgid "The wallet is removed: it no longer signs in to /admin/."
msgstr "Denarnica je odstranjena: v /admin/ se ne prijavlja več."

#, python-format
msgid "The wallet signs in only at %(url)s, not at this address."
msgstr "Denarnica se prijavlja samo na %(url)s, ne na tem naslovu."

msgid "The wallet's signature is no longer valid: scan the new code."
msgstr "Podpis denarnice ni več veljaven: skenirajte novo kodo."

msgid ""
"The wallets of the staff account {name} were removed with manage.py "
"admin_wallet reset."
msgstr ""
"Denarnice profila ekipe {name} so bile odstranjene z manage.py admin_wallet "
"reset."

msgid ""
"This page needs JavaScript to go on by itself once the wallet has signed: "
"turn it on, or sign in with the password."
msgstr ""
"Ta stran potrebuje JavaScript, da sama nadaljuje, ko denarnica podpiše: "
"vklopite ga ali se prijavite z geslom."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"This site asks for more than one step (ADMIN_SECOND_FACTOR is %(mode)s): the "
"wallets linked here do not sign in."
msgstr ""
"To spletno mesto zahteva več kot en korak (ADMIN_SECOND_FACTOR je %(mode)s): "
"denarnice, povezane tukaj, se ne prijavljajo."

msgid ""
"This wallet cannot be linked here: it already has another use on this site. "
"Use another wallet, or another account in your wallet."
msgstr ""
"Te denarnice tukaj ni mogoče povezati: na tem spletnem mestu se že uporablja "
"za nekaj drugega. Uporabite drugo denarnico ali drug profil v svoji "
"denarnici."

msgid ""
"This wallet cannot join the team here: it already has another use on this "
"site. Use another wallet, or another account in your wallet."
msgstr ""
"Ta denarnica se tukaj ne more pridružiti ekipi: na tem spletnem mestu se že "
"uporablja za nekaj drugega. Uporabite drugo denarnico ali drug profil v "
"svoji denarnici."

msgid "This wallet is already linked to your account."
msgstr "Ta denarnica je že povezana z vašim profilom."

msgid ""
"Use a wallet, or an account in your wallet, that is not the one of a shop or "
"of the team on this site: a wallet gives this site the same key every time, "
"and here one key has one role only."
msgstr ""
"Uporabite denarnico ali profil v denarnici, ki ni denarnica trgovine ali "
"ekipe na tem spletnem mestu: denarnica temu spletnemu mestu vsakič da isti "
"ključ, tukaj pa ima en ključ samo eno vlogo."

msgid "Wallet"
msgstr "Denarnica"

msgid "Wallet sign-in"
msgstr "Prijava z denarnico"

#, python-format
msgid "Wallets are linked only at %(url)s, not at this address."
msgstr "Denarnice se povezujejo samo na %(url)s, ne na tem naslovu."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"Your account has %(limit)s wallets, the most it may have: remove one to link "
"another."
msgstr ""
"Vaš profil ima že največje dovoljeno število denarnic (%(limit)s): eno "
"odstranite, da povežete drugo."

msgid ""
"Your account has a second factor: the wallets linked here do not sign in "
"while it is on. Sign in with the password and the second factor."
msgstr ""
"Vaš profil ima drugi faktor: dokler je vklopljen, se denarnice, povezane "
"tukaj, ne prijavljajo. Prijavite se z geslom in drugim faktorjem."

msgid "Your account has as many wallets as it may have: remove one first."
msgstr ""
"Vaš profil ima že toliko denarnic, kot jih sme imeti: najprej eno odstranite."

msgid "Your account has no wallet linked."
msgstr "Vaš profil nima povezane denarnice."

msgid "phone, test wallet"
msgstr "telefon, preizkusna denarnica"

msgid "wallet of the admin's sign-in"
msgstr "denarnica za prijavo v administracijo"

msgid "{name}: removed: {removed}, added: {added}"
msgstr "{name}: odstranjeno: {removed}, dodano: {added}"

msgid "{name}: the credentials in the address changed"
msgstr "{name}: poverilnice v naslovu so se spremenile"

msgid ""
"The settings watch was turned off in community.yml ({time}): the moderators "
"no longer hear when a security setting changes."
msgstr ""
"Nadzor nastavitev je bil izklopljen v community.yml ({time}): moderatorji ne "
"izvedo več, ko se spremeni varnostna nastavitev."

msgid "If nobody of the team did this, look at community.yml on the machine."
msgstr "Če tega ni storil nihče iz ekipe, poglejte community.yml na strežniku."

msgid "Settings watch turned off"
msgstr "Nadzor nastavitev izklopljen"

msgid ""
"The wallet opens the administration only in a browser where your account "
"already signed in with its password, and only while that password stays the "
"same. The first time on a browser, after a change of password, and for an "
"account with a second factor, sign in with the password."
msgstr ""
"Denarnica odpre administracijo samo v brskalniku, v katerem se je vaš profil "
"že prijavil z geslom, in samo dokler to geslo ostane enako. Prvič v "
"brskalniku, po spremembi gesla in za profil z drugim faktorjem se prijavite "
"z geslom."

msgid ""
"The wallet does not open the administration in this browser. Sign in with "
"the password."
msgstr ""
"Denarnica v tem brskalniku ne odpre administracije. Prijavite se z geslom."

msgid ""
"Approve in your wallet only a code you see on this page, which you opened "
"yourself at this site's address: a wallet signs any code it is shown."
msgstr ""
"V denarnici odobrite samo kodo, ki jo vidite na tej strani, ki ste jo sami "
"odprli na naslovu tega spletnega mesta: denarnica podpiše vsako kodo, ki ji "
"jo pokažete."

msgid ""
"The wallet signs in only in a browser where your account already signed in "
"with its password, and only while that password stays the same: after a "
"change of password, use the new one once in each browser. Approve in your "
"wallet only a code you opened yourself on this site: a wallet signs any code "
"it is shown."
msgstr ""
"Denarnica prijavlja samo v brskalniku, v katerem se je vaš profil že "
"prijavil z geslom, in samo dokler to geslo ostane enako: po spremembi gesla "
"novo geslo uporabite enkrat v vsakem brskalniku. V denarnici odobrite samo "
"kodo, ki ste jo sami odprli na tem spletnem mestu: denarnica podpiše vsako "
"kodo, ki ji jo pokažete."

msgid ""
"This session was opened with a wallet: sign in with the password to manage "
"the wallets."
msgstr ""
"Ta seja je bila odprta z denarnico: za upravljanje denarnic se prijavite z "
"geslom."

msgid "Sign in with the password to manage the wallets."
msgstr "Za upravljanje denarnic se prijavite z geslom."

msgid ""
"If your own wallet reported an error, press cancel: someone else's wallet "
"signed first."
msgstr ""
"Če je vaša denarnica javila napako, pritisnite »Prekličite«: prva je "
"podpisala denarnica nekoga drugega."

msgid "Sign in with the password to add a second factor."
msgstr "Za dodajanje drugega faktorja se prijavite z geslom."

msgid "{name}: removed: {removed}, now empty"
msgstr "{name}: odstranjeno: {removed}, zdaj prazno"

msgid ""
"This session was opened with a wallet: sign in with the password to set a "
"password."
msgstr ""
"Ta seja je bila odprta z denarnico: za nastavitev gesla se prijavite z "
"geslom."

msgid "Not read by a native speaker yet."
msgstr "Še ni pregledal materni govorec."

msgid "A new place, or a new address of one, goes on the map when someone of the community has approved it. The phone, and whether a place is on the map, are yours to change at once."
msgstr "Nova poslovalnica ali nov naslov poslovalnice pride na zemljevid, ko jo nekdo iz skupnosti odobri. Telefon in to, ali je poslovalnica na zemljevidu, spremenite sami takoj."

msgid "Waiting for the community to approve it: not on the map yet."
msgstr "Čaka na odobritev skupnosti: še ni na zemljevidu."

#, python-format
msgid "New address, waiting for the community to approve it: %(address)s"
msgstr "Nov naslov, čaka na odobritev skupnosti: %(address)s"

msgid "Not on the map: you chose so."
msgstr "Ni na zemljevidu: tako ste izbrali sami."

msgid "Places you took away"
msgstr "Poslovalnice, ki ste jih odstranili"

msgid "Customers do not see them. You can take one back for %(days)s days after you took it away; then it is deleted."
msgstr "Stranke jih ne vidijo. Poslovalnico lahko vrnete %(days)s dni po tem, ko ste jo odstranili; nato se izbriše."

msgid "Take it back"
msgstr "Vrnite jo"

msgid "Approve the places: on the map"
msgstr "Odobrite poslovalnice: na zemljevid"

msgid "Phone of this place (optional)"
msgstr "Telefon te poslovalnice (neobvezno)"

msgid "Show this place on the map"
msgstr "Pokaži to poslovalnico na zemljevidu"

msgid "Customers see it next to this place. Leave it empty to show none."
msgstr "Stranke ga vidijo ob tej poslovalnici. Pustite prazno, če ne želite pokazati nobenega."

msgid "Off, the place stays here for you and for your staff's registers, and customers do not see it."
msgstr "Če je izklopljeno, poslovalnica ostane tukaj za vas in za blagajne vaših zaposlenih, stranke pa je ne vidijo."

msgid "Place taken away: customers no longer see it. You can take it back for %(days)s days."
msgstr "Poslovalnica odstranjena: stranke je ne vidijo več. Vrnete jo lahko %(days)s dni."

msgid "Place taken back, as it was."
msgstr "Poslovalnica vrnjena, takšna, kot je bila."

msgid "This place cannot be taken back: remove another one first."
msgstr "Te poslovalnice ni mogoče vrniti: najprej odstranite drugo."

msgid "Place saved. The new address goes on the map when someone of the community has approved it; until then customers see the one before."
msgstr "Poslovalnica shranjena. Nov naslov pride na zemljevid, ko ga nekdo iz skupnosti odobri; do takrat stranke vidijo prejšnjega."

msgid "Place added: it goes on the map when someone of the community has approved it."
msgstr "Poslovalnica dodana: na zemljevid pride, ko jo nekdo iz skupnosti odobri."

msgid "new address %(new)s (it was %(old)s)"
msgstr "nov naslov %(new)s (prej %(old)s)"

msgid "new place %(place)s"
msgstr "nova poslovalnica %(place)s"

msgid "Check that the places are this shop's; if all is well, approve them, all at once."
msgstr "Preverite, ali poslovalnice pripadajo tej trgovini; če je vse v redu, jih odobrite, vse naenkrat."

msgid "%(name)s has no place waiting."
msgstr "%(name)s nima poslovalnic, ki čakajo."

msgid "waits for an approval"
msgstr "čaka na odobritev"

msgid "approved; a new address waits: %(address)s"
msgstr "odobrena; nov naslov čaka: %(address)s"

msgid "on the map"
msgstr "na zemljevidu"

msgid "%(count)d place of this shop waits for your approval before it goes on the map."
msgid_plural "%(count)d places of this shop wait for your approval before they go on the map."
msgstr[0] "%(count)d poslovalnica te trgovine čaka na vašo odobritev, preden pride na zemljevid."
msgstr[1] "%(count)d poslovalnici te trgovine čakata na vašo odobritev, preden prideta na zemljevid."
msgstr[2] "%(count)d poslovalnice te trgovine čakajo na vašo odobritev, preden pridejo na zemljevid."
msgstr[3] "%(count)d poslovalnic te trgovine čaka na vašo odobritev, preden pridejo na zemljevid."

msgid "%(name)s: %(count)d place approved, it is on the map as its owner wants."
msgid_plural "%(name)s: %(count)d places approved, they are on the map as their owner wants."
msgstr[0] "%(name)s: %(count)d poslovalnica odobrena, na zemljevidu je tako, kot želi lastnik."
msgstr[1] "%(name)s: %(count)d poslovalnici odobreni, na zemljevidu sta tako, kot želi lastnik."
msgstr[2] "%(name)s: %(count)d poslovalnice odobrene, na zemljevidu so tako, kot želi lastnik."
msgstr[3] "%(name)s: %(count)d poslovalnic odobrenih, na zemljevidu so tako, kot želi lastnik."

msgid "%(name)s changed its places while you were reading: look at its line again, then approve."
msgstr "%(name)s je med vašim branjem spremenila svoje poslovalnice: še enkrat poglejte njeno vrstico, nato odobrite."

msgid "Write the number alone: digits, spaces and the signs + ( ) . / -"
msgstr "Napišite samo številko: števke, presledke in znake + ( ) . / -"

#, python-format
msgid "Register added: «%(name)s»."
msgstr "Blagajna dodana: »%(name)s«."

#, python-format
msgid "Updated on %(day)s"
msgstr "Posodobljeno %(day)s"

msgid "Opened from the home screen of an iPhone? Paste here the pairing you copied in Safari, or the link the owner sent you."
msgstr "Odprta z začetnega zaslona iPhona? Sem prilepite seznanitev, ki ste jo kopirali v Safariju ali povezavo, ki vam jo je poslal lastnik."

msgid "Pair this register"
msgstr "Seznani to blagajno"

msgid "To open the register from the home screen: copy its pairing, add the page to the home screen (Share, then «Add to Home Screen»), open it from there and paste the pairing. The home screen does not see what Safari keeps."
msgstr "Da odprete blagajno z začetnega zaslona: kopirajte njeno seznanitev, dodajte stran na začetni zaslon (Deli, nato »Dodaj na začetni zaslon«), jo odprite od tam in prilepite seznanitev. Začetni zaslon ne vidi tega, kar hrani Safari."

msgid "Copy the pairing"
msgstr "Kopiraj seznanitev"

msgid "The pairing of this register"
msgstr "Seznanitev te blagajne"

msgid "Copied. Now add the page to the home screen, open it from there and paste the pairing."
msgstr "Kopirano. Zdaj dodajte stran na začetni zaslon, jo odprite od tam in prilepite seznanitev."

msgid "It could not be copied by itself: select the text in the field and copy it."
msgstr "Samodejno kopiranje ni uspelo: označite besedilo v polju in ga kopirajte."

msgid "On an iPhone, press «Copy the pairing» on the register before adding it to the home screen: opened from there the first time, it asks you to paste it."
msgstr "Na iPhonu na blagajni pritisnite »Kopiraj seznanitev«, preden jo dodate na začetni zaslon: ko jo prvič odprete od tam, vas prosi, da jo prilepite."
